<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabi Musa Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔna</para>
  <para style="mt1">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔna</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabi Musa Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Tawureta Musaa Kitabun yire singen naxan sɛbɛ, na xili “Dunuɲa Fɔlɔna.” Sora tonge suulun nan na ra. Ne yitaxunxi nɛn dɔxɔde naanin:</para>
  <para style="ip">Keli sora 1 ma han 11: Dunuɲa daan nun N Benba Adama nun Nmahawaa fe taruxun nun Nabi Nuhan ma fe taruxuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Keli sora 12 ma han 25: Nabi Iburahimaa fe taruxuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Keli sora 26 ma han 36: Nabi Isiyaga nun Nabi Yaxubaa fe taruxuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Keli sora 37 ma han 50: Nabi Yusufu a fe taruxuna</para>
  <para style="ip">En nɔɛ xaxili gbeen sɔtɛ nɛn Kitabun yireni ito barakani. Ala a yɛtɛ kɛɲaan nan makɛnɛnxi taruxuni itoe kui. A waxi a xɔn ma adamadiine xa tinxin nɛn. Koni adamadiine to yulubin nun hakɛn liga, Ala yi dunuɲa raxɔdɔxɔ e ma alogo e xa e sɔnne lu na. Fe ɲaxin mi rafan a ma feu! A mi muxu yo tima fe ɲaxin na. Muxun birin a yɛtɛ dɛntɛgɛma nɛn Ala xa lan a kɛwanle ma. Ala mɔn yulubi kanne yalagima nɛn. Koni Ala mi wama a xɔn adamadiine xa halagi. A waxi e mali feni alogo e xa tubi, e yi kisi a hinanna barakani.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1"/>A fɔlɔni, Ala yi kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna da. <verse eid="GEN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2"/>Dunuɲa mi yi yitɔnxi nun. A magenla nan yi a ra. Dimin nan yi na fufaan xun ma, koni Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin yi a masigama igen xun ma.<verse eid="GEN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “Kɛnɛnna xa mini.” Kɛnɛnna yi mini. <verse eid="GEN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4"/>Ala yi a mato, na kɛnɛnna fanxi. Ala yi kɛnɛnna nun dimini taxun. <verse eid="GEN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5"/>Ala yi kɛnɛnna xili sa “yanyina.” A yi dimin xili sa “kɔɛna.” Kɔɛ yi so, kuye yi yiba, lɔxɔ singen nan na ra.<verse eid="GEN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “Kore walaxan xa lu bɔxɔ igen nun kore igen tagi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7"/>Na yi findi naninna ra bɔxɔ igen nun kore igen tagi. A liga na kii nin. <verse eid="GEN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8"/>Ala yi naninni ito xili sa “kore xɔnna.” Kɔɛ yi so, kuye yi yiba, lɔxɔ firinden nan na ra.<verse eid="GEN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “Bɔxɔ igen xa a malan yire kedenni. Xaren xa maba.” A liga na kii nin. <verse eid="GEN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10"/>Ala yi na xaren xili sa “bɔxɔna.” A yi na bɔxɔ igen xili sa “baana.” Ala yi a mato, na fanxi. <verse eid="GEN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “Soli seene xa mini bɔxɔn ma. Sansiin birin xa soli, naxan yo naxan, bɔnsɔn kedenni. Sansi xɔnna naxan na sansi bogin kui, a solima nɛn birin nun a bɔnsɔnna.” A liga na kii nin. <verse eid="GEN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12"/>Ala yi sansiin birin nasoli bɔxɔn fari. Sansi xɔnna naxan na sansi bogin kui, a yi soli e nun a bɔnsɔnna. Ala yi a mato, na fanxi. <verse eid="GEN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13"/>Kɔɛ yi so, kuye yi yiba, lɔxɔ saxanden nan na ra.<verse eid="GEN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “Yanban seene xa lu koren ma, yanyin nun kɔɛɛn taxun feen na. Waxatin birin kolonma yanban seene sabun nan na. Xii yo xii, ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ a kolonma yanban seene sabun nan na. <verse eid="GEN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15"/>E xa dɛgɛ koren ma, e bɔxɔni yalan.” A liga na kii nin. <verse eid="GEN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16"/>Ala yi nayiyalanse xungbe firin nafala. Naxan xungbo han, na xa yanyin yamarin naba. Naxan xurun, na xa kɔɛɛn yamarin naba. A yi sarene fan nafala. <verse eid="GEN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17"/>Ala yi yanban seene sa koren ma alogo e xa bɔxɔni yalan, <verse eid="GEN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18"/>e yi yanyin nun kɔɛɛn yamarin naba, e yi dimin nun kɛnɛnni taxun. Ala yi a mato, a fanxi. <verse eid="GEN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19"/>Kɔɛ yi so, kuye yi yiba, lɔxɔ naaninden nan na ra.<verse eid="GEN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “Igen xa yimaxa niimaseene ra. Xɔline xa tugan kore.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21"/>Ala yi yɛxɛ xungbene da e nun niimaseen birin igeni, naxan yo naxan bɔnsɔn kedenni. A yi xɔline fan da, naxan yo naxan bɔnsɔn keden. Ala yi a mato, a fanxi. <verse eid="GEN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22"/>Ala yi barakan sa e fe yi, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xa wuya, ɛ yi yiriwa alogo yɛxɛne xa baan nafe. Xɔline fan xa gbo bɔxɔn ma.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23"/>Kɔɛ yi so, kuye yi yiba, lɔxɔ suulunden nan na ra.<verse eid="GEN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “Niimaseene xa lu bɔxɔn ma. Birin xa lu e nun a bɔnsɔnna. Xuruseene nun bubuseene nun burunna subene, e birin xa lu e nun e bɔnsɔnna.” A liga na kii nin. <verse eid="GEN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25"/>Ala yi burunna subene da naxan yo naxan bɔnsɔn keden. A yi xuruseene da naxan yo naxan bɔnsɔn keden. A yi bubuseene da naxan yo naxan bɔnsɔn keden. Ala yi a mato, a fanxi.<verse eid="GEN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “En xa adaman da en yɛtɛ misaala ra en maligan na. A xa sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ yɛxɛne nun xɔline nun xuruseene nun bɔxɔn nun bubuseene xun na.”<verse eid="GEN 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27"/>Ala yi adaman da a yɛtɛ misaala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 1:27">A e daxi Ala misaala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 1:27">a e da xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla.<verse eid="GEN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28"/>Ala yi barakan sa e fe yi, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ wuya ayi, ɛ yi yiriwa alogo bɔxɔn xa rafe. Ɛ sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ bɔxɔn nun yɛxɛne nun xɔline nun bubuseene xun na.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata sansiin birin nun sansi bogin birin fi ɛ ma balon na. <verse eid="GEN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30"/>N bata sansiin birin fi subene ma naxanye bɔxɔn ma, e nun xɔline nun bubuseene nun niimaseene, naxan yo yengima. Sansiin birin bata findi e balon na.” A liga na kii nin. <verse eid="GEN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31"/>Ala yi a daliseene birin mato, a fanxi han! Kɔɛ yi so, kuye yi yiba, lɔxɔ senninden nan na ra.<verse eid="GEN 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1"/>Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna daxi na kiini e nun e kui seen birin. <verse eid="GEN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2"/>Lɔxɔ soloferedeni Ala wanla yi kamali. A yi a matabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3"/>Ala yi barakan sa na lɔxɔ soloferedena fe yi, a xa findi lɔxɔ sariɲanxin na bayo a matabuxi na lɔxɔn nin. A wanla kamalixi na lɔxɔn nin.<verse eid="GEN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">N Benba Adama nun Nmahawa fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4"/>Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna taruxun ni i ra, e daxi waxatin naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Marigina Alatala bɔxɔn nun koren nafala waxatin naxan yi, <verse eid="GEN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5"/>soli se yo mi yi na. Sansi yo mi yi na naxan solixi bɔxɔn ma bayo Marigina Alatala munma yi tule igen nagodo singen. Adaman fan mi yi na naxan bɔxɔn nawalima. <verse eid="GEN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6"/>Koni xuyexuyenna yi minima bɔxɔn fari, a bɔxɔni kun. <verse eid="GEN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7"/>Marigina Alatala yi adaman nafala bɛndɛn na. Na xanbi ra, a yi niin fe a ɲɔɛni, adaman yi findi daɲɔxɔn na.<verse eid="GEN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8"/>Na xanbi Marigina Alatala yi nakɔ faɲin nafala sogeteden mabinni. Na yiren xili Eden. A yi adaman dɔxɔ mɛnni. <verse eid="GEN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9"/>Marigina Alatala yi wudin siyaan birin nasoli mɛnni, wudin naxan tofan, wudin naxan bogi donma a faɲin na. Na yiren tagi, wudi firin yi na yi. Kedenna xili siimaya wudina. A firinden xili fe faɲin nun fe ɲaxin kolon wudina.<verse eid="GEN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10"/>Xuden yi mini Eden nakɔni soli seene xa, a yi taxun, a findi xude naaninna ra. <verse eid="GEN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11"/>Na xude singen xili Pison. A danguma Xawila bɔxɔn birin ma, xɛmaan dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12"/>Na xɛmaan fan. Wudi igen xiri ɲaxumɛn fan na, e nun gɛmɛ tofaɲin naxan xili onixin. <verse eid="GEN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13"/>Na xude firinden xili Gihon. A danguma Kusi bɔxɔn birin ma. <verse eid="GEN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14"/>Na xude saxanden xili Tigiri. A danguma Asuri bɔxɔn ma a sogeteden binna ra. Na xude naaninden xili Efirati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15"/>Marigina Alatala yi adaman dɔxɔ Eden nakɔni nɛn alogo a xa na yiren nawali, a yi a kantan. <verse eid="GEN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16"/>Marigina Alatala yi yamarin so Adama yii, a naxa, “I nɔɛ wudini itoe bogin birin donɲɛ naxan Eden nakɔni, <verse eid="GEN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17"/>koni i nama fe faɲin nun fe ɲaxin kolon wudin bogin don, bayo i na a don, i faxama nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18"/>Marigina Alatala yi a fala, a naxa, “A mi lan xɛmɛn xa lu be a kedenna. N na a mali muxu faɲin dama nɛn a xa.”<verse eid="GEN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19"/>Burunna subene birin e nun xɔline birin Marigina Alatala naxanye rafalaxi bɛndɛn na, a yi e xali adaman fɛma a xa e xili sa. Adaman e xili sa kii naxan yi, na yi findi e xinle ra. <verse eid="GEN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20"/>A yi xuruseene birin nun xɔline birin nun burunna subene birin xili sa. Koni na waxatini Adaman munma yi a mali muxu faɲin sɔtɔ singen. <verse eid="GEN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21"/>Marigina Alatala yi xixɔnla radangu a ma. A yi a raxi ki faɲi. A to xi, Marigina Alatala yi a ɲɛnsɛn xɔri keden ba. A yi na ragali. <verse eid="GEN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22"/>Na xanbi, na ɲɛnsɛn xɔnna naxan kelixi adaman yi, Marigina Alatala yi na findi ɲaxanla ra, a yi fa a ra adama xɔn.<verse eid="GEN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23"/>Adama yi a fala, a naxa, “Iki, ito fataxi n xɔnna nan na. A mɔn fataxi n fatin nin. A xinla falama nɛn ‘ɲaxanla,’ bayo a minixi xɛmɛni nɛn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.23</char> Heburu xuiin naxan bunna nɛɛn “<char style="fk">xɛmɛna</char>” na maso <char style="fk">ɲaxanla</char> xinla ra Heburu xuini.</note> <verse eid="GEN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24"/>Nanara, xɛmɛna a nga nun a fafe beɲinma, a yi a maso a ɲaxanla ra, e findi fati bɛndɛ kedenna ra. <verse eid="GEN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25"/>Xɛmɛn nun a ɲaxanla magenla nan yi a ra nun, koni e mi yi yagima na ra.<verse eid="GEN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yulubi singena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1"/>Saɲin nan yi kɔta Marigina Alatalaa daliseene birin xa. A yi ɲaxanla maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɲɔndin na a ra ba, Ala bata a fala, fa fala wudi binla naxanye birin Eden nakɔni, ɛ nama e bogin don?” <verse eid="GEN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2"/>Ɲaxanla yi a yabi, a naxa, “Wudin naxanye Eden nakɔni, nxu nɔɛ e bogin donɲɛ nɛn, <verse eid="GEN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3"/>koni wudin naxan Eden nakɔɔn tagiyani, nxu mi nɔɛ na bogin donɲɛ, nxu mi nɔɛ nxu yiin dinɲɛ a ra. Xa na liga nxu faxama nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4"/>Saɲin yi a fala ɲaxanla xa, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn de! I mi faxama. <verse eid="GEN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5"/>Ala a kolon, i na a don, i yɛɛn nabima nɛn. I fama fe faɲin nun fe ɲaxin kolondeni nɛn alo Ala yɛtɛna.” <verse eid="GEN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6"/>Ɲaxanla to wudi bogin mato, a tofan, a fan donseen na, a fan xaxili sɔtɔ seen na, a yi a tongo. A yi a don. A yi nde tongo, a sa a so a xɛmɛn yii, naxan yi a fɛma. A fan yi a don. <verse eid="GEN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7"/>Na waxatini e yɛɛn yi rabi. E yi a kolon, a e magenla nan yi a ra. E yi xɔdɛ dɛɛne gira, e yi e dɛgɛ dugin na.<verse eid="GEN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8"/>Na xanbi ra, xɛmɛn nun a ɲaxanla yi Marigina Alatala sigati xuiin mɛ nakɔni ɲinbaridɛɛn foye faɲini. E yi e luxun wudine tagi. <verse eid="GEN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9"/>Marigina Alatala yi a xili, a naxa, “Adama, i minɛn yi?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10"/>Adaman yi a ratin, a naxa, “N bata i xuiin mɛ Eden nakɔni, koni n bata gaxu, bayo n magenla na a ra. Awa, n bata n luxun.” <verse eid="GEN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11"/>Ala yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nde a yitaxi i ra a i magenla na a ra? I bata na wudi bogin don ba, n na i yamarixi naxan ma fe ra a i nama a don?” <verse eid="GEN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12"/>Adaman yi a yabi, a naxa, “Na ɲaxanla i naxan soxi n yii, na bata na wudi bogin so n yii, n yi a don.” <verse eid="GEN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13"/>Na xanbi, Marigina Alatala yi ɲaxanla maxɔdin, a naxa, “I nanse ligaxi?” Ɲaxanla yi a yabi, a naxa, “Saɲin nan n mayendenxi han n na a don.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14"/>Awa, Marigina Alatala yi a fala saɲin xa, a naxa, “I to bata ito liga, awa, n fan bata i danga xuruseene nun burunna subene birin tagi. I findima bubuseen nan na i kuiin xun na. I gbangbanna nan donma i ya dunuɲa yi gidini. <verse eid="GEN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15"/>N bata yaxuyaan naso i tan nun ɲaxanla tagi. N bata a raso i ya diine nun a diine fan tagi. Na ɲaxanla diina i xunni wuruma nɛn, i fan yi a sanna maxɔlɔ.” <verse eid="GEN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16"/>Ala yi a fala ɲaxanla xa, a naxa, “I fan, i tɔrɔma nɛn i ya dii barideni. Na tɔrɔn gboma ayi nɛn. I birama nɛn i ya xɛmɛn fɔxɔ ra. A i yamarima nɛn.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17"/>Ala yi a fala Adama xa, a naxa, “I bata bira i ya ɲaxanla fɔxɔ ra. I bata na wudin bogin don, n na i yamarixi wudin naxan ma fe ra, a i nama na don. Iki n bata bɔxɔn danga i ya fe ra. I tɔrɔma nɛn balo sɔtɔdeni i ya dunuɲa yi gidini. <verse eid="GEN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18"/>N ɲanle nun tansinne raminima nɛn bɔxɔn ma, koni i baloma siseene nan xɔn xɛɛn ma. <verse eid="GEN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19"/>I balon sɔtɔma i kuye wolonna nin han i xɛtɛma bɔxɔni waxatin naxan yi, bayo i kelixi na bɔxɔn nin. Bɛndɛn ni i ra, i mɔn xɛtɛma na bɛndɛn nin.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20"/>Adaman yi a ɲaxanla xili sa Nmahawa bayo a findima muxun birin nga nan na. <verse eid="GEN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21"/>Marigina Alatala yi dugin kidi daxina nde dɛgɛ Adama nun a ɲaxanla xa. A yi na ragodo e ma. <verse eid="GEN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22"/>Marigina Alatala yi a fala, a naxa, “Adaman bata findi alo en tan, bayo a bata fe faɲin nun fe ɲaxin kolon. A mi daxa a xa siimaya wudi bogin don, xa na mi a ra a mi faxama nun.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23"/>Marigina Alatala yi e ramini Eden nakɔni, a e xa sa bɔxɔn nawali e fataxi naxan na. <verse eid="GEN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24"/>A to Adama kedi, Ala yi maleka gubugubu kanne ti Eden sogeteden binna ra. A mɔn yi silanfanna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.24</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> tɛɛ daxin lu mɛnni naxan a firifirima na longonni kiraan kantan xinla ma siga siimaya wudin yireni.<verse eid="GEN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kayini nun Habila fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1"/>Adama yi Nmahawa kolon ɲaxanla ra. Nmahawa yi fudikan. E yi diin sɔtɔ naxan xili Kayini. Nmahawa yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala bata n mali dii xɛmɛn sɔtɔ feen na.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.1</char> <char style="fk">Kayini </char>maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn “Sɔtɔna.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2"/>Na xanbi, Nmahawa yi Kayini raburunna sɔtɔ dii xɛmɛna, naxan yi xili Habila. Habila, xuruse rabaan nan yi a ra. Kayini, xɛɛ biin nan yi a ra.<verse eid="GEN 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3"/>Na waxatin to dangu, Kayini yi fa sansi bogina ndee ra, a ne ba saraxan na Alatala xa. <verse eid="GEN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4"/>Koni Habila yi fa xuruse dii singen na e nun a turena. Alatala yi Habila nun a saraxan nasuxu, <verse eid="GEN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5"/>koni a mi Kayini nun a saraxan nasuxu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:5">Awa, Kayini yi xɔlɔ. A yɛtagin yi masara. <verse eid="GEN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6"/>Na xanbi, Alatala yi Kayini maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nanfera i xɔlɔxi? Nanfera i yɛtagin masaraxi? <verse eid="GEN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7"/>Xa i fe faɲin liga, n na rasuxuma nɛn, koni xa i fe ɲaxin liga, yulubina i ya dɛɛn na, a i mamɛlɛnma. I kata, i yi a nɔ.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8"/>Kayini yi a fala a xunyɛn xa, a naxa, “En siga xɛɛn ma.” E to so xɛɛn ma, Kayini yi a xunyɛn Habila suxu. A yi a faxa. <verse eid="GEN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9"/>Na xanbi Alatala yi Kayini maxɔdin, a naxa, “I xunyɛn Habila minɛn yi?” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “N mi a kolon. N tan nan n xunyɛn kantan muxun na ba?” <verse eid="GEN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “I nanse ligaxi? I tuli mati. I xunyɛn wunla n gbelegbelema bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11"/>N bata i danga bayo i bata i xunyɛn faxa. N na i kedima nɛn bɔxɔni ito ma i xunyɛn wunla dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12"/>I na bɔxɔn nawali, i mi balon sɔtɔma. I findima sigatiin nan na.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13"/>Kayini yi a fala Alatala xa, a naxa, “Na hakɛn goronna gbo n tan xun ma. <verse eid="GEN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14"/>Xa i bata n kedi to, n mi i toma sɔnɔn. N findima sigatiin nan na. Muxun naxan sa n toma, a n faxama nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15"/>Alatala yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, xa muxu yo i faxa, n na i gbeen ɲɔxɔma nɛn dɔxɔɲa ma solofere.” Alatala yi taxamasenna sa Kayini ma alogo xa naxan sa a to, a nama a faxa.<verse eid="GEN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16"/>Awa, Kayini yi a makuya Alatala ra. A sa dɔxɔ Nodi bɔxɔni Eden nakɔɔn sogetede binna ra. <verse eid="GEN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17"/>Kayini yi a ɲaxanla kolon ɲaxanla ra. A ɲaxanla yi fudikan. A yi diin sɔtɔ naxan xili Xanɔki. Kayini yi taan ti na yi. A yi a diin xili sa na taan xun ma.<verse eid="GEN 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18"/>Xanɔki nan Yiradi sɔtɔ. Yiradi yi Mehuyayɛli sɔtɔ. Mehuyayɛli yi Metusayɛli sɔtɔ. Metusayɛli yi Lameki sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19"/>Lameki yi ɲaxalan firin tongo. Kedenna xili Ada. Boden xili Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20"/>Ada yi Yabali sɔtɔ. Yabali, xuruse rabane nun bubu kanne baba nan yi a ra. <verse eid="GEN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21"/>Yabali xunyɛn xili Yubali. Yubali, konden maxane nun xulen fene baba nan yi a ra.<verse eid="GEN 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22"/>Sila fan yi diin sɔtɔ. A xili Tubali-Kayini. A tan, xabun nan yi a ra. A yi waliseen sifan birin nafalama sulan na, e nun wurena. Tubali-Kayini xunyɛn ɲaxalanmaan yi xili Nama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23"/>Lameki yi a fala a ɲaxanle xa, a naxa, “Ada nun Sila, ɛ tuli mati. Lameki a ɲaxanle, ɛ ɛ tuli mati n ma falan na. N bata xɛmɛna nde faxa n gbeen ɲɔxɔn na. N bata na banxulanna faxa bayo a bata n maxɔlɔ. <verse eid="GEN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24"/>Xa Kayini daxa a gbeen ɲɔxɔ dɔxɔɲa ma solofere, Lameki a gbeen ɲɔxɔma nɛn dɔxɔɲa ma tonge solofere e nun solofere.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25"/>Adama yi a ɲaxanla kolon ɲaxanla ra. A yi diin sɔtɔ naxan yi xili Seti. A na xili sa bayo Ala bata a diin Habila ɲɔxɔ so a yii Kayini naxan faxa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.25</char> <char style="fk">Seti </char>maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn “A bata a fi.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26"/>Seti fan yi diin sɔtɔ naxan xili Enosi. Na waxatini, muxune yi Alatala xinla binya fɔlɔ.<verse eid="GEN 4:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Adama han Nuhan</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 1.1-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1"/>Adama bɔnsɔnna taruxun ni ito ra. Ala to Adama da, a a findi a yɛtɛ maligan na, <verse eid="GEN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2"/>a e da xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla. A e baraka. A e xili sa “Adamana.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3"/>Adama to fori ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge saxan, a yi diin sɔtɔ a yɛtɛ maligan na naxan maso a ra. A yi a xili sa Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4"/>Seti bari xanbini, Adama yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5"/>Adama a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomanaanin ɲɛɛ tonge saxan. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa. <verse eid="GEN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6"/>Seti to bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ suulun, a yi Enosi bari. <verse eid="GEN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7"/>Enosi bari xanbini, Seti yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ ɲɛɛ solofere. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8"/>Seti a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomanaanin ɲɛɛ fu nun firin. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa.<verse eid="GEN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9"/>Enosi to bu ɲɛɛ tonge solomanaanin, a yi Kenan bari. <verse eid="GEN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10"/>Kenan bari xanbini, Enosi yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ ɲɛɛ fu nun suulun. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11"/>Enosi a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomanaanin ɲɛɛ suulun. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa.<verse eid="GEN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12"/>Kenan to bu ɲɛɛ tonge solofere, a yi Mahalaleli bari. <verse eid="GEN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13"/>Mahalaleli bari xanbini, Kenan yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ ɲɛɛ tonge naanin. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14"/>Kenan ma siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomanaanin ɲɛɛ fu. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa. <verse eid="GEN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15"/>Mahalaleli to bu ɲɛɛ tonge sennin e nun suulun, a yi Yarɛdi bari. <verse eid="GEN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16"/>Yarɛdi bari xanbini, Mahalaleli yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ ɲɛɛ tonge saxan. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17"/>Mahalaleli a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ ɲɛɛ tonge solomanaanin ɲɛɛ suulun. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa.<verse eid="GEN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18"/>Yarɛdi to bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge sennin e nun firin, a yi Xenɔki bari. <verse eid="GEN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19"/>Xenɔki bari xanbini, Yarɛdi yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20"/>Yarɛdi a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomanaanin ɲɛɛ tonge sennin e nun firin. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa.<verse eid="GEN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21"/>Xenɔki to bu ɲɛɛ tonge sennin ɲɛɛ suulun, a yi Matusela bari. <verse eid="GEN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22"/>Matusela bari xanbini, Xenɔki yi bira Ala fɔxɔ ra ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ saxan. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23"/>Xenɔki a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ saxan ɲɛɛ tonge sennin e nun suulun. <verse eid="GEN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24"/>Xenɔki yi sigan tima e nun Ala. Na xanbi ra, a mi lu na sɔnɔn, bayo Ala bata a xali, a mi faxa.<verse eid="GEN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25"/>Matusela to bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge solomasɛxɛ ɲɛɛ solofere, a yi Lameki bari. <verse eid="GEN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26"/>Lameki bari xanbini, Matusela yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solofere ɲɛɛ tonge solomasɛxɛ e nun firin. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27"/>Matusela a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomanaanin ɲɛɛ tonge sennin e nun solomanaanin. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28"/>Lameki to bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge solomasɛxɛ e nun firin, a yi diin sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29"/>A yi a xili sa Nuhan. A yi a fala, a naxa, “A tan nan a ligama en ɲinan en ma tɔrɔn nun en ma wanla ra, bayo Alatala bata bɔxɔn danga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.29</char> <char style="fk">Nuhan</char> maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn “madɛndɛnna.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30"/>Nuhan bari xanbini, Lameki yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ suulun ɲɛɛ tonge solomanaanin ɲɛɛ suulun. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31"/>Lameki a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solofere ɲɛɛ tonge solofere e nun solofere. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa.<verse eid="GEN 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32"/>Nuhan to bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ suulun, a yi Semi nun Xami nun Yepeti sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa kala kiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1"/>Muxune wuya fɔlɔ bɔxɔn fari waxatin naxan yi, e yi dii tɛmɛne bari. <verse eid="GEN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2"/>Daɲɔxɔn naxanye fata Ala konna ra, na ndee yi yabu dii tɛmɛne ra, bayo e tofan. E yi ndee yɛ matongo, e yi e findi e ɲaxanle ra.<verse eid="GEN 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3"/>Na xanbi ra, Alatala yi a fala, a naxa, “N mi tinɲɛ n ma Niin xa bu adaman fatini habadan, bayo daliseen na a ra. A mi danguma ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na.”<verse eid="GEN 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4"/>Na waxatini, e nun waxatin naxan fa na xanbi ra, Nefilimi muxu magaxuxine nan yi na dunuɲa yi. Na daɲɔxɔne nun na dii tɛmɛne nan ne barixi. E findi sofa magaxuxine nan na na waxatine yi e nun xili kanne.<verse eid="GEN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5"/>Alatala yi a to adamadina ɲaxuyaan bata gbo ayi bɔxɔn fari. A miriyane findixi fe kobin nan na waxatin birin. <verse eid="GEN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6"/>Na yi Alatala tɔrɔ han a yi nimisa adaman da feen na. Na yi a bɔɲɛn tɔrɔ. <verse eid="GEN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7"/>Alatala yi a fala, a naxa, “Adaman birin n naxan daxi, n na birin ɲanma nɛn dunuɲa yi. Muxu ba, sube ba, bubuse ba, xɔliin naxan tuganma kore ba, n na birin naxɔrima nɛn dunuɲa yi, bayo n bata nimisa adaman da feen na.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8"/>Koni, Nuhan yi rafan Alatala ma.<verse eid="GEN 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9"/>Nuhan bɔnsɔnna taruxun ni ito ra. Muxu tinxinxin nan yi Nuhan na na waxatini. Fɛ yo mi yi a ra. A yi biraxi Ala fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="GEN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10"/>Nuhan dii saxan nan sɔtɔ: Semi nun Xami nun Yepeti.<verse eid="GEN 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhan yi kunkin nafala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11"/>Dunuɲa bata yi kala Ala yɛɛ ra yi. A bata yi rafe fe ɲaxin na. <verse eid="GEN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12"/>Ala yi dunuɲa to, a kalaxi, muxun birin fe ɲaxin fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="GEN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13"/>Awa, Ala yi a fala Nuhan xa, a naxa, “N waxi adaman birin naxɔri feni dunuɲa yi, bayo dunuɲa bata rafe fe kobin na. N waxi adaman birin nun bɔxɔn birin kala feni. <verse eid="GEN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14"/>Awa, i xa Goferi wudin nafala kunkin na. Konkone xa lu a kui. I dolen sa a kuiin nun a fanna ma. <verse eid="GEN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15"/>I xa a rafala i kiini: A kuyan xa findi nɔngɔnna yɛ kɛmɛ saxan na, a yigbona tonge suulun, a yitena tonge saxan. <verse eid="GEN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16"/>I a xunna soon nafala. A xa dangu nɔngɔnna yɛɲa ma keden na. I a dɛɛn ti a dɛxɔn ma. I xa kunkin kuini taxun dɔxɔɲa ma saxan.”<verse eid="GEN 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17"/>“N tan igen nadinma nɛn dunuɲa yi. A muxun birin halagi. Niimaseen birin faxama nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18"/>Koni n bata layirin tongo i xa. I so kunkini ito kui, i tan nun i ya diine nun i ya ɲaxanla, e nun i ya diine ɲaxanle. <verse eid="GEN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19"/>I xa fa daliseen sifan birin firin firinna ra, a xɛmɛn nun a gilɛna alogo e xa kisi. <verse eid="GEN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20"/>Xɔliin bɔnsɔnna birin firin firin, suben bɔnsɔnna birin firin firin, bubuseen bɔnsɔnna birin firin firin, e fama i xɔn, i yi e rakisi. <verse eid="GEN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21"/>I xa donseen sifan birin xali kunkin kui. I xa sa a mara i tan xa e nun e fan xa.”<verse eid="GEN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22"/>Nuhan yi a birin liga alo Ala a yamarixi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="GEN 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Fufa gbeena fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Nuhan xa, a naxa, “So kunkin kui, i tan nun i ya denbayaan birin, bayo tinxin muxun nan i ra waxatini ito yi. <verse eid="GEN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2"/>Sube radaxaxi yo sube radaxaxi, i xa na solofere raso kunkin kui, a xɛmɛn nun a gilɛna. Sube raharamuxi yo sube raharamuxi i xa na firin naso, a xɛmɛn nun a gilɛna. <verse eid="GEN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3"/>Xɔliin fan sifan birin, solofere tongo, a xɛmɛn nun a gilɛna, alogo daliseen sifan birin xa lu dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4"/>Xi solofere na dangu, n tulen nagodoma bɔxɔn ma nɛn, soge tonge naanin, kɔɛ tonge naanin. N niimaseen naxan birin daxi, na birin halagima nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5"/>Nuhan yi na birin liga Alatala a yamari naxan na.<verse eid="GEN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6"/>Fufaan mini waxatin naxan yi, Nuhan ma siimayaan ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ sennin nan yi a ra. <verse eid="GEN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7"/>Nuhan nun a diine nun a ɲaxanla nun a diine ɲaxanle yi keli igen yɛɛ ra, e yi so kunkin kui. <verse eid="GEN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8"/>Sube radaxaxine nun sube raharamuxine, xɔline nun bubuseene, <verse eid="GEN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9"/>a xɛmɛn nun a gilɛna, e yi siga Nuhan fɛma firin firin. E yi so kunkin kui alo Ala a yamari Nuhan ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="GEN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10"/>Xii solofere dangu xanbini, na fufaan yi din dunuɲa ra. <verse eid="GEN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11"/>Nuhan ma siimayaan yi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ sennin, kike firin, xi fu nun solofere. Igen naxan bɔxɔni, na yi te fɔlɔ, e nun igen naxan kore, na fan yi godo fɔlɔ. <verse eid="GEN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12"/>Tulen yi fa bɔxɔn ma soge tonge naanin, kɔɛ tonge naanin.<verse eid="GEN 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13"/>Na lɔxɔ yɛtɛni, Nuhan nun a diine, Semi nun Xami nun Yepeti e nun a ɲaxanla nun a dii saxanne ɲaxanle, ne birin yi so kunkin kui. <verse eid="GEN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14"/>Burunna suben bɔnsɔnna birin nun xuruseen bɔnsɔnna birin nun bubuseen bɔnsɔnna birin nun xɔliin bɔnsɔnna birin, e yi so kunkin kui. <verse eid="GEN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15"/>Daliseen birin naxan yengima, a firin firin, e yi fa Nuhan fɛma. E yi so kunkin kui. <verse eid="GEN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16"/>Niimaseen birin, a xɛmɛn nun a gilɛna, e yi so kunkin kui alo Ala a yamari Nuhan ma kii naxan yi. Na xanbi ra, Alatala yi dɛɛn balan.<verse eid="GEN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17"/>Xi tonge naanin fufaan yi mini. A yi kunkini te. <verse eid="GEN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18"/>Igen to gbo bɔxɔn ma, kunkin yi dɔxɔ igen fari. <verse eid="GEN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19"/>Igen yi te han a yi sa geyaan birin xun ma dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="GEN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20"/>Igen yi sa geyane xun ma han nɔngɔnna yɛ fu nun naanin. <verse eid="GEN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21"/>Niimaseen naxanye birin yi dunuɲa yi, ne birin yi halagi: xɔli yo, xuruse yo, burunna sube yo, bubuse yo, e nun adamadiin birin. <verse eid="GEN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22"/>Niimaseen naxanye birin yi xaren na, naxanye yengima, ne birin yi halagi. <verse eid="GEN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23"/>Niimaseen naxanye yi bɔxɔ xɔnna ma, na birin yi raxɔri: adamadiine nun subene nun bubuseene e nun xɔline, fɔ Nuhan kedenna, e nun naxanye yi a fɛma kunkin kui. <verse eid="GEN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24"/>Fufaan yi din dunuɲa ra xii kɛmɛ xii tonge suulun.<verse eid="GEN 7:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Fufaan ɲan fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1"/>Koni Ala yi a xaxili lu Nuhan xɔn ma, e nun burunna subene, e nun xuruseen naxanye yi a fɛma kunkin kui. Ala yi foyen nafa dunuɲa yi. Igen yi godo fɔlɔ. <verse eid="GEN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2"/>Igen naxan yi kelima bɔxɔn bun ma, na yi dan. Igen naxan yi kelima kore, na fan yi dan. <verse eid="GEN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3"/>Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ fɔ nde ba igen na. Xii kɛmɛ xii tongo suulunna bun ma, igen yi yelin godɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4"/>Kike soloferen xii fu nun soloferedeni, kunkin yi dɔxɔ geyaan fari, naxan xili Ararati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5"/>Igen yi lu godɛ han kike fudeni. Kike fuden xii singe lɔxɔni, geyane xunne yi mini kɛnɛnni.<verse eid="GEN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6"/>Xii tonge naanin dangu xanbini, Nuhan yi kunkin foye soden nabi, a bata yi naxan nafala a ma. <verse eid="GEN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7"/>A yi xaxaan beɲin. Na yi a firifiri, han igen yi yelin godɛ. <verse eid="GEN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8"/>Nuhan mɔn yi ganban beɲin, a xa sa igen mato xa a bata godo. <verse eid="GEN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9"/>Koni na ganban mi san tide to, bayo igen yi dinxi dunuɲa birin na. A yi xɛtɛ Nuhan ma kunkin kui. Nuhan yi ganban suxu a yiin na, a a raso kunkin kui.<verse eid="GEN 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10"/>A yi a mamɛ han xii solofere. A mɔn yi ganban beɲin a firindeni. <verse eid="GEN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11"/>Ɲinbanna ra ganban yi xɛtɛ Nuhan ma, oliwi wudi binla ɲɔxɔnde xinden suxi a dɛɛ ra. Awa, Nuhan yi a kolon a igen bata ba dunuɲa xun ma. <verse eid="GEN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12"/>A mɔn yi a mamɛ xi solofere. A mɔn yi ganban beɲin, koni ganban mi xɛtɛ a ma.<verse eid="GEN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13"/>Nuhan ma siimayaan to siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ sennin ɲɛɛ keden, kike keden, xi keden, fufaan yi ɲan dunuɲa yi. Nuhan to kunkin xunna ba, a yi a to bɔxɔn maxaraxi. <verse eid="GEN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14"/>Kike firin xi mɔxɔɲɛn nun solofere to dangu, bɔxɔn yi xara gben! <verse eid="GEN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15"/>Ala yi a fala Nuhan xa, a naxa, <verse eid="GEN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16"/>“Ɛ mini kunkin kui, i tan nun i ya ɲaxanla nun i ya diine, e nun i ya diine ɲaxanle. <verse eid="GEN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17"/>I xa niimaseen birin namini kunkin kui: xɔline nun subene e nun bubuseene, alogo e xa wuya, e xa yiriwa dunuɲa yi.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18"/>Awa, Nuhan yi mini, e nun a diine nun a ɲaxanla nun a diine ɲaxanle. <verse eid="GEN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19"/>Subene fan yi mini e nun bubuseene nun xɔline. Niimaseen birin, bɔnsɔn yo bɔnsɔn, e mini e danna.<verse eid="GEN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20"/>Na xanbi ra, Nuhan yi saraxa ganden nafala Alatala xinli. A yi sube radaxaxina ndee tongo e nun xɔli radaxaxina ndee. A yi ne ba saraxan na, ne yi sa tɛɛni. <verse eid="GEN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21"/>Tutun to te, Alatala yi na gan xirin mɛ. A yi rafan a ma. A yi a fala a bɔɲɛni, a naxa, “N mi bɔxɔn dangama sɔnɔn adamana fe ra, bayo n na a kolon adama bɔɲɛn mi fan xabu a dii ɲɔrɛya waxatini. N mi niimaseen birin halagima sɔnɔn alo n na singen liga kii naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22"/>Fanni bɔxɔn daxi, xɛɛ bi waxatin nun se xaba waxatina, xunbenla nun kuye wolonna, soge furen nun ɲɛmɛna, yanyin nun kɔɛna, ne waxatine mi fa bama e kiini sɔnɔn.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Ala yi a layiri tongo Nuhan xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Ala yi barakan sa Nuhan nun a diine fe yi. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xa diin bari, ɛ xa wuya, ɛ xa bɔxɔn nafe. <verse eid="GEN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2"/>Suben birin gaxuma ɛ yɛɛ ra nɛn naxanye bɔxɔn ma, xɔliin naxanye birin kore, bubuseen birin, yɛxɛn naxan birin baani, ɛ luma nɛn ne birin xun na. <verse eid="GEN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3"/>Niimaseen naxan birin yengima e findima nɛn ɛ balon na. N sansine so ɛ yii kii naxan yi a singeni, iki n bata niimaseen birin fan so ɛ yii na kiini.”<verse eid="GEN 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4"/>“Koni ɛ nama sube yifaxin don bayo a niin wunla a yi. <verse eid="GEN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5"/>Ɛ dɛntɛgɛn sama n xa niin wunla nan ma fe ra. Suben fan dɛntɛgɛn sama n xa niin wunla nan ma fe ra. Adaman dɛntɛgɛn sama n xa nɛn a adaman boden niin wunla a fe ra. <verse eid="GEN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6"/>Muxun naxan muxun niin bama, muxun nan a fan niin bama, bayo Ala bata adaman da a misaala ra. <verse eid="GEN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7"/>Ɛ xa diin bari, ɛ xa wuya, ɛ xa bɔxɔn nafe ɛ yi yiriwa ayi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8"/>Na xanbi ra, Ala yi a fala Nuhan xa e nun a diine, <verse eid="GEN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9"/>a naxa, “N yɛtɛɛn bata layirin tongo ɛ xa e nun ɛ mamandenne, <verse eid="GEN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10"/>e nun niimaseen naxan birin yi ɛ fɛma kunkin kui: xɔline nun xuruseene nun burunna subene e nun niimaseen naxan birin dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="GEN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11"/>N bata layirin tongo ɛ xa: fufaan mi niin birin bama sɔnɔn. Fufaan mi dunuɲa birin kalama sɔnɔn.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata layirin tongo ɛ nun ɛ mamandenne xa e nun niimaseen birin xa. <verse eid="GEN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13"/>N sengunna yitama nɛn koren ma, naxan findima layirin taxamasenna ra n tan nun bɔxɔn tagi. <verse eid="GEN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14"/>N na tulen sa koren ma, sengunna minima nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15"/>Na waxatini na layirina fe rabirama n ma nɛn, n layirin naxan tongoxi ɛ xa e nun niimaseen birin xa. N mi niin birin bama dunuɲa yi fufaan na sɔnɔn. <verse eid="GEN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16"/>Sengunna na mini koren ma, n na a to, na layirina fe rabirama n ma nɛn, layirin naxan luma habadan, n layirin naxan tongoxi ɛ xa e nun niimaseen birin xa naxanye dunuɲa yi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17"/>Awa, Ala yi a fala Nuhan xa, a naxa, “Sengunni ito findixi layiri taxamasenna nan na, n nun niimaseen birin tagi dunuɲa yi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18"/>Nuhan ma diin naxanye mini kunkin kui, e xili Semi nun Xami nun Yepeti. Kanan kaane baba nan yi Xami ra. <verse eid="GEN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19"/>Muxun naxan birin wuyaxi dunuɲa yi, a kelixi Nuhan ma dii saxanne nin.<verse eid="GEN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhan yi dangan ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20"/>Nuhan xɛɛ rawanla nan yi a ra. A yi manpa binla sansiin si langan kui.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21"/>Na sansiin to bogi, Nuhan yi manpaan nafala, a yi a min, a xunna yi keli. A yi a sa bubun kui a magenla ra. <verse eid="GEN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22"/>Xami, Kanan kaane baba yi a baba magenla to. A yi na fala a tadane xa. <verse eid="GEN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23"/>Semi nun Yepeti yi dugin tongo, e yi siga e xanbiramaan na. E yi dugin sa e baba fari, koni e mi e baba magenla to.<verse eid="GEN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24"/>Nuhan xunna to dɔxɔ, a keli, a yi a kolon a bolokada naxan ligaxi a ra. <verse eid="GEN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25"/>Nuhan yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata Kanan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.29</char> Nuhan a mamandenna <char style="fk">Kanan</char> nan danga. A mi a dii yo danga. Semi yixɛtɛna nde Yaxuba yixɛtɛne nan Kanan yixɛtɛne raxɔri Isirayila bɔxɔni, na yi findi dangan bunna ra. Na yɛngɛna fe sɛbɛxi Yosuwe kitabu yiren kui. A mi sɛbɛxi yire yo yi fa fala Kanan yixɛtɛne siga nɛn fati fɔrɛ bɔxɔni. A yixɛtɛ dando naxanye luxi e nii ra yɛngɛn xanbi ra, ne yi basan Yaxuba yixɛtɛne ra han Kanan muxu yo mi lu. Yanyina nde fati fɔrɛne fe sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 10.6 kui.</note> danga. A findima konyi dɔnxɛn nan na a tadane xa.” <verse eid="GEN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26"/>A mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata barikan bira Alatala xa, Semi a Ala. Kanan xa findi Semi a konyin na. <verse eid="GEN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27"/>Ala xa Yepeti a bɔxɔn gbo ayi. Yepeti xa lu Semi a bubun kui. Kanan xa findi Yepeti a konyin na.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28"/>Fufaan ɲan xanbini, Nuhan yi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ saxan ɲɛɛ tonge suulun sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29"/>Nuhan ma siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ solomanaanin ɲɛɛ tonge suulun. Na xanbi ra, a yi faxa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 9:29">Nuhan ma diine, Semi nun Xami nun Yepeti a taruxun nan na ra.<verse eid="GEN 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Semi nun Xami nun Yepeti yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 1.5-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1"/>Nuhan ma diine bɔnsɔnne taruxun ni i ra, Semi nun Xami nun Yepeti naxanye diine bari fufaan dangu xanbini.<verse eid="GEN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2"/>Yepeti a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Gomɛrɛ nun Magogo nun Madayi nun Yawani nun Tubali nun Mesɛki e nun Tirasi.<verse eid="GEN 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3"/>Gomɛrɛ a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Asikenasi nun Rifati nun Togarama.<verse eid="GEN 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4"/>Yawani a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Elisaha nun Tarasisi nun Sipiri nun Rodanimi. <verse eid="GEN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5"/>Muxuni itoe diine yi dɔxɔ fɔxɔ igen dɛ. E na siga dɛnaxan yi, e xabilayaan fɔlɔ mɛnni. Na xabilane yi findi siya gbɛtɛne ra, birin nun e kon xuina.<verse eid="GEN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6"/>Xami a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Kusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.6</char> Muxune laxi a ra a <char style="fk">Kusi</char> yixɛtɛna nde siga nɛn fati fɔrɛne bɔxɔni. Yanyina nde fati fɔrɛne benban findɛ a yixɛtɛna nde ra. A fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Yatɛne 12.1 nun Esayi 20 nun Sofoni 3.10 kui e nun yire wuyaxi gbɛtɛ. Nuhan Kusi xunyɛ <char style="fk">Kanan</char> nan danga. Na feen sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 9.25 kui.</note> nun Misiran nun Puti nun Kanan.<verse eid="GEN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7"/>Kusi a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Sɛba nun Xawila nun Sabata nun Raama nun Sabiteka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:7">Raama a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Saba e nun Dedan.<verse eid="GEN 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8"/>Kusi fan diin sɔtɔ nɛn naxan xili Nimirodi. Na findi yɛngɛso gbeen nan na dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="GEN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9"/>Nimirodi fan, donso gbeen nan yi a ra Alatala yɛɛ ra yi. Nanara, muxune a falama, e naxa, “I luxi alo Nimirodi, donso gbeen nan yi a ra Alatala yɛɛ ra yi.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10"/>A mangayaan liga nɛn taani itoe ma singen: Babilɔn nun Ereki nun Akadi nun Kalene taan naxan Sinari bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11"/>A yi keli Sinari yi, a yi siga Asiriya bɔxɔni. Mɛnni, a yi taane ti naxanye xili Niniwa nun Rehoboti nun Iri nun Kala <verse eid="GEN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12"/>e nun Resen, taa gbeen naxan Niniwa nun Kala tagi.<verse eid="GEN 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13"/>Misiran yi findi muxuni itoe benban na: Ludu kaane nun Anami kaane nun Lehaba kaane nun Nafatu kaane <verse eid="GEN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14"/>nun Patirusu kaane nun Kasaluxu kaane, Filisitine keli dɛnaxan yi, e nun Kafatoro kaane.<verse eid="GEN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15"/>Kanan yi findi muxuni itoe baba ra: Sidɔn, a dii singena, e nun Xitine <verse eid="GEN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16"/>nun Yebusune nun Amorine nun Girigasane <verse eid="GEN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17"/>nun Xiwine nun Arakane nun Sini kaane <verse eid="GEN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18"/>nun Arawada kaane nun Sɛmara kaane nun Xamata kaane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:18">Na xanbi ra, Kanan bɔnsɔnne birin yi xuya ayi. <verse eid="GEN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19"/>Kanan bɔxɔn naninna yi kelixi Sidɔn han sa dɔxɔ Gerari taan na, a yi siga han Gasa, a yi dangu Sodoma nun Gomora nun Adamaha nun Seboyimi yi, han sa dɔxɔ Lasa ra.<verse eid="GEN 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20"/>Xami a muxune ni itoe ra, fata e bɔnsɔnna nun e xuiin na e nun e bɔxɔne, e nun e siyane.<verse eid="GEN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21"/>Semi, Yepeti tada fan yi diine sɔtɔ. Semi findi Eberi a diine benban nan na.<verse eid="GEN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22"/>Semi a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Elan nun Asuri nun Arapaxadi nun Ludu e nun Arami.<verse eid="GEN 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23"/>Arami a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Yusu nun Xulu nun Geteri e nun Mesɛki.<verse eid="GEN 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24"/>Arapaxadi yi Selaxa sɔtɔ. Selaxa yi Eberi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25"/>Eberi yi dii firin sɔtɔ. Keden xili Pɛlɛgi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.25</char> <char style="fk">Pɛlɛgi</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Mayitaxunna.”</note> bayo dunuɲa yitaxun a waxatin nin. A xunyɛn xili Yokatan. <verse eid="GEN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26"/>Yokatan ma diine xinle ni itoe ra: Alomodadi nun Selefa nun Xasaramaweti nun Yera <verse eid="GEN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27"/>nun Hadoran nun Yusali nun Dikila <verse eid="GEN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28"/>nun Obala nun Abimayele nun Saba <verse eid="GEN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29"/>nun Ofiri nun Xawila nun Yobabo. Ne birin baba nan yi Yokatan na. <verse eid="GEN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30"/>E bɔxɔn yi kelixi Mesa sa dɔxɔ han Sefare, naxan geyaan sogeteden binni.<verse eid="GEN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31"/>Semi a diine ni i ra, fata e bɔnsɔnne nun e xuine nun e bɔxɔne nun e siyane ra.<verse eid="GEN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32"/>Nuhan ma diine bɔnsɔnne nan ne ra e siyane yɛɛn ma. Fufaan dangu xanbini, bɔnsɔnni itoe yi findi siyane birin na dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="GEN 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Xuine yitaxun fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1"/>Na waxatini, dunuɲa birin yi xui keden nan falama. <verse eid="GEN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2"/>Muxuna ndee to siga sogeteden binni, e yi dɔxɔ Sinari lanbanni. <verse eid="GEN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3"/>E yi a fala e bode xa, e naxa, “En siga, en xa bitikidin bɔnbɔ, en xa a gan.” E yi bitikidine dɔxɔ gɛmɛne ɲɔxɔni. E yi dolen findi bitikidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.3</char> <char style="fk">Bitikidin</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Birikidina</char>.”</note> dɔxɔ seen na. <verse eid="GEN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4"/>Na xanbi ra, e yi a fala, e naxa, “En siga, en xa taan ti en yɛtɛ xa, e nun sanganso gbeen naxan tema han kore, alogo en xinla xa gbo ayi. Nanara, en nama xuya ayi dunuɲa xun xɔn.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5"/>Koni Alatala yi godo na taan nun sanganso gbeen matodeni muxune naxan ti. <verse eid="GEN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6"/>Alatala yi a fala, a naxa, “Muxuni itoe, naxanye siya keden, xui keden a ra, xa ne bata wanli ito fɔlɔ, wanla birin e waxi naxan kɛ feni sɔnɔn, e na ligama nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7"/>En siga, en godo e xuiin basandeni alogo e nama e bode xuiin mɛ.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8"/>Alatala yi e raxuya ayi. Na taan ti feen yi dan. <verse eid="GEN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9"/>Na yiren yi xili Babeli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.9</char> <char style="fk">Babeli</char> maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Mayibasanna.”</note> bayo Alatala bata dunuɲa xuine basan e bode ra na yi. Fɔlɔ mɛnni, Alatala yi e raxuya ayi dunuɲa birin ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Semi han Tera</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 1.24-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10"/>Semi bɔnsɔnna taruxun ni i ra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 11:10">Fufaan dangu ɲɛɛn firinna, Semi a siimayaan yi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ sɔtɔ. A yi a diin sɔtɔ naxan xili Arapaxadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11"/>Arapaxadi bari xanbini, Semi mɔn yi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ suulun sɔtɔ. A yi dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12"/>Arapaxadi to ɲɛɛ tonge suulun nun suulun sɔtɔ, a yi Selaxa bari. <verse eid="GEN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13"/>A to Selaxa sɔtɔ, Arapaxadi yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ naanin ɲɛɛ saxan. A yi dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14"/>Selaxa to ɲɛɛ tonge saxan sɔtɔ, a yi Eberi bari. <verse eid="GEN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15"/>A to Eberi sɔtɔ, Selaxa yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ naanin ɲɛɛ saxan. A yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16"/>Eberi to ɲɛɛ tonge saxan e nun naanin sɔtɔ, a yi Pɛlɛgi bari. <verse eid="GEN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17"/>A to Pɛlɛgi sɔtɔ, Eberi yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ naanin ɲɛɛ tonge saxan. A yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18"/>Pɛlɛgi to ɲɛɛ tonge saxan sɔtɔ, a yi Rewu bari. <verse eid="GEN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19"/>A to Rewu sɔtɔ, Pɛlɛgi yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ firin ɲɛɛ solomanaanin. A yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20"/>Rewu to ɲɛɛ tonge saxan nun firin sɔtɔ, a yi Serugu bari. <verse eid="GEN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21"/>A to Serugu sɔtɔ, Rewu yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ firin ɲɛɛ solofere. A yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22"/>Serugu to ɲɛɛ tonge saxan sɔtɔ, a yi Nahori bari. <verse eid="GEN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23"/>A to Nahori sɔtɔ, Serugu yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ firin. A yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24"/>Nahori to ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomanaanin sɔtɔ, a yi Tera bari. <verse eid="GEN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25"/>A to Tera sɔtɔ, Nahori yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ fu nun solomanaanin. A yi dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛ gbɛtɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26"/>Tera to ɲɛɛ tonge solofere sɔtɔ, a yi Iburama nun Nahori nun Haran bari.<verse eid="GEN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tera a denbayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27"/>Tera bɔnsɔnna taruxun ni i ra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 11:27">Tera yi Iburama nun Nahori nun Haran bari. Haran yi Loti bari. <verse eid="GEN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28"/>Benun Tera xa faxa, a diin Haran yi faxa Yuru taani Babilɔn bɔxɔni, a barixi dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29"/>Iburama nun Nahori yi ɲaxanle futu. Iburama ɲaxanla yi xili Sarayi. Nahori a ɲaxanla xili Milika. Milika baba nan yi Haran na. Haran dii firin nan sɔtɔ, Milika nun Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30"/>Gbantan nan yi Sarayi ra. Dii yo mi yi a yii.<verse eid="GEN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31"/>Tera yi a denbayaan xali, a dii Iburama, e nun a mamandenna Loti, Haran ma diina, e nun a mamandenna Sarayi, Iburamaa ɲaxanla. E birin yi keli Yuru taani Babilɔn bɔxɔni alogo e xa siga Kanan bɔxɔni. Koni e to Xarani taan li, e yi dɔxɔ mɛnni.<verse eid="GEN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32"/>Tera yi bu ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ firin ɲɛɛ suulun. A yi faxa Xarani yi.<verse eid="GEN 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ala yi Iburama xili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Iburama xa, a naxa, “Keli i ya yamanan nun i xabilan nun i babaa genli. I siga na yamanani n naxan yitama i ra. <verse eid="GEN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2"/>N ni i findima siya gbeen na nɛn. N na i barakama nɛn, n ni i findi xili kanna ra. Muxune fan duban sɔtɔma nɛn i tan barakani. <verse eid="GEN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3"/>Naxan na duba i xa, n fan na kanna barakama nɛn. Naxan na i danga, n fan dangan nagidima na kanna ma nɛn. Dunuɲa xabilane birin duban sɔtɔma nɛn i tan barakani.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4"/>Awa, a siin ɲɛɛ tonge solofere e nun suulunna sɔtɔ waxatin naxan yi, Iburama yi keli Xarani yi alo Alatala a yitaxi a ra kii naxan yi. Loti fan yi siga Iburama fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="GEN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5"/>A yi a ɲaxanla Sarayi nun a xunyɛna dii Loti nun a sɔtɔ seen birin, e nun muxune a naxanye sɔtɔxi Xarani yi, a yi ne birin xali. E yi siga Kanan bɔxɔni.<verse eid="GEN 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6"/>Iburama yi dangu bɔxɔn na han a sa wudi bili gbeen li dɛnaxan yi xili Morɛ, Siken bɔxɔni. Na waxatini, Kanan kaane yi dɔxi mɛnni nun. <verse eid="GEN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7"/>Koni Alatala yi a yɛtɛ yita Iburama ra. A yi a fala, a naxa, “N bɔxɔni ito nan fima i yixɛtɛne ma.” Awa, Iburama yi saraxa ganden nafala Alatala xa naxan a yɛtɛ yitaxi a ra. <verse eid="GEN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8"/>A yi keli mɛnni, a siga geyaan ma, geyaan naxan Betɛli sogeteden binni. A yi bubun ti mɛnni. Betɛli taan yi lu a sogegododeni. Ayi taan yi lu a sogetedeni. A yi saraxa ganden nafala Alatala xa mɛnni. A yi Alatala maxandi a xinla ra. <verse eid="GEN 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi siga Negewi tonbonna binni.<verse eid="GEN 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iburama yi siga Misiran yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10"/>Na waxatini, fitina kamɛn yi so bɔxɔni. Awa, Iburama yi siga Misiran bɔxɔni bayo donse yo mi yi na. <verse eid="GEN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11"/>Benun e xa so Misiran bɔxɔni, Iburama yi a fala a ɲaxanla Sarayi xa, a naxa, “A kolon, ɲaxalan tofaɲin nan i tan na. <verse eid="GEN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12"/>Misiran kaane na i to waxatin naxan yi, e a falama nɛn a n ma ɲaxanla nan i ra. Na xanbi ra, e n faxama nɛn, koni e mi i tan faxɛ. <verse eid="GEN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13"/>I xa a fala e xa a n xunyɛn nan i tan na, alogo e xa kininkinin n ma i sabun na. Nayi, e mi n faxama i tan ma fe ra.”<verse eid="GEN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14"/>Iburama to Misiran li, Misiran kaane yi a to, a Sarayi ɲaxalan tofaɲin nan a ra. <verse eid="GEN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15"/>Misiran Mangana kuntigine yi ɲaxanla ito matɔxɔ Misiran Mangan xa. Misiran Mangan yi a xali a konni. <verse eid="GEN 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16"/>A yi hinan Iburama ra a ɲaxanla fe ra. Iburama yi xuruse xunxurine nun ɲingene nun sofanle nun konyine nun ɲɔgɔmɛne sɔtɔ.<verse eid="GEN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17"/>Koni Alatala yi fure ɲaxin sa Misiran Mangan nun a denbayaan ma Sarayi a fe ra, Iburama ɲaxanla. <verse eid="GEN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18"/>Nanara, Misiran Mangan yi Iburama xili. A yi a fala, a naxa, “I nanse ligaxi n na? Nanfera i mi a falaxi n xa i ya ɲaxanla nan a ra. <verse eid="GEN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19"/>Nanfera i ya falaxi a i xunyɛn nan a ra han n tan bata a findi n ma ɲaxanla ra? Awa, hɔn, i ya ɲaxanla ni i ra. Ɛ siga!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20"/>Na xanbi, Misiran Mangan yi yamarin fi a sofane ma lan Iburama a fe ma. E yi a ragbɛngbɛn e nun a ɲaxanla, e nun a yii seen birin.<verse eid="GEN 12:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Iburama nun Loti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1"/>Awa, Iburama yi keli Misiran yamanani. A yi siga Negewi tonbonna mabinni e nun a ɲaxanla nun a seen birin, e nun Loti. <verse eid="GEN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2"/>Iburama bata yi findi nafulu kanna ra nun. Xuruseene nun gbetin nun xɛmaan yi a yii. <verse eid="GEN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3"/>A keli Negewi yi, a yi a masiga han Betɛli taani. Yirena nde yi Betɛli taan nun Ayi taan longonna ra, Iburama bubun yi tixi mɛnna nan singe yi. <verse eid="GEN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4"/>A saraxa gande singen fan yi mɛnna nin nun. Iburama yi Alatala maxandi a xinla ra mɛnni.<verse eid="GEN 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5"/>Loti yi biraxi Iburama fɔxɔ ra, xuruseene nun bubune yi a fan yii nun. <verse eid="GEN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6"/>Iburama a xuruse ganla nun Loti a xuruse ganla yi gbo na bɔxɔn xa. E mi yi nɔɛ luyɛ yire kedenni sɔnɔn. <verse eid="GEN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7"/>Sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔn yi mini Iburama xuruse rabane nun Loti a xuruse rabane tagi. Kanan kaane nun Perisi kaane fan yi mɛnni na waxatini.<verse eid="GEN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8"/>Nanara, Iburama yi a fala Loti xa, a naxa, “Sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔn nama bira en tagi e nun en ma xuruse rabane tagi, bayo en tan ngaxakedenmane nan en na. <verse eid="GEN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9"/>Bɔxɔni ito birin i yɛɛ ra. Awa, en xa fata. Xa i siga kɔmɛnna ma, n tan yi siga yiifanna ma. Xa i siga yiifanna ma, n tan yi siga kɔmɛnna ma.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10"/>Loti yi a yɛɛn nasiga, a yi sa Yurudɛn mɛrɛn to. Igen yi na nun a faɲin na. Benun Alatala xa Sodoma nun Gomora halagi, na bɔxɔne yi fan han Soyari binni, alo Misiran bɔxɔna, alo Alatala a nakɔ rafalaxina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.10</char> Na feen mɔn sɛbɛxi Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 2.8-10 kui.</note> <verse eid="GEN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11"/>Awa, Loti yi Yurudɛn mɛrɛn sugandi a yɛtɛ xa. A yi siga sogeteden mabinni. E yi fata.<verse eid="GEN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12"/>Iburama yi lu Kanan bɔxɔni. Loti yi lu Yurudɛn mɛrɛn taane tagini. A yi bubun ti Sodoma fɛma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13"/>Sodoma kaane bata yi kobi ayi a gbegbe, e bata yi findi yulubi kan belebelen na Alatala yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="GEN 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14"/>Iburama nun Loti to fata, Alatala yi a fala Iburama xa, a naxa, “I yɛɛn ti sogeteden na, e nun sogegododen na, e nun yiifanna nun kɔmɛnna ma. <verse eid="GEN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15"/>I bɔxɔn naxan birin toxi, n na a fima i ma nɛn e nun i bɔnsɔnna ma han habadan. <verse eid="GEN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16"/>N ni i bɔnsɔnna rawuyama ayi nɛn alo gbangbanna naxan bɔxɔn ma. Xa muxun nɔɛ mɛɲɛnsinna tɛngɛ, awa, a nɔɛ nɛn i bɔnsɔnna yatɛn kolonɲɛ. <verse eid="GEN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17"/>Keli, i bɔxɔni siga, a kuye yɛɛn nun a yigbo yɛɛna, i xa a birin mato bayo n na a fima i tan nan ma.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18"/>Awa, Iburama yi bubun yiren masara. A yi dɔxɔ wudi belebelena nde mabinna ra Mamire nun Xebiron fɛma. A yi saraxa ganden nafala mɛnni Alatala xa.<verse eid="GEN 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Iburama Loti ratanga fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1"/>Na waxatini, Manga Amirofɛli naxan Babilɔn bɔxɔn ma yo, Manga Ariyoki naxan Elasari bɔxɔn ma yo, Manga Kɛdolama naxan Elan bɔxɔn ma yo, Manga Tidali naxan Goyin bɔxɔn ma yo, manga naaninni itoe yi layirin tongo e bode xa manga suulun ni itoe yɛngɛ feen na. <verse eid="GEN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2"/>Na manga suulunne nan itoe ra: Bera Sodoma mangan nun Birisa Gomora mangan nun Sinabu Adamaha mangan nun Sɛmɛbɛri Seboyimi mangana e nun Bela mangana. Bela mɔn xili Soyari. <verse eid="GEN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3"/>Manga suulunni itoe yi e malan Sidimi lanbanni, Fɔxɔ Daraan dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4"/>Xabu ɲɛɛ fu nun firin manga suulunni itoe yi Manga Kɛdolama bun ma, koni a ɲɛɛ fu nun saxanden na, e yi murutɛ.<verse eid="GEN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5"/>A ɲɛɛ fu nun naanindena, Manga Kɛdolama nun mangan naxanye yi a fɛma, e yi siga yɛngɛ sodeni. E yi siyani itoe birin nɔ yɛngɛni: Refa kaan naxanye yi Asatarɔti-Karinayin yi, Susi kaan naxanye yi Xami yi, Emi kaan naxanye yi Sihawe-Kiriyatayimi yi, <verse eid="GEN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6"/>e nun Xori kaan naxanye yi geyaan ma Seyiri binni han Eli-Paran tonbonna fɛma. <verse eid="GEN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7"/>Na xanbi e yi xɛtɛ, e yi siga En-Misapati, naxan xili Kadesi. E yi Amalɛkine nɔ e nun Amorin naxanye yi dɔxi Xasasɔn-Tamari yi.<verse eid="GEN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8"/>Na waxatini, Sodoma mangan nun Gomora mangan nun Adamaha mangan nun Seboyimi mangan nun Bela mangan dɛnaxan mɔn xili Soyari, na mangane yi e malan Sidimi lanbanni manga naaninni itoe yɛngɛdeni: <verse eid="GEN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9"/>Kɛdolama Elan mangan nun Tidali Goyin mangan nun Amirofɛli Babilɔn mangan nun Ariyoki Elasari mangana. Na manga naaninna yi manga suulunna yɛngɛ. <verse eid="GEN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10"/>Awa, yinle yi Sidimi lanbanni, dolena e kui. Sodoma mangan nun Gomora mangan yi e gi. Yɛngɛsona ndee yi bira yinle ra. Ndee yi e gi siga geyaan fari. <verse eid="GEN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11"/>Na manga naanin naxanye nɔɔn sɔtɔxi, ne yi nafunla nun donseene birin tongo Sodoma taan nun Gomora taani. E yi siga. <verse eid="GEN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12"/>E yi Iburama xunyɛna dii Loti fan suxu e nun a hɛrisigɛn birin, bayo a yi dɔxi Sodoma taan kui.<verse eid="GEN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13"/>Muxuna nde yi a gi, a sa na feen birin yɛba Iburama Heburu kaan xa. Na waxatini, Iburama yi dɔxi wudi bili belebelen bun ma Mamire Amorin konni. Mamire nun a ngaxakedenne, Esikoli nun Aneri, ne bata yi layirin tongo Iburama xa. <verse eid="GEN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14"/>Iburama to a mɛ, muxune bata a xunyɛna dii xɛmɛ Loti suxu, a yi yɛngɛsone tongo, muxu kɛmɛ saxan muxu fu nun solomasɛxɛ naxanye barixi a sariyan kui, naxanye fatan yɛngɛ sodeni. E yi siga na mangane fɔxɔ ra han taan naxan xili Dan. <verse eid="GEN 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15"/>Kɔɛɛn na, Iburama yi a yɛngɛsone yitaxun, e yi na mangane ratɛrɛna yɛngɛn na. E nun a yɛngɛsone yi nɔ na mangane matuntunɲɛ han Xoba, Damasi taan kɔmɛnna ma. <verse eid="GEN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16"/>A yi fa e hɛrisigɛn birin na, a yi fa a xunyɛna diin Loti fan na, e nun a sɔtɔ seen birin, sa ɲaxanle fari e nun yamaan birin.<verse eid="GEN 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iburama nun Mɛlikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17"/>Iburama to xɛtɛ xunna kenla kui, keli Manga Kɛdolama yɛngɛdeni e nun mangan naxanye yi a fɛma, Sodoma mangan yi siga Iburama ralandeni Sihawe lanbanni. Mɛnna xili “Mangana Lanbanna.”<verse eid="GEN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18"/>Na xanbi, Mɛlikisedeki,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.18</char> <char style="fk">Mɛlikisedeki</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Manga tinxinxina.”</note> Salemi mangan yi fa burun nun wudi bogi igen na Iburama xa alo manpana. Kore Xɔnna Ala a saraxaraliin nan yi Mɛlikisedeki ra. <verse eid="GEN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19"/>A yi duba Iburama xa, a naxa, “Kore Xɔnna Ala naxan koren nun bɔxɔn daxi, na xa Iburama barayi. <verse eid="GEN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20"/>Tantunna Kore Xɔnna Ala xa, naxan i yaxune rayarabixi i xa.” Na waxatini, Iburama yi a se tongoxine birin yaganna fi Mɛlikisedeki ma.<verse eid="GEN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21"/>Sodoma mangan yi a fala Iburama xa, a naxa, “N ma muxune raxɛtɛ n ma, koni nafunla xa lu i tan xa.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22"/>Koni Iburama yi a fala Sodoma mangan xa, a naxa, “N bata n kɔlɔ Alatala yi, Kore Xɔnna Ala naxan koren nun bɔxɔn daxi, <verse eid="GEN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23"/>n mi sese tongɛ naxan findixi i gbeen na, hali lutidina, xa na mi a ra sankidi lutina, alogo i nama a fala sɔnɔn fa fala ‘N tan nan Iburama findi nafulu kanna ra.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24"/>N mi sese tongɛ, fɔ n ma yɛngɛsone naxan donxi e nun naxan findixi e gbeen na. Aneri nun Esikoli nun Mamire e gbeen tongoma nɛn.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ala yi layirin tongo Iburama xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1"/>Na xanbi, Iburama yi fe toon ti alo xiyena, Alatala yi fa a ma, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Iburama i nama gaxu, n tan nan i kantanma. I saran gbeen sɔtɔma nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2"/>Iburama yi a yabi, a naxa, “Marigina Alatala, i nanse ɲɛnigexi i naxan soma n yii? Bayo dii yo mi n yii. N mi dii sɔtɔxi naxan n kɛɛn tongoma fɔ n ma walikɛna, Eliyeseri Damasi kaana. <verse eid="GEN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3"/>I mi dii yo fixi n tan ma. Nanara, n ma walikɛɛn naxan barixi n konni, na nan findima n kɛɛ tongon na.” <verse eid="GEN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4"/>Alatala yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, i ya walikɛɛn mi findima i kɛɛ tongon na de! I bari diin yatin nan fama findideni i kɛɛ tongon na.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5"/>Ala yi Iburama ramini a bubun bun ma, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I yɛɛn nate kore. I sarene tɛngɛ xa i nɔɛ a yatɛn kolonɲɛ.” A mɔn yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I ne toxi kii naxan yi kuyen ma, i bɔnsɔnna fan wuyama ayi na kiini nɛn, i mi nɔɛ a yatɛn kolonɲɛ.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6"/>Iburama yi dɛnkɛlɛya Alatala ma, Ala fan yi na yatɛ tinxinna ra a xa. <verse eid="GEN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7"/>Ala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N tan nan Alatala ra naxan i raminixi Yuru taani Babilɔn bɔxɔni. N na i xali bɔxɔn ma n dɛnaxan fima i ma.” <verse eid="GEN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8"/>Iburama yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Marigina Alatala, n na a kolonma di, fa fala n fama na bɔxɔn sɔtɔdeni nɛn?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alatala layirin xidi fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9"/>Ala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Fa ɲinge gilɛn nun sii gilɛn na, e nun yɛxɛɛ kontonna naxanye bata ɲɛɛ saxan saxan ti, e nun ganba gilɛn nun kolokonde diina. I yi e fi n ma.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10"/>Iburama yi fa na subene ra. A yi ɲingen nun sii gilɛn nun yɛxɛɛ kontonni sɛnsɛn a tagi. A yi na sube dungine sa e dan na, koni a mi xɔline tan yixaba. <verse eid="GEN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11"/>Sɛgɛne yi fa, e godo na sube faxaxine ma. Iburama yi e birin kedi. <verse eid="GEN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12"/>Sogen godomatɔna, xixɔnla yi Iburama suxu kati! Kuyen yi yidimi, dimi magaxuxin yi so.<verse eid="GEN 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13"/>Ala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “A kolon yati, i bɔnsɔnna dɔxɔma nɛn yamana gbɛtɛ yi, e konna mi dɛnaxan na. E findima nɛn konyin na na bɔxɔni. E fe xɔlɛn siyaan birin sɔtɔma nɛn ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ naaninna bun ma muxu yiini. <verse eid="GEN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14"/>Koni e na lu siyaan naxan bun konyiyani, n na makitima nɛn. Na xanbi ra, e nɛɛn minima na yamanani, e se faɲin gbegbe xalima nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15"/>I tan fama nɛn bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔdeni, i mɔn siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔma nɛn, han i sa laxiraya waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16"/>I yixɛtɛn naaninden xɛtɛma nɛn na bɔxɔni, bayo fɔ Amorine e hakɛn na gbo ayi waxatin naxan yi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17"/>Sogen to godo, dimin yi so. Na waxatini tɛɛ kɔ seen naxan yi tutin naminima e nun tɛɛ dɛgɛna, a yi dangu sube dungine saden tagi. <verse eid="GEN 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18"/>Taxamasenna nan na ra, Alatala yi layirin naxan tongoxi a tan nun Iburama tagi na lɔxɔ yɛtɛni. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N bata yamanani ito fi i bɔnsɔnna ma, keli Misiran baan ma han sa dɔxɔ Efirati baa belebelen na.” <verse eid="GEN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19"/>Siya dɔxɔ wuyaxin nan yi na: Kenine nun Kenisine nun Kadimonne <verse eid="GEN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20"/>nun Xitine nun Perisine nun Refane <verse eid="GEN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21"/>nun Amorine nun Kanan kaane nun Girigasane e nun Yebusu kaane.<verse eid="GEN 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16"/>
  <para style="s">Sumayila bari lɔxɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1"/>Sarayi, Iburama a ɲaxanla munma yi dii yo bari a xa. Konyi gilɛ Misiran kaana nde yi walima a yii naxan yi xili Hagara. <verse eid="GEN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2"/>Sarayi yi a fala a xɛmɛn xa, a naxa, “I bata a to, Alatala mi dii bari feen nagidixi n tan ma. Koni yanyina nde n nɔɛ diin sɔtɛ i xa nɛn n ma konyi gilɛn sabun na. Ɛ birin nan lan ɛ xa xi to.” Iburama yi tin Sarayi a falan ma a naxan falaxi a xa. <verse eid="GEN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3"/>Sarayi yi a konyi gilɛn Hagara Misiran kaan tongo, a yi a so a xɛmɛna Iburama yii, a xa findi a ɲaxanla ra. Iburama bata yi ɲɛɛ fu ti Kanan bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="GEN 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4"/>Iburama nun Hagara yi xi yire kedenni, Hagara yi fudikan. Hagara to la a ra fa fala a bata fudikan, a yi yo a kanna ma, a yi a mato a kobin na. <verse eid="GEN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5"/>Sarayi yi a fala Iburama xa, a naxa, “Konbini ito, n na raxɛtɛma i tan nan ma Hagara naxan saxi n fari! Bayo, n tan nan n ma konyi gilɛn fixi i ma a xa findi i ya ɲaxanla ra. Xabu a la a ra a fudikanna na a ra, a fa fe kobin nan tun yilanma n na. Alatala xa en tan firinna makiti.” <verse eid="GEN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6"/>Iburama yi a ɲaxanla yabi, a naxa, “I ya konyi gilɛn nan a ra. A walima i tan nan yii. I waxi feen naxan birin xɔn ma, a birin liga a ra.” Na waxatini, Sarayi fe kobin birin naxan nafan a ma, a yi a liga Hagara ra. Hagara yi a gi a bun.<verse eid="GEN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7"/>Alatalaa malekan yi naralan Hagara ra xude xunna fɛma Suru kiraan xɔn ma tonbon yireni. <verse eid="GEN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8"/>Malekan yi Hagara maxɔdin, a naxa, “Sarayi a konyi gilɛn Hagara, i kelixi minɛn yi? I sigama minɛn yi?” Hagara yi malekan yabi, a naxa, “N nan n gixi n kanna nan bun ma.” <verse eid="GEN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9"/>Alatalaa malekan yi a fala Hagara xa, a naxa, “I mɔn xa xɛtɛ i kelixi dɛnaxan yi. I mɔn xa i xuru a ma.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10"/>Alatala a malekan yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N fama bɔnsɔn wuyaxi fideni nɛn i ma, i mi nɔɛ naxan yatɛn kolonɲɛ.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11"/>Alatalaa malekan mɔn yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I fudikanna na a ra iki. I fama diin sɔtɔdeni. I na diin xili sama nɛn Sumayila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16.11</char> <char style="fk">Sumayila</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Ala fe mɛma.”</note> Bayo Ala bata i ya tɔrɔ xuiin mɛ marayarabin naxan sama i fari. <verse eid="GEN 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12"/>I ya diin luma nɛn alo burunna sofanla. A birin yɛngɛma nɛn, birin a fan yɛngɛma nɛn. E nun a xunyɛne birin luma nɛn fataxi.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13"/>Hagara yi xili sa Alatala xɔn, naxan falan tixi a xa, a naxa, “Ala Naxan N Toma.” A yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata na kanna to, naxan n toma.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14"/>Na nan a toxi e na xɔɲinna xinla falama, e naxa, “Niin Kanna Naxan N Toxi.” Na xɔɲinna Kadesi nun Bereda nan tagi. <verse eid="GEN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15"/>Hagara yi diin sɔtɔ Iburama xa. Iburama yi a xili sa Sumayila. <verse eid="GEN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16"/>Iburama bata yi ɲɛɛ tonge solomasɛxɛ e nun ɲɛɛ sennin ti siimayaan na, Hagara yi fa na diin sɔtɔ a xa.<verse eid="GEN 16:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Iburama xinla maxɛtɛ fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1"/>Iburama to ɲɛɛ tonge solomanaanin ɲɛɛ solomanaanin ti siimayaan na, Alatala yi mini a xa, a fa ito fala a xa, a naxa, “Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna nan n tan na. I sigati kiin xa kamali n yɛɛ ra yi. <verse eid="GEN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2"/>N fama layirin tongodeni i tan nun n tan tagi. N mɔn fama nɛn bɔnsɔn gbeen fideni i ma.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3"/>Iburama yi bira, a a yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4"/>Ala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N ma layirin ni i ra n naxan tongoxi i tan nun n tan tagi. I findima nɛn siya wuyaxine benban na. <verse eid="GEN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5"/>I xinla mi falama sɔnɔn Iburama,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">17.5</char> <char style="fk">Iburama</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Fafa binyena.” <char style="fk">Iburahima</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Yama gbeen fafe.”</note> i xinla falama nɛn fa fala Iburahima, bayo n na i findima nɛn siya wuyaxine benban na. <verse eid="GEN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6"/>N na i findima nɛn yama gbeen benban na. I diine sɔtɔma nɛn naxanye findima siya wuyaxine ra. Mangane fan minima nɛn i ya diine tagi. <verse eid="GEN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7"/>N nan n ma layirin nakamalima nɛn i tan nun n tan tagi, hali i dangu xanbini, e nun i bɔnsɔnne fan yixɛtɛn fan bɔnsɔn bɔnsɔn. A findima habadan layirin nan na. Nayi, n tan nan i ya Ala ra, e nun i bɔnsɔnna hali i dangu xanbini. <verse eid="GEN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8"/>I tan nun i bɔnsɔnna, n fama nɛn bɔxɔn fideni ɛ ma, i findixi xɔɲɛn na dɛnaxan yi iki. Kanan bɔxɔn birin findima nɛn e gbeen na habadan! N tan nan e Ala ra.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9"/>Ala mɔn yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “I tan nun i bɔnsɔnna fan yixɛtɛn bɔnsɔn bɔnsɔnna, ɛ lan nɛn ɛ xa n ma layirin nakamali. <verse eid="GEN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10"/>En ma layirin ni i ra, n naxan saxi ɛ ma, ɛ lan ɛ xa naxan nakamali, i tan nun i bɔnsɔnne: Naxan birin findixi xɛmɛn na ɛ tagi, e birin lan nɛn e xa banxulan. <verse eid="GEN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11"/>Ɛ xa na banxulanna findi layiri taxamasenna ra ɛ tan nun n tan tagi. <verse eid="GEN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12"/>Keli ɛ tan ma, sa dɔxɔ ɛ bɔnsɔn bɔnsɔnna ra, a birin lan nɛn, naxan yo barin nɛma fa xii solomasɛxɛ ti, a xa banxulan. Na sariyan lan nɛn a xa sa ɛ konyine fan ma naxanye ɛ yii, naxanye barixi ɛ konni, e nun konyin naxanye saraxi bɔxɔ gbɛtɛni, hali a mi fa i bɔnsɔnni. <verse eid="GEN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13"/>Na kui, konyin naxanye barixi i konni e nun i naxan fan saraxi, e birin lan nɛn e xa banxulan, alogo n ma layirin taxamasenna xa lu ɛ fatin ma habadan! <verse eid="GEN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14"/>Xɛmɛn naxan na lu a fatin mi banxulanxi, a fama nɛn naminideni ɛ bɔnsɔnni, bayo a mi layirin nakamalixi.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15"/>Na xanbi, Ala yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “I nama i ya ɲaxanla xinla fala sɔnɔn de, ‘Sarayi,’ a fa xili nɛn ‘Saran.’ <verse eid="GEN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16"/>N na a barakama nɛn, a fama dii xɛmɛn barideni nɛn i xa. N na a barakama nɛn, a fama findideni nɛn siya gbeen benban na. Yamana wuyaxin mangane fama minideni nɛn a diine yi.” <verse eid="GEN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17"/>Iburahima yi bira, a yi a yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma, a yi gele. A yi a fala a bɔɲɛni, a naxa, “N tan naxan bata ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ti siimayaan na, n mɔn nɔɛ diin sɔtɛ ba? Saran naxan fan bata ɲɛɛ tonge solomanaanin ti siimayaan na, a fa nɔɛ diin barɛ ba?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18"/>A yi a fala Ala xa, a naxa, “I ɲɔxɔ lu Sumayila xɔn ma tun!” <verse eid="GEN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn! I ya ɲaxanla Saran fama dii xɛmɛn barideni nɛn i xa, i naxan xili sama Isiyaga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">17.19</char> <char style="fk">Isiyaga</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “A gelema.”</note> N nan n ma layirin nakamalima nɛn n tan nun a tan tagi e nun a bɔnsɔnna hali a faxa xanbini. Layirin naxan mi kalama habadan! <verse eid="GEN 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20"/>Na xanbi, n bata i ya maxandin nasuxu Sumayila fe ra. N na barakama nɛn, n mɔn dii gbegbe bari feen nagidima a ma nɛn, n bɔnsɔn wuyaxin fima nɛn a ma. A findima nɛn manga dii fu nun firinne baba ra, e nun siya xungbe kanna ra. <verse eid="GEN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21"/>Koni, naxan findixi n ma layirin na, n fama na rakamalideni n tan nun Isiyaga nan tagi. Saran fama nɛn dii xɛmɛn barideni i xa i ɲɔxɔn waxati faraxi.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22"/>Ala to yelin na falɛ, a yi keli Iburahima xun ma.<verse eid="GEN 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23"/>Iburahima yi a diin Sumayila tongo e nun a konyin naxanye barixi a konni, e nun a naxanye saraxi. Xɛmɛn naxanye birin a banxini, a yi e birin banxulan na lɔxɔni alo Ala a yamari kii naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24"/>Iburahima siin ɲɛɛ tonge solomanaanin ɲɛɛ solomanaanin nan yi a ra, <verse eid="GEN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25"/>a dii Sumayila tan bata yi ɲɛɛ fu nun saxan ti, e banxulanxi waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26"/>E yi e birin banxulan lɔxɔ keden <verse eid="GEN 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27"/>e nun xɛmɛn naxanye birin yi Iburahimaa banxini, konyin naxanye barixi a konni, e nun a naxanye fan saraxi keli yamana gbɛtɛ yi.<verse eid="GEN 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Xɔɲɛ saxanna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1"/>Alatala yi mini Iburahima xa Mamire wudi bili gbeen dɛnaxan yi. Na waxatini, Iburahima yi dɔxi a bubun so dɛɛn na, kuye wolon waxatini yanyin na. <verse eid="GEN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2"/>A yi xɛmɛ saxan to tixi a yɛtagi. A yi keli bubun so dɛɛn na, a siga mafurɛn, a sa na xɛmɛ saxanna ralan. A yi a xinbi sin. <verse eid="GEN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3"/>A yi a fala muxu keden xa e tagi, a naxa, “N kanna, yandi ɛ nama dangu singe, ɛ xa ɛ madigan n konni. <verse eid="GEN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4"/>N xa fa igen na ɛ xa alogo ɛ xa ɛ sanne maxa. Ɛ mɔn xa ɛ matabu wudini ito bun ma. <verse eid="GEN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5"/>N xa fa donseen na ɛ xa alogo ɛ xa fangan sɔtɔ. Na xanbi, ɛ fa siga ɛ sigatini. Amasɔtɔ, ɛ danguma ɛ walikɛɛn konna nin.” Na xɔɲɛne yi a yabi, e naxa, “Awa, i naxan falaxi, a raba.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6"/>Nanara, Iburahima yi xɛtɛ a mafuraxin na a bubun kui. A yi a fala a ɲaxanla Saran xa, a naxa, “I xɔdɔxɔ. I murutu fuɲi faɲin debedin yɛ saxan nafala burun na.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7"/>Na xanbi, a yi a gi, a siga ɲinge sansanni, a sa ɲinge dii turaxi keden tongo. A yi na ɲinge diin so a walikɛɛn yii alogo a xa a faxa, a xa a rafala donseen na. <verse eid="GEN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8"/>Na suben to yelin ɲinɲɛ, Iburahima yi a tongo, a a so xɔɲɛne yii, e nun nɔnɔ kɛndɛna sa nɔnɔ xixin fari. E na donseen donma, Iburahima yi ti e fɛma wudin bun ma.<verse eid="GEN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9"/>Na xɔɲɛne yi Iburahima maxɔdin, e naxa, “I ya ɲaxanla Saran minɛn yi?” A yi e yabi, a naxa, “A na yi bubun bun ma.” <verse eid="GEN 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10"/>Na xɔɲɛn muxu keden yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “N mɔn xɛtɛma be i ɲɔxɔn waxati faraxi. Na waxatini i ya ɲaxanla dii xɛmɛn barima nɛn i xa.” Saran yi tixi Iburahima xanbi ra bubun so dɛɛn na, a tuli matixi e falan ti xuiin na. <verse eid="GEN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11"/>Iburahima nun Saran bata yi yelin forideni nun. Saran mi yi nɔɛ diin barɛ. <verse eid="GEN 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12"/>A yi gele a yɛtɛ ma, a naxa, “N tan na sɔtɛ, n bata yelin forɛ? N kanna fan bata findi xɛmɛ fonna ra. N fan sɛwama nɛn dii sɔtɔdeni ba?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13"/>Alatala yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “Nanfera Saran gelexi? Nanfera a a falaxi, a tan mi nɔɛ diin barɛ sɔnɔn, bayo a bata fori? <verse eid="GEN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14"/>Nanse na Alatala mi nɔɛ naxan ligɛ? N fama nɛn waxati saxini faraxi, Saran yi dii xɛmɛn bari.” <verse eid="GEN 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15"/>Saran yi gaxu, a yi wulen fala, a naxa, “N mi gelexi de!” A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Di! I gelexi nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16"/>Na xɔɲɛne yi ti kiraan xɔn ma, e yi e xun sa Sodoma taan ma. Iburahima yi siga e tideni kira yi.<verse eid="GEN 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17"/>Alatala yi a fala, a naxa, “N naxan ligama, n nama na luxun Iburahima ma. <verse eid="GEN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18"/>A fama nɛn findideni siya belebele sɛnbɛmaan na. Dunuɲa siyane birin duban sɔtɔma nɛn a tan barakani. <verse eid="GEN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19"/>N na a sugandixi nɛn, alogo a xa a diine nun a bɔnsɔnna muxune birin yamari a e xa kiti kɛndɛn sa tinxinni. Na waxatini, n tan Alatala, n fama nɛn n ma layirin nakamalideni n naxan tongoxi Iburahima xa.” <verse eid="GEN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20"/>Alatala yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “Feen naxan falaxi Sodoma kaane nun Gomora kaane xun ma, fe magaxuxin na a ra. E yulubin bata gbo ayi han, <verse eid="GEN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21"/>n fama gododeni nɛn, n sa a mato feen naxanye birin falaxi e xun ma, xa a na kiini. Xa e birin na feene fari, n fama a kolondeni nɛn na waxatini.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22"/>Xɔɲɛ firin yi keli e yi dɛnaxan yi, e yi siga Sodoma taani. Koni Alatala nun Iburahima yi lu yire kedenni. <verse eid="GEN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23"/>Iburahima yi a maso a ra, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I muxu ɲaxine nun tinxin muxune halagɛ e bode xɔn ba? <verse eid="GEN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24"/>Yanyina nde tinxin muxu tonge suulun Sodoma kaane tagi. I na taan kalama nɛn? I mi diɲama Sodoma yamaan ma na tinxin muxu tonge suulunna fe ra ba? <verse eid="GEN 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25"/>Ɛn-ɛn, a mi lanma i xa na liga! A mi lan i xa muxu ɲaxin nun tinxin muxun faxa kii kedenni. A mi lan kiti kedenna xa sa muxu ɲaxin nun tinxin muxun ma. A mi lan i xa na liga. Naxan dunuɲa birin makitima, a mi a ligama tinxinna kiraan xɔn ma ba?” <verse eid="GEN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26"/>Alatala yi yabin ti, a naxa, “Xa n tinxin muxu tonge suulun li Sodoma taan kui, n diɲama nɛn Sodoma kaane birin ma na muxu tonge suulunna fe ra.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27"/>Iburahima mɔn yi falan tongo, a naxa, “Marigina, n bata i maxandi i xa diɲa n xa, n xa falani ito ti i xa, bayo n tan kelixi gbangbanna nun bɛndɛn nin. <verse eid="GEN 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28"/>Xa i sa a li, tinxin muxu tonge suulun mi na yi, yanyina nde fɔ muxu tonge naanin e nun suulun nan na. I na taan kalɛ bayo muxu suulun bata dasa a ra?” Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “N mi a kalama xa n tinxin muxu tonge naanin e nun suulun li na.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29"/>Iburahima mɔn yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Yanyina nde, i muxu tonge naanin nan lima na yi.” A yi a fala, a naxa, “N mi na kalama na muxu tonge naaninna fe ra.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30"/>Iburahima yi a fala, a naxa, “Marigina, n bata i maxandi, i nama xɔlɔ xa n mɔn falana nde ti i xa. Yanyina nde, i muxu tonge saxan nan lima na yi.” Ala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N mi na kalama xa n tinxin muxu tonge saxan li na yi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31"/>Iburahima yi a fala, a naxa, “Marigina, i hakɛ lu n xa. Yanyina nde, i muxu mɔxɔɲɛ nan lima na.” Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “N mi na taan kalama na muxu mɔxɔɲɛna fe ra.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32"/>Iburahima mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Marigina, yandi, i nama xɔlɔ. N ma maxɔdin dɔnxɛn ni ito ra. Yanyina nde, i muxu fu nan lima na.” Ala yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “N mi na taan kalama na muxu fuuna fe ra.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33"/>A to yelin falan tiyɛ e nun Iburahima, Alatala yi siga, Iburahima fan yi xɛtɛ a konni.<verse eid="GEN 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19"/>
  <para style="s">Sodoma nun Gomora halagi fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1"/>Ɲinbari waxatini, maleka firin yi so Sodoma taani. Na waxatini, Loti yi dɔxi na taan so dɛɛn na. A to malekane to fɛ, a yi keli, a sa e ralan kiraan xɔn ma. A yi a xinbi sin, a yɛtagin yi lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2"/>Loti yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N kanne, yandi, ɛ xa so n konni. Ɛ xa ɛ sanne maxa, ɛ mɔn xa xi be to. Na xanbi, tila xɔtɔnni ɛ nɔɛ sigɛ ɛ sigatini.” Malekane yi a fala, e naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn! Fɔ nxu xa xi taan tagini to kɔɛɛn na.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3"/>Koni Loti yi a yixɔdɔxɔ han e yi siga a konni. A yi donse faɲin nafala e xa, a yi buru ratetaren gan e xa. E yi e dɛge. <verse eid="GEN 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4"/>Sa waxatin mi yi a lixi nun, Sodoma kaane yi Loti a banxin nabilin. Keli banxulanne ma, sa dɔxɔ xɛmɛ fonne ra, e birin yi na nun. <verse eid="GEN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5"/>E yi Loti xili, e a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Na muxune minɛn yi, naxanye soxi i konni to ɲinbanna ra. E ramini nxu ma, nxu xa nxu makoon naba e ra alo ɲaxanla.” <verse eid="GEN 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6"/>Loti yi mini a banxin kui a ti dɛɛn na, a yi na dɛɛn nagali. <verse eid="GEN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn! Ngaxakedenne, ɛ nama fe ɲaxin liga. <verse eid="GEN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8"/>N ma dii tɛmɛ firin be naxanye mi xɛmɛ feen kolon. N bata tin a ma, n xa ne sa ɛ sagoni, ɛ xa feen birin liga e ra ɛ waxi naxan xɔn ma, alogo ɛ nama sese liga n ma xɔɲɛne ra, bayo n tan bata findi e yatigin na.” <verse eid="GEN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9"/>Na muxune yi a fala Loti xa, e naxa, “Mini i ya xɔɲɛne nan na nxu yɛtagi. I mi nɔɛ kitin sɛ nxu konni. Xa i mi i kata, nxu fama fe xɔlɛn dɔxɔdeni i ra nɛn dangu e tan na.” E yi sɔnsɔn Loti ra, alogo e xa dɛɛn kala. <verse eid="GEN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10"/>Na maleka firinna yi Loti suxu, e yi a raso banxin kui, e dɛɛn balan e xun ma. <verse eid="GEN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11"/>Malekan yi ganla xunna kala, naxanye yi tixi dɛɛn na, e birin yi findi danxutɔne ra, keli banxulanne ma sa dɔxɔ xɛmɛ fonne ra han e mi yi sese toma fa. Kiraan yi yifu e ma.<verse eid="GEN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12"/>Na maleka firinna yi Loti maxɔdin, e naxa, “Muxuna nde i xa be? Hali a findixi i bitanna nan na, i ya dii xɛmɛne nun i ya dii tɛmɛne, e nun i ya muxune birin, i xa e birin namini taani ito kui <verse eid="GEN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13"/>bayo nxu fama a halagideni. Alatala bata maxandi xui gbegbe mɛ taa yi kaani itoe wali kobine fe ra. Alatala yi nxu rafa, a nxu xa fa taani ito halagi.” <verse eid="GEN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14"/>Loti yi siga, a a fala a bitanne xa, a naxa, “Ɛ keli be mafurɛn! Alatala fama be kaladeni iki sa.” E yi a miri a sabaan nan na. <verse eid="GEN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15"/>Na subaxan ma, malekane yi digi Loti ra, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Keli! I ya ɲaxanla tongo, e nun i ya dii tɛmɛ firinna naxanye be. Ɛ xa keli be alogo ɛ nama halagi ɛ nun taani ito hakɛ kanne.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16"/>A to wa a madigan feni nun, malekan yi Loti suxu a yiin ma, e nun a ɲaxanla, sa a dii tɛmɛ firinna fari. E yi e ramini taan kui, bayo Alatala bata yi kininkinin e ma.<verse eid="GEN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17"/>Malekan to e ramini, keden yi a fala Loti xa, a naxa, “I gi, alogo i niin xa ratanga. I nama i xanbi rato de! I nama i mati taani ito rabilinna yire yo yi. Xa i mi waxi a xɔn i xa halagi, siga na geyane yireni.” <verse eid="GEN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18"/>Loti yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, n Marigina, n bata i maxandi, n mi nɔɛ na ligɛ. <verse eid="GEN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19"/>N na a kolon, i bata hinan n tan i ya walikɛɛn na. I bata kininkinin n ma han! I bata n niin natanga. Koni, n tan mi nɔɛ n giyɛ han geyaan ma, xa na mi a ra n faxama nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20"/>Yandi, i bata taa xurudini ito to? Na nan masoxi n na. Tin, n xa siga, n xa sa lu na. A lu, n xa siga mɛnni, taa xurudidin na a ra! N niin xa ratanga!” <verse eid="GEN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21"/>Malekan yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata tin na birin ma. N mi na taan kalɛ. <verse eid="GEN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22"/>Siga mafurɛn, bayo han i sa soma waxatin naxan yi, n mi nɔɛ fefe ligɛ.” Na nan a toxi, na taan xili saxi Soyari.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.22</char> <char style="fk">Soyari</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “A xurina.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23"/>Sogen yi tema waxatin naxan yi, Loti yi so Soyari taan kui.<verse eid="GEN 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24"/>Na waxatini, Alatala yi dole tɛɛn nagodo Sodoma taan nun Gomora taan ma. <verse eid="GEN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25"/>A yi na taane halagi e nun na lanbanna birin, fɔlɔ sansine ma, sa dɔxɔ muxune ra naxanye birin dɔxi na taane kui. <verse eid="GEN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26"/>Loti a ɲaxanla yi a yɛɛn naxɛtɛ a xanbi ra, a yi findi fɔxɔ gɛmɛ tixin na.<verse eid="GEN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27"/>Na subaxan ma, Iburahima yi keli, a a xunsa na yiren ma e nun Alatala e bode to dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28"/>A to a yɛɛn nasiga Sodoma taan nun Gomora taan ma, e nun na taane rabilinna birin, a yi tuti gbeen to, a tema na yi alo sulun tɛɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.28</char> <char style="fk">Sulun tɛɛn</char> mɔn falama yirena nde yi fa fala “<char style="fk">Furu tɛɛna</char>.”</note> tutina. <verse eid="GEN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29"/>Ala to yi na taane kalama nun, a yi mirixi Iburahimaa fe ma. Na nan a toxi, Ala yi Loti ratanga na gbalon ma, a yi na taane kalama waxatin naxan yi, Loti yi dɔxi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="GEN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Loti nun a dii tɛmɛ firinna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30"/>Loti bata yi gaxu lu feen na Soyari taan kui. A yi keli na, a siga geyaan fari a sa dɔxɔ mɛnni e nun a dii tɛmɛ firinna faran yinla kui.<verse eid="GEN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31"/>Lɔxɔna nde, a dii tɛmɛ singen yi a fala a xunyɛn xa, a naxa, “En baba bata fori. En dɛnaxan yi, xɛmɛ yo mi be en dɔxɔma naxan xɔn ma alo adaman darixi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32"/>Fa be, en xa dɔlɔn so en baba yii han a xunna yi keli alogo en xa xi a xɔn ma, alogo en xa diin sɔtɔ. Na xa findi a bɔnsɔnna ra.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33"/>Na kɔɛɛn na, e yi dɔlɔn fi e baba ma, a dii tɛmɛ singen yi xi a baba xɔn ma. A mi a xun ma fe yo kolon, a diin sa waxatina hanma a keli waxatina. <verse eid="GEN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34"/>Kuye to yiba, a dii tɛmɛ singen yi a fala a xunyɛn xa, a naxa, “A bata ɲan, n tan nun n baba bata xi yire kedenni to. To kɔɛɛn na, i tan nan nun n baba xima yire kedenni. Na yanyini en nɔɛ bɔnsɔnna fiyɛ a ma.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35"/>Na kɔɛɛn mɔn na, e yi dɔlɔn fi e baba ma, a xunyɛn fan yi xi a baba xɔn ma. A mi a xun ma fe yo kolon, a diin sa waxatina, e nun a keli waxatina.<verse eid="GEN 19:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36"/>Loti a dii tɛmɛ firinna yi fudikan e baba a diin na. <verse eid="GEN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37"/>Na dii tɛmɛ singen to diin bari, a a xili sa “Moyaba.” Na nan findi Moyaba kaane birin benban na. Han iki e na yi. <verse eid="GEN 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38"/>A dii tɛmɛ firinden fan yi diin bari, a a xili sa “Bɛn-Ami.” Na nan findi Amonine birin benban na. Han iki e na yi.<verse eid="GEN 19:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Iburahima nun Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1"/>Iburahima yi siga Negewi yamanani. A yi dɔxɔ Kadesi nun Suru tagi. Na xanbi ra, a yi siga Gerari taani, a yi waxati ti mɛnni. <verse eid="GEN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2"/>Iburahima yi a ɲaxanla Saran ma fe fala, a naxa, “N xunyɛn ɲaxalanmaan nan a ra.” Abimeleki, Gerari mangan yi Saran tongo.<verse eid="GEN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3"/>Kɔɛɛn to so, Abimeleki xima, Ala yi a yɛtɛ yita a ra xiyeni, a naxa, “I faxama nɛn ɲaxanli ito a fe ra, i naxan tongoxi, bayo xɛmɛ taa ra dɔxɔn na a ra.” <verse eid="GEN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4"/>Na waxatini, Abimeleki munma yi a maso a ra. A yi a yabi, a naxa, “N Marigina, i bɔnsɔn tinxinxin kalama nɛn? <verse eid="GEN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5"/>Iburahima a fala nɛn n xa, fa fala ɲaxanli ito a xunyɛn ɲaxalanmaan nan a ra. Ɲaxanla fan yi a fala n xa, a tada nan Iburahima ra. N naxan ligaxi, n na ligaxi n bɔɲɛ fixɛn nan na.” <verse eid="GEN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6"/>Na xiyeni Ala mɔn yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N tan yati, n na a kolon i feen naxan ligaxi, fe kobi xa mi a ra. N tan nan a ligaxi, i mi nɔxi yulubi ligɛ n na. Na nan a toxi n mi a luxi i xa a findi i ya ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="GEN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7"/>Iki, ɲaxanli ito raxɛtɛ a xɛmɛn ma. Nabiin nan a ra. A Ala maxandima i xa nɛn alogo i niin xa ratanga. Koni xa i mi a raxɛtɛ a xɛmɛn ma, a kolon, i faxama nɛn i tan nun i ya muxune birin.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8"/>Abimeleki yi keli sinma, a yi a kuntigine birin malan. Feen naxan birin danguxi, a yi a yɛba e xa. E yi gaxu han a dangu ayi. <verse eid="GEN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9"/>Abimeleki yi Iburahima xili a konni. A yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “N hakɛn mundun ligaxi i ra, i xa n tan nun n ma yamaan findi yulubi kanne ra? I bata fe liga n na, feen naxan mi lan a xa liga. <verse eid="GEN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10"/>Nanfe a ligaxi i xa na raba?” <verse eid="GEN 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11"/>Iburahima yi a fala, a naxa, “N na falaxi nɛn, a be kaane mi gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra. E n faxama nɛn n ma ɲaxanla fe ra. <verse eid="GEN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12"/>Ɲɔndin nan a ra, n xunyɛn na a ra. Nxu birin baba keden, koni nxu nga keden mi a ra. A mɔn findixi n ma ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="GEN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13"/>Ala to n namini n baba konni, n yi a fala n ma ɲaxanla xa, n naxa, ‘I hinanna yitama n na ikiini: En na siga dɛdɛ, i xa a fala a n xunyɛn nan i tan na.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14"/>Abimeleki yi yɛxɛɛne nun siine nun ɲingene nun konyi xɛmɛne nun konyi gilɛne tongo, a yi e birin so Iburahima yii. A mɔn yi a ɲaxanla Saran naxɛtɛ a ma. <verse eid="GEN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15"/>A yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “N ma bɔxɔn dɛɛn bata rabi i xa. I na wa lu feni dɛdɛ bɔxɔni ito ma, lu mɛnni.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16"/>A yi a fala Saran xa, a naxa, “N bata gbeti gbanan wuli keden so i tada yii i solona seen na i tan nun i sigati boden birin yɛɛ xɔri alogo i xa xunna kenla sɔtɔ.” <verse eid="GEN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17"/>Iburahima yi Ala maxandi, na waxatini Ala yi Abimeleki rakɛndɛya alogo a ɲaxanla nun a konyi gilɛne xa nɔ diin barideni. <verse eid="GEN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18"/>Alatala bata yi dii baritareyaan nagidi nun Abimeleki a muxune ma Iburahima a ɲaxanla Saran ma fe ra.<verse eid="GEN 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Isiyaga bari lɔxɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1"/>Alatala yi hinan Saran na, a a falan nakamali. <verse eid="GEN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2"/>Saran yi fudikan. A yi diin bari Iburahima xa a foriyani Ala waxatin naxan fala a xa. <verse eid="GEN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3"/>Iburahima yi a diin xili sa Isiyaga, Saran naxan sɔtɔxi a xa.<verse eid="GEN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4"/>A yi a dii Isiyaga banxulan a xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni alo Ala a yamari kii naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5"/>Iburahima bata yi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ sɔtɔ siimayaan na, Isiyaga bari waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6"/>Saran yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala bata n nagele sɛwani. Muxun naxanye na n ma dii Isiyaga bari feen mɛ, en birin sɛwama nɛn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">21.6</char> <char style="fk">Isiyaga</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “A gelema.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7"/>A mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Nde yi nɔɛ a falɛ Iburahima xa a lɔxɔna nde fama a lideni, Saran findima nɛn dii ngan na? Koni n tan bata diin bari a xa a xɛmɛ foriyani.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iburahima yi Hagara kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8"/>Diin to gbo, e yi a dɛɛn ba xiɲɛn na. Iburahima yi sɛwa sumunna belebele yitɔn, a dii Isiyaga dɛɛ ba lɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9"/>Misiran kaan Hagara diin naxan barixi Iburahima xa, Saran yi na diin to gelɛ. <verse eid="GEN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10"/>A yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “Konyi ɲaxanli ito nun a diin kedi. E nun n ma dii Isiyaga nama lu kɛɛ kedenni.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11"/>Na falan mi rafan Iburahima ma a diina fe ra. <verse eid="GEN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12"/>Koni Ala yi a fala Iburahima xa, a naxa, “I nama xɔlɔ i ya diina fe ra e nun i ya konyi ɲaxanla. Saran na feen naxan birin maxɔdin i ma, a birin liga a xa, bayo naxanye yatɛma i bɔnsɔnna ra, ne minima Isiyaga bɔnsɔnna nin. <verse eid="GEN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13"/>N siyana nde fan naminima nɛn i ya konyi ɲaxanla diini, bayo i ya diin nan a fan na.” <verse eid="GEN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14"/>Iburahima yi keli subaxan ma. A yi burun nun kidi sagbaan tongo igen yi naxan kui. A yi na birin nate Hagara xun ma, a yi diin so a yii, a yi e birin kedi. Hagara yi a xun ti tonbon yiren na dɛnaxan xili “Bɛriseba.”<verse eid="GEN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15"/>Igen to ɲan a kidi sagbaan kui, a yi a diin sa wudidin bun ma. <verse eid="GEN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16"/>A yi siga, a sa dɔxɔ a danna xalimakuli wolide keden ɲɔxɔndɔn yi. A yi a fala, a naxa, “N mi nɔɛ n yɛɛn tiyɛ n ma diin faxamatɔɔn na.” A yi siga, a sa dɔxɔ a danna, a yi lu tɛ a ma, a wuga. <verse eid="GEN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17"/>Ala yi diin wuga xuiin mɛ kore. Alaa malekan yi Hagara xili, a yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Hagara nanse i sɔtɔxi? I nama gaxu bayo Ala bata diin wuga xuiin mɛ kore. <verse eid="GEN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18"/>Keli i ti! I ya diin tongo i yii firinna ra, i xa a suxu, bayo n na a findima siya gbee kanna nan na.”<verse eid="GEN 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19"/>Ala yi Hagara yɛɛn nabi, a yi xɔɲinna to, igena a kui. A yi na kidi sagbaan tongo, a sa igen sa a kui. A yi igen fi a diin ma. <verse eid="GEN 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20"/>Ala yi a yengi lu diin xɔn ma han a yi gbo. A yi siga a sa dɔxɔ tonbonni. A yi findi xalimakuli wonla ra. <verse eid="GEN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21"/>A yi dɔxɔ Paran tonbonni. A nga yi Misiran kaa ɲaxalan keden fen a xa.<verse eid="GEN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iburahima layirin naxan xidi e nun Abimeleki tagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22"/>Na waxatini, Abimeleki nun a sofa mangana Pikoli, ne yi fa Iburahima li, e a fala a xa, e naxa, “Ala luxi i xɔn ma i ya feen birin yi. <verse eid="GEN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23"/>I kɔlɔ n xa Ala xinli, fa fala i mi n yanfɛ, i mi n ma diine yanfɛ, i mi n mamandenne fan yanfɛ. I xa hinan n na e nun bɔxɔni ito muxune, i dɛnaxan yi, alo n na a liga i xa kii naxan yi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24"/>Iburahima yi a yabi, a naxa, “N bata n kɔlɔ Ala yi.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25"/>Iburahima yi a mawuga Abimeleki xa, a walikɛne bata a xɔɲinna ba a yii. <verse eid="GEN 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26"/>Abimeleki yi a yabi, a naxa, “N ma kolon naxan na feen ligaxi i ra. I mi dɛntɛgɛni ito saxi n xa, fɔ to n tan yi fa a kolon.”<verse eid="GEN 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27"/>Iburahima yi yɛxɛɛne nun siine nun ɲingene tongo, a yi e so Abimeleki yii. E yi layirin tongo e bode xa. <verse eid="GEN 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28"/>Iburahima yi yɛxɛɛ dii solofere tongo, a yi e sa e danna. <verse eid="GEN 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29"/>Abimeleki yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nanfera, i na yɛxɛɛ dii soloferene saxi e danna?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30"/>Iburahima yi a yabi, a naxa, “N ne soma nɛn i yii, alogo i xa a kolon, a n tan nan xɔɲinni ito gexi.”<verse eid="GEN 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31"/>Nanara, mɛnna xili saxi Bɛriseba, bayo e firinna birin e kɔlɔ mɛnna nin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">21.31</char> <char style="fk">Bɛriseba </char>bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Marakɔlɔ xɔɲinna.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32"/>E yi layirin tongo e bode xa Bɛriseba. Na dangu xanbini, Abimeleki nun a sofa mangana Pikoli, e yi ti kiraan xɔn ma xɛtɛ Filisiti bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33"/>Iburahima yi tamaro wudi bili keden si Bɛriseba bɔxɔn ma. A yi Alatala maxandi a xinla ra, Habadan Ala. <verse eid="GEN 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34"/>Iburahima ɲɛɛ wuyaxi ti nɛn Filisiti bɔxɔni.<verse eid="GEN 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22"/>
  <para style="s">Iburahimaa saraxana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1"/>Na feene dangu xanbini, Ala yi Iburahima kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ. A yi a xili, a naxa, “Iburahima.” Iburahima yi a ratin, a naxa, “N tan ni i ra.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2"/>Ala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I ya diin tongo, Isiyaga, i ya dii keden peena, naxan nafan i ma, i xa a xali Moriya yamanani geyaan fari,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muluku Sulemani Ala Batu Banxin ti mɛnna nin. Na feen sɛbɛxi Taruxune 3.1 kui. </char></note> n na dɛnaxan yita i ra. I xa a ba n xa saraxa gan daxin na.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3"/>Subaxan ma, Iburahima yi keli, a yi dɔxɔ seni tɔn a sofanla fari. A yi a walikɛ firin tongo e nun Isiyaga, a diina. Iburahima yi yegeni bɔ naxan findima tɛɛ yitɔn seen na saraxa badeni. A yi siga yireni Ala dɛnaxan yitaxi a ra. <verse eid="GEN 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4"/>Na xii saxande lɔxɔni, Iburahima yɛɛn yi ti na yire makuyen na, a sigama dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5"/>A yi a fala a walikɛ firinna xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tan nun sofanla xa lu be. Nxu nun n ma diin sigama geyaan fari Ala batudeni. Na waxatini nxu mɔn xɛtɛma han be.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6"/>Iburahima yi na yegen dɔxɔ Isiyaga xun ma, a diina. A mɔn yi tɛɛ wolonna nun filɛn xali. E sigan tima e firinna. <verse eid="GEN 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7"/>Isiyaga yi a baba Iburahima xili, a naxa, “N baba.” A yi a ratin, a naxa, “N tan ni i ra, n ma diina.” Isiyaga yi a baba maxɔdin, a naxa, “N bata a to yegen nun tɛɛ wolonna en yii, koni yɛxɛɛ diin minɛn yi en naxan bama saraxan na?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8"/>Iburahima yi a yabi, a naxa, “N ma diina, Ala yatin nan yɛxɛɛ diin fima en ma, en naxan bama saraxa gan daxin na.” E sigan tima e firinna.<verse eid="GEN 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9"/>E to e soden li, Ala dɛnaxan yitaxi a ra, Iburahima yi saraxa ganden nafala mɛnni, a yi yegen sa na. A yi a diin xidi, Isiyaga. A yi a rate na saraxa ganden fari, a yi a dɔxɔ yegen fari. <verse eid="GEN 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi filɛn tongo, a yi a yiini bandun, a xa a diin kɔɛ raxaba, <verse eid="GEN 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11"/>koni Alatalaa malekan yi a xili kore, a naxa, “Iburahima hɛ, Iburahima hɛ!” Iburahima yi a ratin, a naxa, “N tan ni i ra.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12"/>Malekan yi a fala, a naxa, “Banxulanni ito lu na. I nama fe ɲaxi yo liga a ra. N bata a kolon i gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra. N mɔn bata la a ra, i mi tondixi i ya dii kedenna fideni n ma saraxan na.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13"/>Iburahima yi a yɛɛn naxɛtɛ a xanbi ra, a yi yɛxɛɛ kontonna to fɔtɔnna yii ra, a feri firinna kankanxi ɲansanni. A yi sa na yɛxɛɛ kontonna tongo, a fa a ra. A yi na ba saraxan na a diin ɲɔxɔn na. <verse eid="GEN 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14"/>Iburahima yi na yiren xili sa “Alatala nan fama a ra.” Nanara, han iki a falama “Alatala nan fama a ra a geyaan fari.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15"/>Alatalaa malekan mɔn yi Iburahima xili kore. <verse eid="GEN 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16"/>A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N bata n kɔlɔ n yɛtɛni, Alatalaa falan ni ito ra. Bayo i bata ito liga, i mi tondi i ya dii kedenna ma n xa, <verse eid="GEN 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17"/>n na i barakama nɛn han! I bɔnsɔnna wuyama ayi nɛn alo saren naxanye koren ma, xa na mi a ra e wuyama ayi nɛn alo mɛɲɛnsinna naxan malanxi baa dɛɛn na. I bɔnsɔnna e yaxune nɔma nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18"/>Dunuɲa siyane birin duban sɔtɔma nɛn i tan bɔnsɔnna barakani, bayo i bata n xuiin suxu.”<verse eid="GEN 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19"/>Iburahima yi xɛtɛ a walikɛne yireni. E birin yi siga Bɛriseba, bayo Iburahima yi dɔxi mɛnna nin.<verse eid="GEN 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20"/>Na feene birin to dangu, Iburahima yi a mɛ, a Milika bata diini itoe bari a xunyɛn Nahori xa: <verse eid="GEN 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21"/>A dii singena Yusu nun na xanbiratɔna Busi nun Arami baba Kɛmuyɛli <verse eid="GEN 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22"/>nun Kesede nun Xaso nun Pilidasi nun Yidilafi e nun Betuyeli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23"/>Betuyeli Rebeka nan sɔtɔ. Milika nan na dii solomasɛxɛn bari Iburahima xunyɛ Nahori xa. <verse eid="GEN 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24"/>Nahori a konyi ɲaxanla, na yi xili nɛn Reyuma. A yi diine bari. Na diine yi xili nɛn: Teba nun Gaxami nun Tahaka e nun Maka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23"/>
  <para style="s">Iburahimaa muxu maluxundena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1"/>Saran ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun solofere nan sɔtɔ siimayaan na. <verse eid="GEN 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2"/>A yi faxa Kiriyati-Aruba yi, naxan mɔn xili “Xebiron,” Kanan bɔxɔni. Iburahima yi a ɲaxanla saya feen liga, a yi a wuga. <verse eid="GEN 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3"/>Iburahima yi keli, a ɲaxalan binbin saxi dɛnaxan yi, a yi siga Xitine fɛma. A yi sa falani ito ti e xa, a naxa, <verse eid="GEN 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4"/>“Xɔɲɛn nan n tan na ɛ tagi be. N bata ɛ maxandi, ɛ gaburu yiren fi n ma, n nɔɛ n ma ɲaxanla maluxunɲɛ dɛnaxan yi.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5"/>Xitine yi a yabi, <verse eid="GEN 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6"/>e naxa, “Nxu kanna, i tuli mati nxu ra a faɲin na! Alaa muxu gbeen nan i ra nxu tagi. I na wa i ya ɲaxanla maluxun feni nxɔ gaburu yire yo yi, i sagoon na a ra. Nxu tan tagi be, muxu yo mi na naxan nɔɛ tondɛ i xa, i ya ɲaxanla maluxundeni a gaburu yireni.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7"/>Iburahima yi keli. A yi a xinbi sin mɛn kaane xa, Xiti bɔnsɔnna. <verse eid="GEN 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xa ɛ bata tin, n xa nɔ n ma ɲaxanla maluxundeni ɛ gaburu yireni, n fan bata ɛ maxandi ɛ xa nɔ n ma maxandin nadangudeni, Soxara a dii Eferon ma <verse eid="GEN 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9"/>alogo a xa Makipela faranna so n yii. Bayo, n na a kolon a tan nan gbee mɛnna ra, na mɔn a xɛɛn nan dɛxɔn. A xa na sara n ma ɛ yɛɛ xɔri, alogo birin xa a kolon, na bɔxɔn bata findi n ma muxu maluxunden na.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10"/>Eferon Xiti kaan yi tixi a yamaan tagi. A yi Iburahima yabi a xuini texin na alogo Xitine nun muxun naxanye birin yi malanxi taan so dɛɛn na, e xa nɔ a falan namɛdeni. <verse eid="GEN 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11"/>“Nba, n bata i maxandi, n kanna, i tuli mati n na. Ɛn-ɛn, n bata xɛɛn nun faranni ito fi i ma n bɔnsɔnna yɛɛ xɔri. I ya ɲaxanla maluxun mɛnni.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12"/>Iburahima mɔn yi a xinbi sin, yamaan birin yɛɛ xɔri. <verse eid="GEN 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13"/>A yi falan ti Eferon xa, a naxa, “I fan xa i tuli mati n na. N ni i ya xɛɛn saren fima nɛn. A rasuxu, yandi, n gbetin naxan soma i yii alogo n xa nɔ n ma ɲaxanla maluxundeni mɛnni.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14"/>Eferon mɔn yi falan tongo, <verse eid="GEN 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15"/>a naxa, “Nba, i tuli mati n na a faɲin na. Bɔxɔn naxan saren lanma gbeti gbanan kɛmɛ naanin ma, sese mi na ra, i tan nun n tan tagi. I ya ɲaxanla maluxun na.”<verse eid="GEN 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16"/>Iburahima yi tin Eferon ma falan ma. A yi gbetin tɛngɛ, a naxan ma fe fala a bodene yɛɛ xɔri, Xitine, na gbeti gbanan kɛmɛ naanin yi maliga alo yulane yi darixi a ligɛ kii naxan yi na waxatini. <verse eid="GEN 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17"/>Eferon ma xɛɛn naxan yi Makipela yi, Mamire sogetede binna e nun faranna naxan na, e nun wudi binla naxanye birin sixi xɛɛn danne ra, <verse eid="GEN 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18"/>ne birin yi findi Iburahima gbeen na. Na Xitine nun muxun naxanye birin yi malanxi taan so dɛɛn na, e birin yi findi na fe serene ra.<verse eid="GEN 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19"/>Na birin dangu xanbini, Iburahima yi a ɲaxanla Saran maluxun na faranna ra Makipela xɛɛn ma, naxan Mamire yɛtagi, Xebiron yi, Kanan bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20"/>Na xɛɛn nun na faranna yi ba Xitine gbeeyani, a findi Iburahima gbeen na alogo a xa nɔ a muxu faxaxine maluxundeni mɛnni.<verse eid="GEN 23:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24"/>
  <para style="s">Isiyaga nun Rebeka futu xidina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1"/>Iburahima bata yi fori. Alatala yi Iburahima baraka kirayaan sifan birin xɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2"/>A walikɛɛn naxan fori dangu a walikɛɛn birin na, naxan yengi luxi a yii seen birin xɔn ma, Iburahima yi a fala na xa, a naxa, “I yiin naso n danban bun ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">24.2</char> Mɛn kaane yi na nan ligama e na muxun nakɔlɔ waxatin naxan yi.</note> <verse eid="GEN 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3"/>N fama i rakɔlɔdeni Alatala yi, kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna Ala, alogo i nama ɲaxanla fen n ma diin xa naxan findɛ Kanan kaan na n dɔxi dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4"/>I sigama n bari bɔxɔn nan ma, n bɔnsɔnni, i mɛnna ɲaxalan keden fen Isiyaga xa, n ma diina.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5"/>A walikɛɛn yi a yabi, a naxa, “Yanyina nde, na ɲaxanla mi birɛ n fɔxɔ ra fa bɔxɔni ito yi. Fɔ n xa i ya diin xali mɛnni, i ya bɔxɔni, i kelixi dɛnaxan yi ba?” <verse eid="GEN 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6"/>Iburahima yi a yabi, a naxa, “I nama n ma diin naxɛtɛ n kelideni de! <verse eid="GEN 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7"/>Alatala, Ala Naxan Kore, naxan n tongoxi n bari muxune tagi e nun n bɔnsɔnni, naxan falan tixi n xa, naxan a kɔlɔxi a bɔxɔni ito soma nɛn n bɔnsɔnna yii, a tan yatina a malekan nasigama i yɛ ra nɛn alogo i xa nɔ ɲaxanla sɔtɔdeni n ma diin xa mɛnni. <verse eid="GEN 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8"/>Xa ɲaxanla mi fa sa tin birɛ i fɔxɔ ra, i fama nɛn natangadeni n ma kɔlɔn ma, i naxan tongoxi n xa. Koni i nama xɛtɛ n ma diin na mɛnni.”<verse eid="GEN 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9"/>Walikɛɛn yi a yiin naso a kanna Iburahima danban bun ma, a yi a kɔlɔ na ma. <verse eid="GEN 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10"/>Walikɛɛn yi ɲɔgɔmɛ fu tongo Iburahima a ɲɔgɔmɛne tagi e nun se faɲi gbegbe. A yi keli, a yi siga Nahori a taani, Mesopotamiya yamanan kɔmɛn fɔxɔni.<verse eid="GEN 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11"/>Ɲinbari waxatini, a yi xɔɲinna li naxan gexi taan fari ma. A yi ɲɔgɔmɛne rafelen mɛnni. Ɲaxanle yi fama ige badeni na xɔɲinna nan na.<verse eid="GEN 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12"/>A yi Ala maxandi, a naxa, “Alatala, n kanna Iburahimaa Ala, n bata i maxandi alogo n ma sigatiin xa findi xunna kenla ra n xa to. I xa hinan n kanna Iburahima ra. <verse eid="GEN 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13"/>I bata n to xɔɲinna dɛxɔn ma, taan sungutunne fama ige badeni dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14"/>N sungutunna nde maxɔdinma nɛn, a xa a ige ba seen so n yii, n yi igen min. Xa a li, a n yabi iki, a naxa, ‘I xa igen min, n mɔn xa igen so i ya ɲɔgɔmɛne fan yii,’ n na a kolonma nɛn na waxatini, i ya ɲaxalan sugandixin yatin nan na ra Isiyaga xa, i ya walikɛna. Na waxatini n na a kolonma nɛn, a i bata hinan n kanna ra.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15"/>Benun a xa yelin na falan tiyɛ, Rebeka yi fa, Betuyeli a dii tɛmɛna, Nahori nun Milika mamandenna. Nahori, Iburahima xunyɛn nan a ra. A fɛɲɛn yi dɔxi a tungunna fari. <verse eid="GEN 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16"/>Sungutun tofaɲin nan yi a ra, naxan mi yi xɛmɛ feen kolon. A yi godo xɔɲin dɛɛn na, a yi a fɛɲɛn nafe igen na, a mɔn yi te. <verse eid="GEN 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17"/>Iburahimaa walikɛɛn yi a gi, a sa a ralan. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Yandi, a lu n xa igena nde min, naxan i ya fɛɲɛn kui.” <verse eid="GEN 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18"/>A yi a yabi, a naxa, “Nba, igen min.” A yi a fɛɲɛn nagodo a tungunna fari, a yi igen so a yii. <verse eid="GEN 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19"/>A to yelin igen soɛ a yii, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N ni igen bama nɛn i ya ɲɔgɔmɛne fan xa alogo e birin xa wasa igen na.”<verse eid="GEN 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20"/>A yi igen sa xuruse mindeni, a mɔn yi siga a giyɛ a sa ige gbɛtɛ sɛgɛ. Ɲɔgɔmɛne birin yi wasa igen na. <verse eid="GEN 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21"/>Xɛmɛni ito yi a dundu, a yi a miri, yanyina nde, Alatala bata n ma sigatiin nasɔnɔya n xa. <verse eid="GEN 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22"/>Ɲɔgɔmɛne to yelin igen minɲɛ, xɛmɛni ito yi xɛma wuredin so sungutunna yii naxan sama ɲɔɛɛn na, na garamu sennin liyɛ, e nun xɛma yiikɔɛraso firin, naxan garamu kɛmɛ liyɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23"/>A yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nde a dii i tan na? Yandi, a fala n xa, xa yigiyana nde i baba konni, nxu xa xi na to kɔɛɛn na?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24"/>A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Betuyeli a diin nan n na, Milika nun Nahori mamandenna nan n na.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25"/>Ɲaxanli ito mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Nxu konni sɛxɛn nun ɲɔxɔndedɛ gbegbeen na, yigiyaden fan na ɛ luma dɛnaxan yi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26"/>Xɛmɛni ito yi a xinbi sin Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="GEN 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27"/>A yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala, n kanna Iburahimaa Ala, n bata i tantun. I hinanma n kanna Iburahima ra waxatin birin. I ya lannayaan mi kalɛ. N ma sigatini, Alatala, n xunna tixi yiren nan na, dɛnaxan findixi n kanna Iburahima xunyɛn konna ra.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28"/>Sungutunni ito yi a gi siga a konni, a sa xɔɲɛni ito a fe fala a nga xa. <verse eid="GEN 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29"/>Rebeka tadana nde yi na naxan xili Laban. A yi mini mafurɛn, a yi siga xɔɲin dɛɛn na xɛmɛn tixi dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30"/>A bata yi ɲɔɛrasoon nun yiikɔɛrasoon to a xunyɛn ɲaxalanmaan yii. A mɔn bata yi a xunyɛn dɛntɛgɛ xuiin mɛ xɛmɛna falana fe ra. A yi siga xɛmɛni ito yireni a tixi xɔɲinna fɛma e nun ɲɔgɔmɛne.<verse eid="GEN 24:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31"/>A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Fa be, Alatala barakan fixi naxan ma. Nanfera i tixi tandeni? N bata banxini tɔn i yigiyadena e nun ɲɔgɔmɛne lan e xa lu dɛnaxan yi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32"/>Xɛmɛni ito yi so Laban konni. Laban yi goronna ragodo ɲɔgɔmɛne fari. A sɛxɛn so e yii e nun ɲɔxɔndedɛna e naxan donma. A yi igen fan so xɛmɛni ito yii, e nun muxun naxanye birin biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, alogo e xa e sanne maxa. <verse eid="GEN 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33"/>A yi fa donseen na e xa, koni a yi a fala, a naxa, “N mi n dɛgema singe, fɔ n xa falan ti ɛ xa, n lanma n xa naxan yita ɛ ra.” Laban yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Falan ti xɛ.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34"/>Xɛmɛni ito yi a fala, a naxa, “N tan Iburahimaa walikɛɛn nan n na. <verse eid="GEN 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35"/>Alatala bata baraka gbegbeen nagidi n kanna Iburahima ma. A bata findi nafulu kanna ra, bayo Ala bata xuruseen sifan birin fi a ma e nun gbetin nun xɛmaan nun walikɛ xɛmɛne nun walikɛ ɲaxanle nun ɲɔgɔmɛne nun sofanle. Ala bata na birin fi a ma. <verse eid="GEN 24:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36"/>N kanna Iburahima a ɲaxanla Saran, hali a to yi forixi, a yi diin bari a ma. A kɛɛn birin soxi diini ito nan yii.”<verse eid="GEN 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37"/>“Iburahima n nakɔlɔxi nɛn, a naxa, ‘I nama ɲaxanla tongo n ma diin xa naxan findɛ Kanan kaan na n dɔxi dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38"/>I xa siga n baba denbayani n bɔnsɔnni alogo i xa ɲaxanla fen n ma diin xa mɛnni.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39"/>Na waxatini, n yi n kanna maxɔdin, n naxa, ‘Xa na ɲaxanla fa tondi biradeni n fɔxɔ ra go?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40"/>A yi n yabi, a naxa, ‘N sigan tima Alatala naxan yɛtagi, na fama nɛn a malekan biradeni i fɔxɔ ra alogo i ya sigatiin xa sɔnɔya. I fama nɛn ɲaxanla tongodeni n ma diin xa n bɔnsɔnni, n baba denbayani. <verse eid="GEN 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41"/>Na waxatini i na siga n bɔnsɔnna tagi, xa e mi fa sa sungutunna so i yii, i bata ratanga n ma marakɔlɔn ma.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42"/>“N to xɔɲinna yiren li, n yi maxandin ti, n naxa, ‘Alatala, n kanna Iburahimaa Ala, xa i bata a ɲɛnige n xa, i xa n ma sigatiin nasɔnɔya, <verse eid="GEN 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43"/>i yɛɛn ti n na xɔɲinna dɛxɔn ma. N fama nɛn sungutunna nde maxɔdindeni naxan fama ige badeni, a a xa igen so n yii naxan a fɛɲɛn kui alogo n xa n min. <verse eid="GEN 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44"/>Xa a n yabi, a naxa, “Igen min, n na igen bama nɛn i ya ɲɔgɔmɛne fan xa, e min,” n na a kolonma nɛn na waxatini, Alatalaa sungutun sugandixin yatin nan na ra n kanna Iburahima a diin xa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45"/>“Benun n xa yelin na falan tiyɛ n yɛtɛ ma, Rebeka yi fa, fɛɲɛn dɔxi a tungunna fari. A yi godo xɔɲin dɛɛn na, a yi igen ba. N yi a maxɔdin, n naxa, ‘Yandi igen so n yii, n xa n min.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46"/>A yi a fɛɲɛn nagodo mafurɛn a tungunna fari, a yi a fala n xa, a naxa, ‘Igen min, i na yelin igen minɲɛ, n na igen soma nɛn i ya ɲɔgɔmɛne fan yii.’ N yi n min, a mɔn yi igen so ɲɔgɔmɛne yii. <verse eid="GEN 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47"/>N yi a maxɔdin, n naxa, ‘Nde a dii i tan na?’ A yi n yabi, a naxa, ‘Betuyeli a diin nan n na, Nahori nun Milika mamandenna nan n na.’ N yi xɛma wuredin so a ɲɔɛɛn na, n mɔn yi xɛma yiirasone so a yii kɔɛɛn na. <verse eid="GEN 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48"/>N yi n xinbi sin Alatala yɛtagi. N yi Alatala tantun, n kanna Iburahimaa Ala, bayo a bata n ti kira faɲin xɔn ma alogo n xa n kanna xunyɛna dii ɲaxalanmaan tongo a diin xa. <verse eid="GEN 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49"/>Iki, a fala n xa, xa i hinanma n kanna ra lannayani. Xa na mi a ra, n sigama nɛn yire gbɛtɛ yi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50"/>Laban nun Betuyeli yi a yabi, a naxa, “Alatala nan feni itoe ragidixi. Nxu mi na matandɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51"/>Rebeka nan tixi i yɛtagi ito ra. A xali i yii, alogo a xa findi i kanna diina ɲaxanla ra, alo Alatala a fala kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52"/>Iburahimaa walikɛɛn to na fala xuine mɛ, a yi a xinbi sin Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="GEN 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi muran gbeti daxin nun xɛma daxin nun dugine ramini a goronne yɛ, a e so Rebeka yii. A yi Rebeka nga nun a tada fan ki. <verse eid="GEN 24:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54"/>Iburahima a walikɛɛn nun a fɔxɔrabirane, e birin yi e dɛge, e igen min, e yi so e sadeni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">E to keli xɔtɔnni, Iburahimaa walikɛɛn yi a fala Rebeka nga nun a tada xa, a naxa, “Ɛ a lu fa n xa xɛtɛ n kanna konni.” <verse eid="GEN 24:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Sungutunni ito xa lu be singen, a xa xii fu ɲɔxɔn liga be waxatini ito yi, na xanbi ra, i siga.” <verse eid="GEN 24:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56"/>Walikɛɛn mɔn yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ nama n makankan be. Alatala bata n ma sigatiin findi n ma xunna kenla ra. Ɛ a lu fa n xa xɛtɛ n kanna konni.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “En sungutunni ito xili ba, en na a maxɔdin, en xa a ɲɛnigen kolon.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58"/>E yi Rebeka xili, e yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “I waxi siga feni ba, ɛ nun xɛmɛni ito?” Rebeka yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɔn, n waxi siga feni.” <verse eid="GEN 24:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59"/>E yi e xunyɛn Rebeka so e yii e nun ɲaxanla naxan yi a maxuruma. E nun Iburahima walikɛɛn nun a muxune yi siga.<verse eid="GEN 24:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60"/>E yi duba Rebeka xa, e naxa, “I tan nxu xunyɛna. Ala xa i yixɛtɛne rawuya ayi han wuli wuli wuyaxi, e nɔɔn sɔtɔ e yaxune xun na.” <verse eid="GEN 24:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61"/>Rebeka nun a walikɛ ɲaxanle yi dɔxɔ ɲɔgɔmɛne fari, e yi bira Iburahima a walikɛɛn fɔxɔ ra, e birin yi siga.<verse eid="GEN 24:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62"/>Isiyaga bata yi keli Lahayi Royi xɔɲinna yireni. A yi siga Negewi bɔxɔni, a sa dɔxɔ na. <verse eid="GEN 24:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63"/>Ɲinbanna nde ra, a minixi a masigadeni, a yi ɲɔgɔmɛne to fɛ. <verse eid="GEN 24:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64"/>Rebeka to Isiyaga to, a yi tugan ɲɔgɔmɛne fari, a godo bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 24:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65"/>A yi walikɛɛn maxɔdin, a naxa, “Muxun mundun ito ra naxan fama en nalandeni xɛɛn ma?” <verse eid="GEN 24:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66"/>Iburahima a walikɛɛn yi a yabi, a naxa, “N kanna nan na ra.” Nayi, a yi dugin so a yɛtagin xun na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:66">Walikɛni ito yi a fala Isiyaga xa, a feen naxanye birin ligaxi. <verse eid="GEN 24:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67"/>Na xanbi ra, Isiyaga yi Rebeka tongo, a yi a xali bubuna nde kui, a nga Saran yi dɔxi dɛnaxan yi nun. Rebeka yi findi a ɲaxanla ra. A yi a xanu. Isiyaga nga faxa sunun yi ba a ma Rebekaa fe ra.<verse eid="GEN 24:67"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25"/>
  <para style="s">Iburahima faxa fena</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 1.32,33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1"/>Iburahima mɔn yi ɲaxalan gbɛtɛn tongo naxan xili Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2"/>Na ɲaxanla yi diine bari a xa. Na diine yi xili: Simiran nun Yokan nun Medan nun Midiyan nun Yisebaki e nun Suwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3"/>Yokan yi Saba nun Dedan bari. Dedan yixɛtɛne findixi Asuri kaane nan na, e nun Letusin kaane nun Leyumin kaane. <verse eid="GEN 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4"/>Midiyan ma diine nan Efa nun Efere nun Xanɔki nun Abida nun Elida ra. Keturaa diine nan e birin na.<verse eid="GEN 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5"/>Seen naxan birin findi Iburahima gbeen na, a yi a birin so Isiyaga yii. <verse eid="GEN 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6"/>Naxanye findi a konyi ɲaxanle diine ra, a yi e ki a siimayani. A yi e rasiga yireni, dɛnaxan makuya a dii Isiyaga ra sogetede mabinni.<verse eid="GEN 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7"/>Iburahima a siimayaan yi siga han ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge solofere e nun suulun. <verse eid="GEN 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8"/>A to siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔ, a fori ki faɲi, a yi faxa, a yi siga laxira yi. <verse eid="GEN 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9"/>A diine Isiyaga nun Sumayila yi a maluxun faranna ra, Makipela, dɛnaxan yi Eferon ma xɛɛn ma, Soxara a diina, Xiti kaana, Mamire fɛma. <verse eid="GEN 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10"/>Iburahima na xɛɛn sara Xitine bɔnsɔnna nan ma. E nun a ɲaxanla Saran, e birin maluxunxi mɛnna nin. <verse eid="GEN 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11"/>Iburahima to faxa, Ala yi a dii Isiyaga baraka naxan dɔxɔ Lahayi Royi xɔɲinna fɛma.<verse eid="GEN 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sumayilaa taruxuna</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 1.28-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12"/>Sumayila bɔnsɔnne xinle nan itoe ra. Saran bata yi a konyi ɲaxanla Misiran kaa Hagara fi Iburahima ma. Hagara yi Sumayila sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13"/>Sumayilaa diine xinle ni itoe ra: Nebayoti Sumayilaa dii singen nun Kedari nun Adibeli nun Mibisan nun <verse eid="GEN 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14"/>Misema nun Duma nun Masa nun <verse eid="GEN 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15"/>Xadada nun Tema nun Yeturi nun Nafisi e nun Kedema. Na dii fu nun firinna findi Sumayilaa diine nan na. <verse eid="GEN 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16"/>Na muxu keden kedenna, ne findi bɔxɔ mangane nan na. E yi e xinle sa e taane xun ma e nun e muxune. <verse eid="GEN 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17"/>Sumayilaa siimayaan yi dan ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge saxan nun solofere nin. A yi faxa, a siga laxira yi. <verse eid="GEN 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18"/>Sumayila bɔnsɔnna yi dɔxɔ na bɔxɔni dɛnaxan yi Xawila nun Suru tagi. Suru yɛɛn nafindixi Misiran nan ma Asuri kiraan na. E yi dɔxi e ngaxakedenne nan dɛxɔn ma.<verse eid="GEN 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esayu nun Yaxuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19"/>Isiyaga bɔnsɔnne taruxun ni i ra. Isiyaga findi Iburahima a diin nan na. <verse eid="GEN 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20"/>Isiyaga to ɲɛɛ tonge naanin sɔtɔ siimayaan na, a yi Rebeka dɔxɔ, Laban xunyɛ ɲaxalanmana, Betuyeli a dii tɛmɛna. Arami kaane nan e ra, e kelixi Padan-Arami nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21"/>Koni Rebeka mi nɔ diin barɛ a xa. Isiyaga yi Alatala maxandi a ɲaxanla fe ra a xa nɔ dii barideni. Alatala yi a maxandin nasuxu, Rebeka yi fudikan. <verse eid="GEN 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22"/>Na diine yi lu yɛngɛ e nga kui. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Nanfera n kuina n tɔrɔma?” A yi Alatala maxɔdin. <verse eid="GEN 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23"/>Alatala yi a yabi, a naxa, “Siya dɔxɔde firin nan i kuini. Kedenna sɛnbɛn gboma nɛn boden xa. Tadan luma nɛn a xunyɛna nɔɔn bun ma.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24"/>A diin bari waxatin to a li, e yi a to a gulunne nan yi Rebeka kui. <verse eid="GEN 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25"/>Diin naxan singe bari muxu gbeela nan yi a ra. Fati ma xabe gbegbe kanna nan yi a ra. E yi a xili sa Esayu. <verse eid="GEN 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26"/>Na xanbi ra, a xunyɛn fan yi bari. A yiin naxutuxi a tada Esayu santinban ma. E yi a xili sa Yaxuba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">25.26</char> Heburu xuini, <char style="fk">Yaxuba</char> xinla maliga xuina nde ra naxan bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Santinbana.”</note> Rebeka na diine barima waxatin naxan yi, Isiyaga ɲɛɛ tonge sennin nan yi a ra.<verse eid="GEN 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27"/>Na dii xɛmɛ firinna yi gbo. Esayu yi findi donso faɲin na naxan yi wulani sigama. Yaxuba findi muxu maxunbelixin nan na, a tan yi luma bubun nan bun ma. <verse eid="GEN 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28"/>Esayu nan yi rafan Isiyaga ma, a sube faxaxine fe ra, koni Yaxuba nan yi rafan Rebeka ma.<verse eid="GEN 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29"/>Lɔxɔna nde Yaxuba yi pɔrin nafala. Esayu to so, a xadanxi keli donsoyani. <verse eid="GEN 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30"/>A yi a fala Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “N mi nɔɛ fefe ra iki. A lu n xa pɔri gbeeli ito nde kɔn.” Na nan a toxi a yi xili sa, Edɔn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">25.30</char> Heburu xuini, <char style="fk">Edɔn</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “A gbeeli.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31"/>Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “I ya foriyaan tiden fi n ma singen.” <verse eid="GEN 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32"/>Esayu yi a fala, a naxa, “N faxa feni kamɛn nan ma iki. Na foriya tiden nanse fanma n ma?” <verse eid="GEN 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33"/>Yaxuba mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Fɔ i xa i kɔlɔ.” Esayu yi a kɔlɔ, a bata a foriya tiden fi a ma. <verse eid="GEN 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34"/>Yaxuba yi burun nun pɔrin toge daxi so a yii. Esayu yi ne don, a yi a min. A yi siga. Nanara, Esayu mi a foriya tiden yatɛ sese ra.<verse eid="GEN 25:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26"/>
  <para style="s">Isiyaga nun Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1"/>Kamɛn yi so bɔxɔni, ba a singen na naxan so Iburahima waxatini. Isiyaga yi siga Gerari yi, Filisiti manga Abimeleki konni. <verse eid="GEN 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2"/>Alatala yi mini Isiyaga xa. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I nama siga Misiran bɔxɔni de! Lu na bɔxɔni n na dɛnaxan yita i ra. <verse eid="GEN 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3"/>I lu na. En birin na a ra. N ni i barakama nɛn, bayo n fama bɔxɔni ito fideni i tan nun i bɔnsɔnne nan ma. N layirin naxan tongo i baba Iburahima xa, n na rakamalima nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4"/>N na i bɔnsɔnna rawuyama ayi nɛn alo saren naxanye kore. N bɔxɔni ito fima nɛn i bɔnsɔnna ma. Dunuɲa siyane birin duban sɔtɔma nɛn i tan bɔnsɔnna barakan nin, <verse eid="GEN 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5"/>bayo Iburahima n xuiin namɛ nɛn, a yi n gelene nun n ma yamarine nun n ma tɔnne nun n ma sariyane suxu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6"/>Isiyaga yi dɔxɔ Gerari yi. <verse eid="GEN 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7"/>Muxun naxanye dɔxi mɛnni, ne yi a maxɔdin a ɲaxanla fe ma. A yi e yabi, a xunyɛn ɲaxalanmaan nan a ra. A mi yi susuɛ a falɛ e xa, a ɲaxanla nan Rebeka ra alogo mɛn kaane nama a faxa. A gaxu a falɛ a ɲaxanla na a ra bayo Rebeka ɲaxalan tofaɲin nan yi a ra.<verse eid="GEN 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8"/>Isiyaga to bu na, lɔxɔna nde Abimeleki, Filisitine mangana, na yi a yɛɛn namini banxin foye soden na. A yi a to Isiyaga Rebeka masugusuguma. <verse eid="GEN 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9"/>Abimeleki yi a xili a konni. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I ya ɲaxanla yatin nan ito ra! Nanfera i a falaxi nxu xa, a i xunyɛ ɲaxalanmaan nan a ra?” Isiyaga yi a yabi, a naxa, “N yi gaxuxi nɛn alogo ɛ nama n faxa. Na nan a to, n yi na fala.” <verse eid="GEN 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10"/>Abimeleki mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “I nanse ligaxi nxu ra? Xa muxuna nde fa mini n ma yamaan tagi go, a yi i ya ɲaxanla kolon ɲaxanla ra? Na waxatini i bata nxu findi yulubi tongone ra.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11"/>Abimeleki yi yamarin fi a yamaan birin ma, a naxa, “Muxu yo na maxa xɛmɛni ito nun ɲaxanla ito ra, n na kanna faxama nɛn.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12"/>Na ɲɛɛn na, Isiyaga yi xɛɛn bi bɔxɔni ito ma. A to na xɛɛn xaba, a yi na ɲɔxɔndɔn kɛmɛ sɔtɔ, bayo Alatala bata a baraka. <verse eid="GEN 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13"/>A hɛrin yi lu xun masɛ, a yi findi nafulu kanna ra. <verse eid="GEN 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14"/>A yi findi yɛxɛɛ gbegbe kanna ra e nun siine nun ɲingene nun konyi wuyaxi kanna. Filisitine yi Isiyaga maxɔxɔlɔn.<verse eid="GEN 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isiyagaa layirina e nun Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15"/>Filisitine yi xɔɲinne birin nafe bɛndɛn na, Isiyaga baba Iburahimaa konyine naxanye ge Iburahima waxatini. <verse eid="GEN 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16"/>Abimeleki yi a fala Isiyaga xa, a naxa, “I bata sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ be dangu nxu tan na. Fɔ i xa keli be.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17"/>Isiyaga yi keli na, a siga Gerari lanbanni. A sa dɔxɔ mɛnni. <verse eid="GEN 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18"/>Isiyaga yi xɔɲinne yiba, naxanye yi gexi a baba waxatini. Filisitine na xɔɲinne dutun nɛn Iburahima faxa xanbini. A baba yi na xɔɲinne xinle falama kii naxan yi, Isiyaga mɔn yi ne xinle fala e xun ma na kiini. <verse eid="GEN 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19"/>Isiyagaa konyine mɔn yi xɔɲin gbɛtɛ ge na lanbanni. E yi tigin li a kui. <verse eid="GEN 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20"/>Xuruse rabaan naxanye yi Gerari lanbanni, ne nun Isiyagaa xuruse rabane yi sɔnxɔ na xɔɲinna fe ra. E birin yi a fala, e naxa, “Nxu tan nan gbeen xɔɲinna ra.” Isiyaga yi xɔɲinni ito xili sa Eseki, bayo sɔnxɔn bata bira a fe yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">26.20</char> <char style="fk">Eseki</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Fe matandina.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21"/>A konyine mɔn yi xɔɲin gbɛtɛ ge, sɔnxɔn mɔn yi bira na fan ma fe yi. E yi a xili sa Sitina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">26.21</char> <char style="fk">Sitina</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Tɔɲɛgɛna.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22"/>A yi keli na, a sa xɔɲinna ge yire gbɛtɛ yi. Na xɔɲinna to ge, sɔnxɔn mi bira na tan ma fe yi. E yi na xɔɲinna xili sa, Rehoboti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">26.22</char> <char style="fk">Rehoboti</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Yire yigbeena.”</note> bayo e naxa, “Alatala bata dɔxɔde gbeen fi en ma. En ma feen bata fan bɔxɔni ito ma.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23"/>E yi keli mɛnni, e siga Bɛriseba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24"/>Alatala yi mini a xa kɔɛɛn na. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I fafe Iburahimaa Ala nan n tan na. I nama gaxu fefe ra, en tan na a ra yiren birin yi. N mɔn i barakama nɛn. N ni i bɔnsɔnna rawuyama ayi nɛn Iburahima fe ra, n ma walikɛna.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25"/>Isiyaga yi saraxa ganden nafala mɛnni, a yi fa Alatala maxandi a xinla ra. A yi a bubuni tɔn mɛnni. A konyine mɔn yi xɔɲinna ge na.<verse eid="GEN 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26"/>Abimeleki yi keli Gerari yi, a yi fa, a e xa e bode to. Axusati yi biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, a maxadi tina, e nun Pikoli, a sofa mangana. <verse eid="GEN 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27"/>Isiyaga yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ faxi n todeni nanfera? Ɛ bata n naɲaxu han ɛ bata n kedi ɛ konni.” <verse eid="GEN 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu bata a kolon yati a Alatala luxi i xɔn. Nxu mɔn bata a miri, fɔ en xa layirin tongo en bode xa marakɔlɔni. <verse eid="GEN 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29"/>I kɔlɔ nxu xa, a i mi fama fe xɔlɛn ligadeni nxu ra, bayo nxu fan mi fe kobi yo ligaxi i ra. Fɔ nxu to fe faɲin nan tun ligaxi i xa. Nxu mɔn yi i lu, i xa siga bɔɲɛ xunbenli. Waxatini ito yi, Alatala bata i baraka.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30"/>Isiyaga yi donse gbegbeen nafala e xa. E birin yi e dɛge, e yi e min. <verse eid="GEN 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31"/>Kuye to yiba, e yi e kɔlɔ e bode xa. Isiyaga yi a ɲungu e ma, e yi fata lanni.<verse eid="GEN 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32"/>Na lɔxɔni, Isiyagaa konyine yi fa xɔɲinni ito a fe dɛntɛgɛn sadeni a xa e naxan gexi, e naxa, “Nxu bata igen li xɔɲinni ito ra.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33"/>Isiyaga yi na xɔɲinna xili sa Siba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">26.33</char> <char style="fk">Siba</char> bunna nɛɛn “Marakɔlɔna.”</note> Nanara, han to taani ito xinla falama Bɛriseba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">26.33</char> <char style="fk">Bɛriseba</char> bunna nɛɛn “Marakɔlɔ xɔɲinna.”</note><verse eid="GEN 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esayu a ɲaxanla dɔxɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34"/>Esayu to ɲɛɛ tonge naanin sɔtɔ, a yi Yudita dɔxɔ, Beeri a dii tɛmɛna, e nun Basamati, Elon ma dii tɛmɛna. Ne firinna Xiti kaan nan e ra. <verse eid="GEN 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35"/>E yi Isiyaga nun Rebeka nii yiɲaxu e ma.<verse eid="GEN 26:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27"/>
  <para style="s">Isiyaga yi duba Yaxuba xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1"/>Isiyaga bata yi fori, a yɛɛne bata yi rafɔrɔ. A mi yi fa nɔɛ sese toɛ. A yi a dii forimana, Esayu, xili, a naxa, “N ma diina.” Esayu yi a ratin, a naxa, “N tan ni i ra.” <verse eid="GEN 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2"/>Isiyaga yi a fala, a naxa, “I bata a to, n bata fori. N mi a kolon, n faxama waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3"/>I ya sube faxa seene tongo e nun i ya sagbaan nun i ya xanla. I siga donsoyaan na. I sa fa burunna suben na n xa. <verse eid="GEN 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4"/>I xa na suben ɲin n xa a faɲin na alo a rafan n ma kii naxan yi, i fa a ra n xɔn alogo n xa duba i xa benun n xa faxa.” <verse eid="GEN 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5"/>Na waxatini, Rebeka yi tuli matixi Isiyaga ra, a falatini Esayu xa. Esayu yi siga burunna ra sube faxadeni a baba xa.<verse eid="GEN 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6"/>Rebeka yi a fala a diin Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “N bata i baba xuiin mɛ a falani ito tima Esayu xa, <verse eid="GEN 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7"/>a naxa, ‘Sa suben bun n xa, i fa a ra, i yi a ɲin n xa, n xa a don. N na na suben don, n dubama i xa nɛn Alatala yɛtagi benun n xa faxa.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8"/>Iki, n ma diina, i tuli mati n na ki faɲi. N ni i yamarima naxan na, i xa na liga. <verse eid="GEN 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9"/>Siga xuruseene dɛnaxan yi, i sa fa sii dii faɲin firin na n xa. N xa na rafala a faɲin na alo i baba waxi a xɔn ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10"/>I xa a xali i baba xa alogo a xa duba i tan nan xa benun a xa faxa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11"/>Yaxuba yi a nga Rebeka yabi, a naxa, “Koni, fati ma xaben kanna nan Esayu ra. N tan fati ma xaben mi n ma. <verse eid="GEN 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12"/>N baba na n masuxu, a kolonma nɛn Esayu xa mi a ra. N findima wule falan nan na a tan yi. Benun n xa duban sɔtɔ, n fama dangan nan sɔtɔdeyi na waxatini.” <verse eid="GEN 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13"/>A nga yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, na dangan fama xɛtɛdeni n tan nan ma n ma diina. I naxan ligama, i tuli mati n na. Siga i sa fa na sii dii firinne ra n xa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14"/>Yaxuba yi siga, a sa fa sii dii firinne ra a nga fɛma. A nga yi na donseen nafala alo a rafan Isiyaga ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15"/>Na xanbi ra, Rebeka yi Esayu, a dii singena domaan tongo, domaan naxan fan a dugine yɛ. A yi na ragodo Yaxuba ma, a dii firindena. <verse eid="GEN 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16"/>A yi sii kidine tongo, a yi a diin yiine maxidi e ra e nun a kɔɛna bayo fati ma xabe mi yi a ma. <verse eid="GEN 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17"/>A yi na donseen so a diin Yaxuba yii, e nun buruna a naxan nafalaxi.<verse eid="GEN 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18"/>A yi siga a baba fɛma, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N baba, n tan ni i ra.” A yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nde i tan na, n ma diina?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19"/>Yaxuba yi a baba yabi, a naxa, “Esayu nan n na, i ya diin forimana. I naxan maxɔdinxi n na, n bata fa a ra. Yandi, keli, i dɔxɔ, i n ma sube rafalaxin don, alogo i xa duba n xa.” <verse eid="GEN 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20"/>Isiyaga yi a fala a diin xa, a naxa, “I subeni ito toxi minɛn yi xulɛn, n ma diina?” Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “Alatala i ya Ala nan a fixi n ma.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21"/>Isiyaga yi a fala Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “I maso n na, n xa i masuxu, n ma diina alogo n xa la a ra a Esayu nan yati i ra, n ma diina.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22"/>Yaxuba yi a maso a baba ra. Isiyaga yi a fatin masuxu. A yi a fala, a naxa, “I xuiin maliga Yaxuba xuiin na, koni i yiine tan Esayu yiine nan e ra.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23"/>A mi yi nɔɛ Yaxuba kolonɲɛ bayo a yiine xaben yi e ma, alo a tada Esayu yi kii naxan yi. A yi duba a xa.<verse eid="GEN 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24"/>A mɔn yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “N ma diina Esayu yatin nan i ra?” Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɔn.” <verse eid="GEN 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25"/>Isiyaga yi a fala, a naxa, “Fa donseen na, i naxan nafalaxi, n xa a don. N yi duba i xa.” Yaxuba yi donseen so a baba yii. Isiyaga yi a don. A yi wudi bogi igen fan so a yii alo manpana, a yi na fan min. <verse eid="GEN 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26"/>Na xanbi ra, a baba Isiyaga yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I maso n na, i n sunbu, n ma diina.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27"/>Yaxuba yi a maso a ra, a yi a sunbu. Isiyaga yi a dugine xirin mɛ. Awa, na xanbi ra, a yi duba a xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">“Yɔ! N ma diin xirin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">alo xɛɛna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">Alatala barakan saxi naxan yi.<verse eid="GEN 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28"/>Ala xa xiila fi i ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">naxan kelima kore.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">Ala xa dahamu bɔxɔn fi i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">Ala xa barakan sa i ya xɛɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">Ala xa wudi bogi igen fi i ma.<verse eid="GEN 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29"/>Ala xa i dɔxɔ siyane xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Ala xa siyane magodo i xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">I xa findi i ngaxakedenne yɛɛratiin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">E birin xa e magodo i bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Muxu yo na i danga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na dangan xa xɛtɛ a kanna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Muxu yo na duba i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na kanna fan xa duban sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30"/>Isiyaga to yelin dubadeni Yaxuba xa, a yi mini. A mi bu, Yaxuba tada Esayu fan yi so, sa keli sube bundeni. <verse eid="GEN 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31"/>A fan yi na suben nafala ki faɲi alo a baba waxi a xɔn ma kii naxan yi. A yi fa a ra a baba xa. A yi a fala a baba xa, a naxa, “N baba, keli, i dɔxɔ, i suben don n naxan nafalaxi i xa alogo i xa duba n xa.” <verse eid="GEN 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32"/>A baba Isiyaga yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nde i tan na?” Esayu yi a yabi, a naxa, “Esayu nan n na, i ya diin forimana.” <verse eid="GEN 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33"/>Na feen yi Isiyaga yifu ki faɲi. A fatin birin yi xuruxurun a ma. A yi maxɔdinna ti, a naxa, “Koni nde tan faxi suben nafalaxin na n xa, n naxan donxi iki benun i tan xa fa? N bata duba na kanna xa. A tan nan fama duba sɔtɔdeni.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34"/>Esayu to a baba falan mɛ, a bɔɲɛn yi mini, a yi sɔnxɔ gbegbeen nate. A yi a baba mafan, a naxa, “Duba n fan xa, n baba.” <verse eid="GEN 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35"/>Isiyaga yi a yabi, a naxa, “I xunyɛn bata n mayenden. A tan bata i ya duban sɔtɔ.” <verse eid="GEN 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36"/>Esayu yi a fala, a naxa, “A xinla yatina a xun ma, Yaxuba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">27.36</char> <char style="fk">Yaxuba</char> bunna nɛɛn, “A muxun santinban suxuma” hanma “yanfantenna.”</note> A sanɲa yi firinden ni i ra a n yanfama. A bata n ma foriya tiden tongo. Iki a bata n ma duban fan tongo.” Esayu mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Duba yo mi fa i yii sɔnɔn, i lan i xa naxan ti n tan xa?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37"/>Isiyaga yi Esayu yabi, a naxa, “N bata a tan findi i xunna ra, n mɔn bata a ngaxakedenne fan birin so a yii e xa lu a bun ma. N bata baraka gbegbeen fi a ma, e nun wudi bogi ige faɲina. N nɔɛ nanfe ligɛ i tan xa, n ma diina?” <verse eid="GEN 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38"/>Esayu yi a fala a baba xa, a naxa, “N ba, duba keden peen nan i yii ba? N baba, duba n fan xa.” A yi wuga a xuini texin na. <verse eid="GEN 27:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39"/>A baba Isiyaga yi a yabi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“A kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">i mi fama bɔxɔ faɲi sɔtɔdeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">hanma xiila naxan kelima kore.<verse eid="GEN 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40"/>I ya silanfanna nan fama i balodeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">I fama walideni i xunyɛn nan bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">koni i fama nɛn i yɛtɛ sɔtɔdeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">A nɔɔn naxan sama i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">i murutɛma nɛn na bun.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba a giina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41"/>Esayu yi a xunyɛn Yaxuba rafen yɛngɛn na a duban sɔtɔ feen na e baba ra. Esayu yi a fala a bɔɲɛni, a naxa, “N baba na faxa waxatin naxan yi, n Yaxuba faxama nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42"/>Rebeka to a dii singen Esayu a natan kolon, a yi a dii firinden Yaxuba xili. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I bata a to, i tada Esayu waxi a gbeen ɲɔxɔ feni i ma, a i faxa. <verse eid="GEN 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43"/>Iki i tuli mati n na ki faɲi, n ma diina. Keli be, i siga Xarani yi, n tada Laban konni. <verse eid="GEN 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44"/>I sa lu a konni waxatini ito yi han i tada bɔɲɛn yi godo. <verse eid="GEN 27:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45"/>I tada bɔɲɛn na godo i ya fe ra waxatin naxan yi, a na ɲinan i liga fɔxɔn na, n na n ɲunguɛ, i fa. N mi waxi fula feni ɛ firinna birin na lɔxɔ kedenni.”<verse eid="GEN 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46"/>Rebeka yi a fala Isiyaga xa, a naxa, “N niin bata yiɲaxu n ma Xiti kaa ɲaxanle fe ra. Xa a sa a li, Yaxuba fan ɲaxanla tongo bɔxɔni ito ma, na waxatini n ma siimayaan tɔnɔn nanse ra?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1"/>Isiyaga yi Yaxuba xili. A yi duba a xa. A yi yamarini ito so a yii, a naxa, “I nama ɲaxanla dɔxɔ naxan findixi Kanan kaan na de! <verse eid="GEN 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2"/>Keli, i siga Padan-Arami yi, i nga baba Betuyeli konni. I sa mɛnna ɲaxanla nde dɔxɔ naxan findɛ Laban ma dii tɛmɛn na, i nga tada xɛmɛmana. <verse eid="GEN 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3"/>Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna xa i baraka, Ala xa dii gbegbe fi i ma, alogo i xa findi siya gbegbeen benban na. <verse eid="GEN 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4"/>Ala xa Iburahima a duban yabi i ma e nun i bɔnsɔnna, alogo bɔxɔni ito xa findi i gbeen na i waxati rabɛ dɛnaxan yi, Ala bɔxɔn naxan fi Iburahima ma.” <verse eid="GEN 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5"/>Isiyaga yi Yaxuba rasiga Padan-Arami yi, Laban konni, Betuyeli a diina Arami kaana. Laban, Rebeka tada xɛmɛmaan nan yi a ra. Yaxuba nun Esayu nga nan yi Rebeka ra.<verse eid="GEN 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6"/>Esayu yi a kolon a baba bata duba Yaxuba xa, a a rasiga Padan-Arami yi, a xa sa mɛnna ɲaxanla dɔxɔ. A mɔn yi a mɛ, a baba Isiyaga bata a yamari, a nama ɲaxanla dɔxɔ naxan findɛ Kanan kaan na. <verse eid="GEN 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7"/>Yaxuba yi a baba nun a nga xuiin binya. A yi siga Padan-Arami yi. <verse eid="GEN 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8"/>Esayu yi a kolon na waxatini Kanan kaa ɲaxanle mi rafan a baba Isiyaga ma. <verse eid="GEN 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9"/>Awa, Esayu yi siga Sumayila konni, Iburahima diina. A yi Sumayilaa dii tɛmɛn Mahalati dɔxɔ, Nebayoti xunyɛ ɲaxalanmana.<verse eid="GEN 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxubaa xiyena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10"/>Yaxuba to keli Bɛriseba yi, siga Xarani yi, <verse eid="GEN 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11"/>kɔɛna a li dɛnaxan yi, a yi xi mɛnni. A yi gɛmɛ keden tongo, a yi a raso a xunna bun ma. A yi a sa mɛnni. <verse eid="GEN 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12"/>A yi xiye sa, sangalanna tixi bɔxɔn fari a xunna texi han kore. Alaa malekane yi teen nun godoni sangalanna ma. <verse eid="GEN 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13"/>Alatala yi tixi e xun ma. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N tan nan Alatala ra, i taɲe Iburahima nun Isiyagaa Ala. I saxi bɔxɔn naxan fari ito ra, n ni ito fima i ma nɛn ɛ nun i bɔnsɔnna. <verse eid="GEN 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14"/>I bɔnsɔnna fama wuyadeni nɛn alo gbangbanna. Ɛ bɔxɔn fama nɛn gbodeni ayi keli sogeteden ma han sa dɔxɔ sogegododen na, keli kɔmɛnna ma sa dɔxɔ yiifanna ra. Dunuɲa siyane birin duban sɔtɔma i tan nun i bɔnsɔnna sabun nan na. <verse eid="GEN 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15"/>En birin na a ra i na siga dɛdɛ. N ni i kantanma nɛn i na siga dɛnaxan yi, n ni i raxɛtɛma nɛn bɔxɔni ito ma. N mi i rabeɲinɲɛ. N feen naxan birin layiri tongoxi i xa, n na a birin ligama nɛn.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16"/>Yaxuba yi xulun xixɔnli, a yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata yelin a kolonɲɛ yati, Alatala be yi, koni n mi yi a kolon.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17"/>A yi gaxu, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Yire magaxuxin nan be ra. Sese mi a ra fɔ Alaa banxina, e nun kore xɔnna so dɛɛna.” <verse eid="GEN 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18"/>A yi keli xɔtɔn xɔtɔn, a gɛmɛn tongo naxan yi rasoxi a xunna bun ma. A yi a ti taxamasenna ra, a yi turen maso gɛmɛn xunna ma. <verse eid="GEN 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19"/>A yi na yiren xili sa Betɛli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">28.19</char> <char style="fk">Betɛli</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Alaa banxina.”</note> Benun na xa liga, na yiren yi xili nɛn Lusi. <verse eid="GEN 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20"/>Yaxuba yi a dɛ ti Ala xa, a naxa, “Xa nxu nun Ala na a ra, a tan nan mɔn n kantanma kiraan xɔn ma n sigama dɛnaxan yi, a yi donseen so n yii n naxan donma, a mɔn yi maxidi seen so n yii n naxan soma n ma, <verse eid="GEN 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21"/>xa n xɛtɛ bɔɲɛ xunbenli n baba konni, nayi Alatala findima nɛn n ma Ala ra. <verse eid="GEN 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22"/>Gɛmɛni ito, n naxan tixi taxamasenna ra, a findima Alaa banxin nan na. I seen naxan birin fima n ma, n na a yaganna bama nɛn, n na fi i ma.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba nun Rakeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1"/>Yaxuba to ti kiraan xɔn ma siga sogeteden bɔxɔn mabinni, <verse eid="GEN 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2"/>a yi xɔɲinna to burunna ra. Yɛxɛɛn nun sii kuru saxan yi saxi na xɔɲinna fɛma e igen minma dɛnaxan yi. Gɛmɛ xungbeen nan yi saxi xɔɲinna dɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3"/>Na waxatini, e yi darixi xuruseene malanɲɛ na yiren nin. E malanxina, xuruse rabane yi gɛmɛn makutukutu naxan yi saxi xɔɲinna dɛ ra. Xuruseene to yelin ige mindeni, e mɔn yi gɛmɛn naxɛtɛ xɔɲinna dɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4"/>Yaxuba yi xuruse rabane maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ngaxakedenne, ɛ kelixi minɛn yi?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu kelixi Xarani taan nin.” <verse eid="GEN 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5"/>A mɔn yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ Laban kolon, Nahori a dii xɛmɛna?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Ɔn, nxu a kolon.” <verse eid="GEN 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6"/>A yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “A di na?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Sese mi a toxi. A dii tɛmɛna Rakeli nan fama na ra e nun xuruseene.” <verse eid="GEN 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “En yanyin nin iki. Xuruseene malan waxatin xa mi a ra iki ba? Ɛ igen fi xuruseene ma mafurɛn, ɛ mɔn yi xɛtɛ e ra e rabadeni.” <verse eid="GEN 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Nxu mi nɔɛ fefe ligɛ iki, fɔ xuruseene birin na malan. Na waxatini, nxu fa gɛmɛn ba xɔɲinna dɛ ra a dɛɛn yi balanxi naxan na, nxu fa igen fi xuruseene birin ma.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9"/>Yaxuba to yi na falama e xa, Rakeli fan yi fa a babaa xuruseene ra, bayo xuruse rabaan nan yi a ra. <verse eid="GEN 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10"/>Yaxuba to Rakeli to fɛ, Yaxuba nga tada dii tɛmɛna, e nun Laban ma xuruseene, a yi a maso xɔɲinna dɛxɔn. A yi gɛmɛn ba xɔɲinna dɛ ra, a yi igen fi Laban ma xuruseene ma. <verse eid="GEN 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11"/>Yaxuba yi Rakeli sunbu, a yi wuga, a gbelegbele. <verse eid="GEN 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12"/>A yi a fala Rakeli xa, a a baba bari boden nan a ra, Rebekaa dii xɛmɛna. Rakeli yi giin nakɔ ayi, a sa na yɛba a baba xa. <verse eid="GEN 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13"/>Laban to Yaxuba fe mɛ a xunyɛn ɲaxalanmana diina, a yi siga, a sa a ralan. A yi a sunbu, a a xali banxini. Feen naxan birin Yaxuba sɔtɔ, a yi na yɛba Laban xa. <verse eid="GEN 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14"/>Laban yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “En birin wuli keden fasa keden.” Yaxuba yi kike keden naba Laban konni.<verse eid="GEN 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15"/>Lɔxɔna nde, Laban yi a fala Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “N bari boden nan i ra, koni sariya yo mi a falaxi i xa wali n xa, a fa lu n mi i saren fi. A fala n xa, a lan n xa i saren fi naxan na.” <verse eid="GEN 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16"/>Awa, dii tɛmɛ firin nan yi Laban yii. A dii tɛmɛ singen xili nɛn Leya, a firindena Rakeli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17"/>Leya yɛɛne mi yi rayabu, koni Rakeli tan ɲaxalan tofaɲin nan yi a ra. <verse eid="GEN 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18"/>Rakeli nan yi rafan Yaxuba ma ki faɲi. A yi a fala Laban xa, a naxa, “N ɲɛɛ solofere nan walima i xa, alogo i xa i ya dii tɛmɛn firinden Rakeli fi n ma.” <verse eid="GEN 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19"/>Laban yi a fala, a naxa, “Benun n xa n ma diin fi muxu gbɛtɛn ma, n lan n xa a fi i tan nan ma. Lu n konni be.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20"/>Yaxuba yi ɲɛɛ solofere wanla kɛ Laban yii Rakeli a fe ra. Koni na ɲɛɛ soloferen lu nɛn a xa alo xii dando gbansan, bayo a bata yi a xanu.<verse eid="GEN 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21"/>Na xanbi ra, Yaxuba yi a fala Laban xa, a naxa, “N ma waxatin bata ɲan. N ma ɲaxanla so n yii fa, n xa a findi n yɛtɛ gbeen na.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22"/>Laban yi mɛn kaane birin xili, a e xa fa e dɛgedeni, e sɛwa sumunna raba. <verse eid="GEN 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23"/>Ɲinbanna ra, a yi Leya tongo, a dii tɛmɛ singena, a yi a so Yaxuba yii. Yaxuba yi a findi a yɛtɛ gbeen na. <verse eid="GEN 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24"/>Laban yi Silipa so a diin Leya yii, a xa findi a konyin na. <verse eid="GEN 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25"/>Kuye to yiba, Yaxuba yi a to Leya na a ra. A yi a fala Laban xa, a naxa, “I nanse ligaxi n na ito ra? N mi walixi i xa Rakeli xan ma fe ra ba? Nanfera i n mayendenxi?” <verse eid="GEN 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26"/>Laban yi a yabi, a naxa, “Nxu tan ma namunna mi tinɲɛ dii tɛmɛ firinden xa dɔxɔ xɛmɛ taa ra, a singen mi xɛmɛ sɔtɔxi. <verse eid="GEN 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27"/>Xunsagini ito liga singen ɛ nun Leya. Xa i tin i mɔn xa ɲɛɛ solofere wanla kɛ n xa, n nan n ma dii tɛmɛ firinden fan fima nɛn i ma, a findi i ya ɲaxanla ra.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28"/>Yaxuba yi na liga. E nun Leya to xunsagin naba yire kedenni, Laban yi Rakeli fan fi a ma. <verse eid="GEN 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29"/>A yi Bila tongo a a so Rakeli yii a xa findi a konyin na. <verse eid="GEN 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30"/>Yaxuba mɔn yi Rakeli findi a gbeen na, a yi Rakeli xanu dangu Leya ra. A mɔn yi ɲɛɛ solofere wanla kɛ Laban yii.<verse eid="GEN 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxubaa diine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31"/>Alatala to a to Leya mi rafanxi Yaxuba ma alo Rakeli, a yi a findi dii barin na. Na waxatini Rakeli tan yi findi gbantan na. <verse eid="GEN 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32"/>Leya to fudikan, a yi diin bari. Na diin yi xili sa Rubɛn. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala bata n ma marayarabin to. Iki n fa rafanma nɛn n ma xɛmɛn ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">29.32</char> <char style="fk">Rubɛn</char> masoxi xuina nde nan na Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn “A bata n ma tɔrɔyaan to.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33"/>A mɔn yi fudikan dii firinden na. A to na diin bari, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala fan yatina a kolon, a n mi rafan n ma xɛmɛn ma. Na nan a toxi a dii firindeni ito fan fixi n ma.” A yi na diin xili sa Simeyɔn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.33 </char><char style="fk">Simeyɔn</char> maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn “Naxan fe mɛma.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34"/>A mɔn yi fudikan dii saxanden na. A to a bari, a mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Awa, iki, fɔ n ma xɛmɛn xa kankan nɛn n ma sɔnɔn, bayo n bata dii saxan sɔtɔ a xa.” Na na a to, e yi a xili sa Lewi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">29.34</char> <char style="fk">Lewi </char>maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn “A kankanxi a ma.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 29:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35"/>A yi fudikan dii naaninden na. A to na fan bari, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Awa, iki n na Alatala tantunma nɛn.” A yi na diin xili sa Yuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">29.35</char> <char style="fk">Yuda</char> maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn “Tantunna.”</note> A dii barin yi dan na dii muxu naaninna ma.<verse eid="GEN 29:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30"/>
  <para style="s">Rakeli a dii bari fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1"/>Rakeli to a to, a mi dii barima, a yi a tada maxɔxɔlɔn. A yi a fala Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “Diin fi n fan ma, xa na mi a ra n faxama nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2"/>Yaxuba yi xɔlɔ a falan na. A yi a fala, a naxa, “I a mirixi nɛn a Ala nan n tan na? Ala nan a ligaxi i mi dii barima!” <verse eid="GEN 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3"/>Rakeli yi a yabi, a naxa, “N ma konyi ɲaxanla Bila tongo alogo a xa diine bari n xa. Na waxatini na tan findɛ n xa sabun na n diin sɔtɔ i xa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4"/>A yi a konyi ɲaxanla Bila tongo, a a so a xɛmɛn Yaxuba yii. Yaxuba yi na kolon ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="GEN 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5"/>Bila yi fudikan, a yi dii xɛmɛn bari Yaxuba xa. <verse eid="GEN 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6"/>Rakeli yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala bata n ma kitin sa. A bata n ma falan mɛ. Na nan a toxi a diin fixi n ma.” A yi na diin xili sa Dan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">30.6</char> <char style="fk">Dan</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “A bata a xun mayɛngɛ kitin sa.”</note><verse eid="GEN 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7"/>Rakeli a konyi ɲaxanla Bila mɔn yi fudikan. A yi dii xɛmɛ firinden bari Yaxuba xa. <verse eid="GEN 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8"/>Rakeli yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata n tada yɛngɛ n sɔbɛɛn birin na, n yi nɔɔn sɔtɔ.” A yi a diin xili sa Nafatali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">30.8</char> <char style="fk">Nafatali</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “N ma yɛngɛna.”</note><verse eid="GEN 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9"/>Leya to a kolon a mi fa dii barima, a yi a konyi ɲaxanla Silipa tongo, a yi a so Yaxuba yii, a xa findi a ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="GEN 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10"/>Leyaa konyin Silipa yi dii xɛmɛn bari Yaxuba xa. <verse eid="GEN 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11"/>Leya yi a fala, a naxa, “Hɛrin bata fa n ma.” A yi na diin xili sa Gadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">30.11</char> <char style="fk">Gadi</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “Hɛrina.”</note><verse eid="GEN 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12"/>Leyaa konyin Silipa yi dii firinden sɔtɔ Yaxuba xa. <verse eid="GEN 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13"/>Leya yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata sɛwa. Iki, ɲaxanle birin a falama nɛn a n bata sɛwa.” A yi a xili sa Aseri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">30.13</char> <char style="fk">Aseri</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “Sɛwana.”</note><verse eid="GEN 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14"/>Murutu xaba waxatin to a li, Rubɛn yi siga xɛɛn ma. A yi bogisena nde li na, naxan xili marafanna bogisena. A yi fa a ra a nga xa. Nanara, Rakeli yi a fala Leya xa, a naxa, “N bata i maxandi, i ya diina marafan bogisena nde so n yii.” <verse eid="GEN 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15"/>Leya yi a yabi, a naxa, “I bata n ma xɛmɛn ba n yii. Na mi i wasaxi? I mɔn waxi n ma diina marafan bogiseen nan tongo fe yi?” Rakeli yi a fala, a naxa, “To kɔɛɛn na, ɛ nun Yaxuba nan fama xideni i ya diina marafan bogiseen ɲɔxɔn na.” <verse eid="GEN 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16"/>Yaxuba to so ɲinbanna, sa keli xɛɛn ma, Leya yi a ralan. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I xima n tan nan xɔn ma to kɔɛɛn na. N bata to kɔɛɛn saren fi n ma diina marafan bogiseen na.” Yaxuba mɔn yi Leya kolon ɲaxanla ra na kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="GEN 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17"/>Ala yi tin Leyaa maxandin ma, a yi fudikan. Na yi findi a dii suulunden na Yaxuba xa. <verse eid="GEN 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18"/>Leya yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala bata n saren fi n ma konyi ɲaxanla so feen na n ma xɛmɛn yii.” A yi a diin xili sa Isakari.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">30.18</char> <char style="fk">Isakari</char> maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “Saranna.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19"/>Leya mɔn yi fudikan dii senninden na. A yi na diin bari Yaxuba xa. <verse eid="GEN 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20"/>Leya yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala bata n ki. Awa, iki n ma xɛmɛna n binyama nɛn, bayo n bata dii sennin bari a xa.” A yi na diin xili sa Sabulon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">30.20</char> <char style="fk">Sabulon</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Binyena.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21"/>Na xanbi ra, a mɔn yi dii tɛmɛn bari. A yi a xili sa Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22"/>Ala yi a yengin nasiga Rakeli ma. A yi a maxandi xuiin namɛ, a yi a findi dii barin na. <verse eid="GEN 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23"/>A yi fudikan, a yi diin bari. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala bata n namini yagini ito yi.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24"/>A yi na diin xili sa Yusufu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">30.24</char> <char style="fk">Yusufu</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “A xa a fari sa.”</note> A yi falani ito ti, a naxa, “Alatala mɔn xa dii xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ fan fi n ma.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxubaa nafunle fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25"/>Yusufu to bari, Yaxuba yi a fala Laban xa, a naxa, “A lu n xa xɛtɛ n kon bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26"/>A lu n xa n ma ɲaxanle xali e nun n ma diine, n walixi i xa naxanye fe ra. I a kolon n wanla naxan yatɛn ligaxi i xa.” <verse eid="GEN 30:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27"/>Laban yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Diɲa. N bata a kolon yiimatoon xɔn, Alatala barakan saxi n ma fe yi i tan nan sabu ra. <verse eid="GEN 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28"/>A fala n xa n lan n xa i saren fi naxan na. N na a soma i yii nɛn.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29"/>Yaxuba yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I tan yatina a kolon n walixi i xa kii naxan yi han i ya xuruseene bata wuya ayi n tan barakani. <verse eid="GEN 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30"/>Ndedi nan yi i yii nun benun n xa fa, koni iki, a gbegbe bata sa na fari. Alatala bata barakan sa i ya fe yi xabu n so i konni. N fa wanla nde kɛma n ma denbayaan fan xa waxatin mundun yi?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31"/>Laban yi a fala, a naxa, “A lan n xa yoli fi i ma?” Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “I nama sese fi n ma. Xa i bata tin n feen naxan falaxi i xa, na liga, n fan bata tin n yengi sɛ i ya xuruseene xɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32"/>N sigama nɛn to, n sa i ya xuruseene birin mato. Yɛxɛɛn nun sii makatunxin birin ti e danna e nun naxanye birin fɔrɔ makɛnɛnxi. N saren findima ne nan na. <verse eid="GEN 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33"/>N ma tinxinna fama makɛnɛndeni nɛn i na fa xuruse matodeni waxatin naxan yi. Siin naxanye birin mi makatunxi e nun yɛxɛɛ diin birin fɔrɔ makɛnɛnxi mi naxanye ma, na bata findi muɲan na n mabinni.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34"/>Laban yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata tin na ma. I naxan falaxi, en bata lan na ma.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35"/>Na lɔxɔn yɛtɛni Laban yi sii kɔtɔ maɲingixine nun a makatunxine yɛba. Sii gilɛne fɔrɛ fɔrɛdine naxanye ma e nun fɔrɛ xungbene yi naxanye ma e nun yɛxɛɛ fixɛ makadanxine, a mɔn yi ne birin yɛba. A yi na xuruseene birin taxu a diine ra. <verse eid="GEN 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi ne xali yirena nde yi xii saxan sigatiin tiyɛ dɛnaxan yi e nun Yaxuba tagi. Yaxuba yi fa Laban ma xuruse dɔnxɛne raba.<verse eid="GEN 30:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37"/>Yaxuba yi wudi bili sifa saxan yii xindene gira. A yi e lutine ba e ma alogo maɲingi fixɛn xa makɛnɛn. <verse eid="GEN 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38"/>A yi wudi yiine sa xuruseene mindeni xuruseene yɛtagi bayo e tema e bode ra nɛn e na fa ige mindeni. <verse eid="GEN 30:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39"/>Xuruseene yi te e bode ma wudi yiine yireni, e yi diine xali maɲingi fixɛn nun fɔrɛ fɔrɛdine nun fɔrɛ xungbene saxi e ma. <verse eid="GEN 30:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40"/>Yaxuba yi xuruse diine yitaxun alogo e xa ti Laban ma xuruseene yɛtagi maɲingin nun ɲingin makɛnɛnxin naxanye ma. Nayi, a yi xuruseene malan a yɛtɛ xa a mi naxanye basan Laban gbeene ra. <verse eid="GEN 30:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41"/>Waxatin birin xuruse sɛnbɛmane nɛma tɛ a gilɛne ra, Yaxuba yi wudi yiine sama nɛn xuruse mindeni alogo e xa te a gilɛne ra wudi yiine yireni. <verse eid="GEN 30:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42"/>Yaxuba mi yi na ligama xuruse xunxurine ra. Na nan a liga xuruse xurine yi findi Laban gbeen na, a sɛnbɛmane yi findi Yaxuba gbeen na. <verse eid="GEN 30:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43"/>Yaxuba yi findi nafulu kan gbeen na. A yi xuruse gbegbe sɔtɔ. Konyi xɛmɛne nun konyi gilɛne nun ɲɔgɔmɛne nun sofanle yi lu a yii.<verse eid="GEN 30:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba yi siga Kanan yamanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1"/>Na waxatini Yaxuba bata yi Laban ma diine xuiin mɛ e yi naxan falama, e naxa, “Seen naxan birin findixi en baba gbeen na, Yaxuba bata e birin tongo. Na nan a toxi a bata findi nafulu kanna ra.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2"/>Yaxuba yatin yi a kolon, a a marafanna mi fa Laban yi sɔnɔn alo a fɔlɔni.<verse eid="GEN 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3"/>Alatala yi a fala Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “Xɛtɛ i baba nun i bari bodene bɔxɔni i kelixi dɛnaxan yi. N luma nɛn i xɔn.” <verse eid="GEN 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4"/>Yaxuba yi Rakeli nun Leya xili. E yi a xuruseene rabama. <verse eid="GEN 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N bata a kolon n ma marafanna mi fa ɛ baba yi sɔnɔn alo a fɔlɔni, koni n babaa Ala bata lu n xɔn. <verse eid="GEN 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6"/>Ɛ a kolon yati, n bata wali ɛ baba xa n fangan birin na. <verse eid="GEN 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7"/>A bata n mayenden a n saranna maxɛtɛ sanɲa yi fu, koni Ala mi tin a fe ɲaxin liga n na. <verse eid="GEN 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8"/>Xa ɛ baba fa a fala, a naxa, ‘Fɔrɛ fɔrɛne xuruseen naxanye ma, ne nan findima i gbeen na,’ xuruseene birin yi diin xalima nɛn fɔrɛ fɔrɛne naxanye ma. Xa ɛ baba fa a fala, a naxa, ‘Maɲingin xuruseen naxanye ma, ne nan findima i gbeen na,’ xuruseene birin yi dii maɲingixin nan xalima. <verse eid="GEN 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9"/>Ala bata ɛ babaa xuruseene ba a yii, a yi e fi n tan ma.”<verse eid="GEN 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10"/>“Xuruseene yi tema e bode ra waxatin naxan yi, n bata a to xiyeni, xuruse xɛmɛn naxanye texi xuruse gilɛne ra, ne maɲingixi, e mafɔrɔ fɔrɔxi e nun e makatun katunxi. <verse eid="GEN 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11"/>N ma xiyeni, Ala a malekan yi n xili, a naxa, ‘Yaxuba.’ N yi a ratin, n naxa, ‘N tan ni i ra.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12"/>A yi a fala, a naxa, ‘I xunna rakeli, a mato. Xuruse xɛmɛn naxanye birin texi xuruse gilɛne ra, ne maɲingixi, e mafɔrɔ fɔrɔxi e nun e makatun katunxi, bayo Laban naxan birin ligaxi i ra, n na toxi. <verse eid="GEN 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13"/>N tan nan Ala ra naxan fa i ma Betɛli yi, i gɛmɛn tixi taxamasenna ra dɛnaxan yi i layirin tongoxi n xa dɛnaxan yi. Iki, keli bɔxɔni ito ma. I siga na bɔxɔni i barixi dɛnaxan yi.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14"/>Rakeli nun Leya yi Yaxuba yabi, e naxa, “Nxu baba mi kɛɛ yo luxi nxu tan xa! <verse eid="GEN 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15"/>Xɔɲɛn xa mi nxu ra nxu baba konni? A bata nxu mati, a mɔn bata nxɔ gbetin fan don. <verse eid="GEN 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16"/>Ala hɛrisigɛn naxan birin baxi nxu baba yii, a xɛtɛma nɛn nxu ma e nun nxɔ diine. Iki Ala feen naxan birin falaxi i xa, na birin liga.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17"/>Yaxuba yi a ɲaxanle nun a diine rate ɲɔgɔmɛne fari. <verse eid="GEN 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18"/>A xuruseen nun hɛrisigɛn naxan birin sɔtɔ Padan-Arami yi, a yi keli, a yi e birin xali a baba Isiyaga konni Kanan bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19"/>Laban yi a xuruseene xabene maxabama e ma waxatin naxan yi, Rakeli yi a babaa suxurene muɲa.<verse eid="GEN 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20"/>Yaxuba yi Arami kaan Laban mayenden. A siga a mi sese fala a xa. <verse eid="GEN 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21"/>A yi a gi, e nun seen naxan birin findi a gbeen na. A yi Efirati baani gidi. Na xanbi ra, a yi siga Galadi geyaan mabinni.<verse eid="GEN 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22"/>A xii saxande lɔxɔni, muxuna nde yi a fala Laban xa fa fala Yaxuba bata a gi. <verse eid="GEN 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23"/>Laban yi a ngaxakedenne tongo, e yi mini Yaxuba fendeni xii solofere bun ma. E yi e li Galadi geyane binna ra. <verse eid="GEN 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24"/>Koni kɔɛɛn na, Ala yi a yɛtɛ yita Arami kaan Laban na xiyeni. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I yɛtɛ ratanga feen sifan birin fala feen na Yaxuba ma.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25"/>Laban yi Yaxuba li. A bubun tixi geyaan fari. Laban nun a ngaxakedenne fan yi e gbeen ti Galadi geyaan fari. <verse eid="GEN 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26"/>Laban yi a fala Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “I nanse ligaxi ito ra? Nanfera i n mayendenxi? I bata n ma diine xali alo muxu suxine yɛngɛni. <verse eid="GEN 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27"/>Nanfera i gixi luxunni? I bata yanfantenyaan liga n na. I mi sese falaxi n xa. Xa i yi n nakolon nun, n yi i matima nɛn sɛwa sigine yi, tanbanna nun konden xuiin na. <verse eid="GEN 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28"/>Koni i mi a lu yati n xa n ma diine nun n mamandenne sunbu, n yi n ɲungu e ma. I bata feen liga alo xaxilitarena. <verse eid="GEN 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29"/>N yi nɔɛ fe kobin ligɛ ɛ ra nɛn, koni i babaa Ala bata a fala n xa to kɔɛɛn na, a naxa, ‘I yɛtɛ ratanga feen sifan birin fala feen na Yaxuba ma.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30"/>Na bata lan, i sigaxi nɛn bayo i yi kunfaxi siga feen na i baba konni, koni nanfera i n ma suxurene muɲaxi n ma?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31"/>Yaxuba yi Laban yabi, a naxa, “N gaxu nɛn n miriyani alogo i nama i ya diine rasuxu n na. <verse eid="GEN 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32"/>Koni i na i ya suxurene to n ma muxu yo yii, n na kanna faxama nɛn. Ngaxakedenne birin yɛɛ xɔri, n ma goronna birin mato. Naxan birin findixi i gbeen na, i xa a xali.” Na waxatini Yaxuba mi yi a kolon xa Rakeli a babaa suxurene tongoxi.<verse eid="GEN 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33"/>Laban yi Yaxubaa bubune kui to e nun Leya konni e nun konyi firinne konni, koni a mi sese to. A to mini Leyaa bubuni, a yi so Rakeli fan konni. <verse eid="GEN 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34"/>Rakeli nan yati suxureni itoe tongoxi. A yi e luxun kirixan bun ma naxan sama ɲɔgɔmɛn fari, a fa dɔxɔ a fari. Laban yi bubun kui to, a mi sese to na kui. <verse eid="GEN 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35"/>Rakeli yi a fala a baba xa, a naxa, “N baba i nama xɔlɔ n ma xa n mi fa keli i yɛtagi. N kike wanla nin.” Laban fenna sifan birin ti nɛn, koni a mi suxurene to.<verse eid="GEN 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36"/>Yaxuba yi xɔlɔ, a yi fala xɔlɛn ti Laban ma, a naxa, “N gbalon mundun ligaxi, n hakɛn mundun ligaxi naxan a ligama i xa mini n fendeni kiini ito yi? <verse eid="GEN 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37"/>I bata n ma goronna birin kui to. I gbee seen mundun toxi e kui? A yita n na ngaxakedenne yɛɛ xɔri e nun i fan ngaxakedenne yɛɛ xɔri alogo e xa kitin sa en tagi. <verse eid="GEN 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38"/>N ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛ nan tixi i konni, koni i ya yɛxɛɛn nun sii dii keden mi diin xalixi a faxa n yii. N mɔn mi i ya xuruse yo donxi. <verse eid="GEN 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39"/>N mi faxi xuruse ra i fɛma burunna subene naxan faxaxi. Naxanye yi muɲama kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na, ne bɔnɔn yi luma n tan nan xa bayo i yi e ɲɔxɔn maxilima n na. <verse eid="GEN 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40"/>Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ kuye wolonna yi n tɔrɔma nɛn yanyin na, xunbenla yi n tɔrɔ kɔɛɛn na, n yɛtɛɛn mi yi nɔɛ xiyɛ. <verse eid="GEN 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41"/>N bata ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛ ti i yii. N ɲɛɛ fu nun naanin wanla kɛxi nɛn alogo n xa i ya dii tɛmɛ firinne dɔxɔ. N mɔn yi ɲɛɛ sennin fan sa a fari i ya xuruseene kantandeni. Koni i bata n saranna maxɛtɛ dɔxɔɲa ma fu. <verse eid="GEN 31:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42"/>Xa n taɲe Iburahimaa Ala, n baba Isiyaga gaxun naxan yɛɛ ra, xa na mi yi a ra nun, n yi kelima nɛn be n yii genla. Koni Ala bata n ma marayarabin to, e nun n yi wali xɔdɛxɛn naxanye ligama, kɔɛ danguxini ito yi, a bata n ma kitin sa.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43"/>Laban yi Yaxuba yabi, a naxa, “I ya ɲaxanle, n ma diine nan ne ra. E diine, n gbeen nan ne ra. Xuruseni itoe n gbeen nan e ra, n naxan birin toma ito ra, n tan nan gbee e ra. Koni to xanbi ra, n nɔɛ nanse ligɛ n ma diine nun n mamandenne xa? <verse eid="GEN 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44"/>Iki, en xa layiri tongo. Sereyaan xa lu en tagi.” <verse eid="GEN 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45"/>Yaxuba yi gɛmɛn tongo, a yi a ti taxamasenna ra.<verse eid="GEN 31:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46"/>Na xanbi ra, Yaxuba yi a fala a ngaxakedenne xa, a e xa gɛmɛne matongo. E yi e matongo, e e malan yire kedenni. E yi e dɛge na gɛmɛ malanxine fari. <verse eid="GEN 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47"/>Laban yi na mɛnna xili sa Yegara-Sahaduta. Yaxuba yi mɛn xili sa Galadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">31.47</char> <char style="fk">Yegara Sahaduta</char> nun <char style="fk">Galadi</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Sere Se Malanxine.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 31:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48"/>Laban yi a fala, a naxa, “Gɛmɛ malanxini itoe findixi seren nan na i tan nun n tan tagi.” Na nan a toxi mɛnna xili saxi Galadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49"/>Mɛn mɔn xili nɛn “Misipa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">31.49</char> <char style="fk">Misipa</char> bunna nɛn fa fala “Gbengbena.”</note> Laban mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala xa a yengi dɔxɔ en tan firinna a fe xɔn ma, hali en fata xanbini. <verse eid="GEN 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50"/>Xa i n ma diine tɔrɔ, xa na mi a ra i ɲaxalan gbɛtɛ dɔxɔ, i lanma i xa xaxinla sɔtɔ, bayo muxun xa mi en tagi seren na. Ala nan yati en firinna seren na.”<verse eid="GEN 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51"/>Na xanbi ra, Laban yi a fala Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “I yɛɛn ti gɛmɛ malanxini itoe ra. Taxamaseri gɛmɛni ito mato n naxan tixi en tagi. <verse eid="GEN 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52"/>Gɛmɛ malanxini itoe nun taxamaseri gɛmɛni ito findixi serene nan na. N mi lan n xa dangu be ra i ya fe ɲaxina n kui. I fan mi lan i xa dangu gɛmɛ malanxini itoe nun taxamaseri gɛmɛni ito ra n ma fe ɲaxina i kui. <verse eid="GEN 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53"/>Iburahimaa Ala nun Nahori a Ala xa findi en tan firinna makitimaan na.” Na waxatini Yaxuba yi a kɔlɔ Ala yi a baba Isiyaga gaxun naxan yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54"/>Yaxuba yi saraxan ba geyaan fari. A yi a ngaxakedenne birin xili, e xa sa e dɛge. E to yelin e dɛgɛ, e yi xi geyaan fari.<verse eid="GEN 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba yi siga Esayu fɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1"/>Laban to keli subaxan ma, a yi a ɲungu a diine ma, e nun a mamandenne. A yi duba e xa. Na xanbi, Laban yi xɛtɛ a konni. <verse eid="GEN 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2"/>Yaxuba yi sigama kiraan xɔn waxatin naxan yi, Alaa malekane yi fa a ma. <verse eid="GEN 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3"/>Yaxuba to e to, a naxa, “Alaa ganla daaxaden nan ito ra.” A yi na yiren xili sa Maxanayin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">32.3</char> <char style="fk">Maxanayin</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Daaxade firinne.”</note><verse eid="GEN 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4"/>Yaxuba yi xɛrane rasiga a tada Esayu ma Edɔn banxidɛɛn na, Seyiri bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5"/>A yi yamarin fi e ma, a naxa, “Ɛ ito nan falama n kanna Esayu xa, ɛ naxa, ‘I ya konyi Yaxuba naxa, n bata lu Laban konni. N bata bu gbeen ti na yi. <verse eid="GEN 32:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6"/>Ɲinge gbegbe nan n yii e nun sofanle nun yɛxɛɛne nun siine. Konyi xɛmɛne nun konyi gilɛne n yii. Iki, n xɛrane rasigama i ma alogo i xa marasɛnɛ faɲin fi n ma.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7"/>Xɛrane yi xɛtɛ, e yi a fala Yaxuba xa, e naxa, “Nxu bata siga. Nxu sa i tada Esayu li na. A fama i ralandeni e nun a banxulan muxu kɛmɛ naanin.” <verse eid="GEN 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8"/>Gaxu gbeen yi Yaxuba suxu, a kuisan. Yamaan naxan yi a fɔxɔ ra, a yi e taxun dɔxɔde firin. A yi yɛxɛɛne nun siine yitaxun dɔxɔ firin, e nun ɲingene, e nun ɲɔgɔmɛne. <verse eid="GEN 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9"/>A yi a fala, a naxa, “Xa Esayu yama keden yɛngɛ, yamaan boden xa a gi.”<verse eid="GEN 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10"/>Na xanbi Yaxuba yi Ala maxandi, a naxa, “N taɲe Iburahimaa Ala nun n baba Isiyagaa Ala, i bata a fala n xa, i tan Alatala, i naxa ‘Xɛtɛ i ya bɔxɔni, i kon kaane dɛnaxan yi. I na siga, n fe faɲin ligama nɛn i xa.’ <verse eid="GEN 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11"/>N tan xurun. N mi daxa n hinanna nun lannayaan birin sɔtɔ, i naxan nagidixi n ma, i ya walikɛna. N ma dunganna gbansanna nan yi suxi n yii n Yurudɛn baani gidi waxatin naxan yi, koni iki nxu nun yama firin nan xɛtɛma. <verse eid="GEN 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12"/>N natanga n tada Esayu ma, bayo n bata gaxu a yɛɛ ra. N sikɛxi, a nama fa n faxa, e nun ɲaxanle nun diine. <verse eid="GEN 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13"/>I bata a fala n xa, i naxa, ‘N fe faɲin ligama nɛn i xa. N ni i bɔnsɔnna rawuyama ayi nɛn alo fɔxɔ igen mɛɲɛnsinna naxan mi yatɛ.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14"/>Yaxuba yi kɔɛɛn nadangu na. Seen naxan birin yi a yii, a yi sanba seen yɛ mato a naxan soma a tada Esayu yii: <verse eid="GEN 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15"/>Sii kɛmɛ firin nun kɔtɔ mɔxɔɲɛ e nun yɛxɛɛ kɛmɛ firin nun konton mɔxɔɲɛ e nun <verse eid="GEN 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16"/>ɲɔgɔmɛ gilɛ tonge saxan nun e diine nun ɲinge tonge naanin nun tura fu nun sofali gilɛ mɔxɔɲɛ e nun sofali xɛmɛ fu. <verse eid="GEN 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17"/>A yi xuruseni itoe yitaxun kuru keden keden yɛɛn ma, a nde so a konyine yii. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ dangu yɛɛn na. Ɛ xa sagaran lu kurune tagi.”<verse eid="GEN 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18"/>A yi a konyi singen yamari, a naxa, “Ɛ nun n tada Esayu na naralan, a fama i maxɔdindeni nɛn, a naxa, ‘Ɛ nun nde a ra? I sigan minɛn yi? Nde gbee xuruseni itoe ra naxanye tixi i yɛɛ ra?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19"/>I ya a yabima nɛn, i naxa, ‘I ya konyin Yaxuba nan gbee e ra. A i sanbaxi itoe nan na, n kanna Esayu. A fan nxu fɔxɔ ra.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20"/>A yi na yamarin fi a firinde fan ma, e nun a saxandena, e nun muxun naxanye biraxi xuruseene fɔxɔ ra, a naxa, “Xa ɛ nun Esayu naralan waxatin naxan yi, ɛ na nan falama a xa. <verse eid="GEN 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21"/>Ɛ ito nan sama a fari, ɛ naxa, ‘I ya konyina Yaxuba fama nxu xanbi ra.’ ” Yaxuba yi a fala, a naxa, “Iki n na a bɔɲɛn magodoma seni itoe nan na. Na xanbi n na fa a ma, yanyina nde a n nasɛnɛma nɛn a faɲin na.” <verse eid="GEN 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22"/>Yaxubaa sanba seene yi ti a yɛɛ ra, a tan yi kɔɛɛn nadangu daaxadeni.<verse eid="GEN 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba nun Alaa malekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23"/>Kɔɛɛn na, Yaxuba yi keli. A yi a ɲaxalan firinne tongo e nun e konyi firinne nun a dii fu nun kedenna. E yi Yaboko xuden gidi. <verse eid="GEN 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24"/>A yi e ragidi Yaboko xuden na e nun a yii seen birin. <verse eid="GEN 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25"/>A keden peen yi lu. Na waxatini, xɛmɛna nde yi mini a ma, e yi gerenna so han kuye yiba waxatini. <verse eid="GEN 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26"/>A to a to, a mi nɔ sɔtɔma Yaxuba ma e gerenni, a yi a garin a wotegelen ma. A wotegelen yi te a kui. <verse eid="GEN 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27"/>Xɛmɛn yi a fala, a naxa, “A lu n xa siga, bayo kuye bata yiba.” Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “N mi i beɲinma, fɔ i duba n xa.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28"/>Xɛmɛn yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I xili di?” Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “Yaxuba.” <verse eid="GEN 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29"/>Xɛmɛn yi a fala, a naxa, “I xili mi falama sɔnɔn Yaxuba. A fa falama nɛn Isirayila, bayo ɛ nun Ala nan gerenna soxi, e nun muxune, i yi nɔɔn sɔtɔ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">32.29</char> <char style="fk">Isirayila</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “E nun Ala gerenna soma.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30"/>Yaxuba yi maxɔdinna ti, a naxa, “I xili di?” Boden yi a fala, a naxa, “Nanfera i n maxɔdinma n xinla ma?” Na xanbi, a yi duba Yaxuba xa.<verse eid="GEN 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31"/>Yaxuba yi na yiren xili sa Penuyɛli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">32.31</char> <char style="fk">Penuyɛli</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Ala yɛtagina.”</note> bayo Yaxuba a fala nɛn, a naxa, “N bata Ala to yɛɛ nun yɛɛ, a tin n niin yi kisi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32"/>Sogen tema waxatin naxan yi, Yaxuba bata yi dangu Penuyɛli ra. A godoma a wotegelen ma. <verse eid="GEN 32:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 32:33"/>Na nan a toxi han iki Isirayila kaane mi fasan donma naxan wotegelen ma, bayo Ala Yaxuba masɔtɔxi a wotegelen fasan nan ma.<verse eid="GEN 32:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba nun Esayu a layirina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1"/>Yaxuba yi Esayu to fɛ e nun banxulanna muxu kɛmɛ naanin. A yi diine yitaxun Leya nun Rakeli ra e nun konyi gilɛ firinne. <verse eid="GEN 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2"/>A yi konyi gilɛ firinne ti yɛɛn na, e nun e diine. Leya fan yi ti ne xanbi ra e nun a diine. Rakeli nun Yusufu yi lu dɔnxɛn na. <verse eid="GEN 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3"/>A tan yi dangu ne yɛɛ ra, a xinbi sin sanɲa ma solofere benun a xa a tada li. <verse eid="GEN 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4"/>Koni Esayu yi a gi a sa Yaxuba ralan. A yi dutun a ma, a fa a sunbu. E birin yi wuga. <verse eid="GEN 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5"/>Esayu to ɲaxanle nun diine to, a yi maxɔdinna ti, a naxa, “Nde ne ra naxanye biraxi i fɔxɔ ra?” Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ala diin naxanye fixi i ya konyin ma a nɛmaan xɔn ma.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6"/>Konyi gilɛne yi e maso e nun e diine, e yi e xinbi sin. <verse eid="GEN 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7"/>Leya fan nun a diine yi e maso, e fan yi e xinbi sin. Na xanbi Yusufu fan nun Rakeli yi na liga.<verse eid="GEN 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8"/>Esayu yi maxɔdinna ti, a naxa, “I nanse ligama xuruseni ito birin na, n naralanxi naxanye ra?” Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “N waxi nɛn, n kanna xa n nafan.” <verse eid="GEN 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9"/>Esayu yi a fala, a naxa, “N xunyɛna, hɛrisigɛ gbegbe n fan yii. I gbeen mara.” <verse eid="GEN 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10"/>Yaxuba yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, n bata i maxandi, xa i bata n nafan, n na i sanbaxi seen naxanye birin yi, i xa ne rasuxu. N bata i yɛtagin to. Na luxi nɛn n yi alo n na Ala yɛtagi nan toma, bayo i bata n nasɛnɛ ki faɲi. <verse eid="GEN 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11"/>N seen naxanye sanbaxi i ma, e rasuxu. Ala bata hinan n na, a n makoon birin fan.” Yaxuba yi a yixɔdɔxɔ han Esayu yi tin.<verse eid="GEN 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12"/>Esayu yi a fala, a naxa, “En siga kiraan xɔn ma, n xa sa i mati.” <verse eid="GEN 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13"/>Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “N kanna, a kolon diine fe xɔdɔxɔ. Yɛxɛɛ gilɛne nun ɲinge gilɛne xiɲɛn fima e diine ma. Xa en gbɛtɛn e ra lɔxɔ kedenni, ne birin faxama nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14"/>N kanna, i tan xa ti yɛɛn na. N tan xa bira n ma xuruseene fɔxɔ ra ndedi ndedi. N xa siga n yeren ma, nxu nun n ma diine han nxu soma i konni waxatin naxan yi Seyiri bɔxɔni.” <verse eid="GEN 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15"/>Esayu yi a fala, a naxa, “N xa n ma muxuna nde lu i yii be.” Yaxuba yi a fala, a naxa, “Nanfera? N kanna, n tan waxi naxan xɔn, n xa rafan i ma gbansan.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16"/>Na lɔxɔni, Esayu yi ti Seyiri kiraan xɔn ma.<verse eid="GEN 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17"/>Yaxuba tan yi siga Sukɔti yi. A yi banxi keden ti a yɛtɛ xa, a kulane ti a xuruseene xa. Nanara na yiren xili nɛn Sukɔti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">33.17</char> <char style="fk">Sukɔti</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Bubune.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18"/>Yaxuba to keli Padan-Arami yi, a yi so kɛndɛyani Siken taani Kanan bɔxɔni. A yi daaxadeni tɔn taan xanbi ra. <verse eid="GEN 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19"/>A bubun yi tixi dɛnaxan yi, a yi bɔxɔn sara Xamori a diine ma, Siken Baba, naxanye singe dɔxɔ Siken yi. A yi na sara gbeti gbanan kɛmɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20"/>A yi saraxa ganden nafala mɛnni. A yi na xili sa “Isirayilaa Ala.”<verse eid="GEN 33:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34"/>
  <para style="s">Dinaa marayagina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1"/>Yaxubaa dii tɛmɛn Dina, Leya naxan barixi Yaxuba xa, na yi siga Siken ɲaxanle xɔntɔndeni. <verse eid="GEN 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2"/>Xamori a dii xɛmɛn Siken, Xiwin naxan findixi na yamanan mangan na, na to Dina to, a yi fu a ma a yi a rayagi. <verse eid="GEN 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3"/>Yaxubaa dii tɛmɛn Dinaa xanuntenyaan yi lu Siken fatini. A yi fala ɲaxumɛne ti a xa. <verse eid="GEN 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4"/>A yi a fala a baba Xamori xa, a naxa, “Dii tɛmɛni ito maxandi n xa alogo n xa a dɔxɔ.” <verse eid="GEN 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5"/>Yaxuba yi a mɛ, a bata a dii tɛmɛn Dina rayagi. Na waxatini, a diine yi sa xɛɛn ma xuruseene fɔxɔ ra. A mi sese fala han ne so waxatini.<verse eid="GEN 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6"/>Siken baba Xamori yi siga Yaxuba konni a xa sa falan ti a xa. <verse eid="GEN 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7"/>Yaxuba a diine to keli xɛɛn ma, e yi na feen mɛ naxan danguxi. E yi e yomayaan to, e bɔɲɛn yi te ki faɲi bayo Siken bata yi fu Yaxuba a dii tɛmɛn ma, a mi lan a xa naxan liga Isirayila bɔxɔni.<verse eid="GEN 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8"/>Xamori yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Dii tɛmɛni ito rafanxi n ma dii xɛmɛn Siken nan ma a sɔndɔmɛn birin na. Yandi, ɛ xa a fi a ma, a xa findi a ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="GEN 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9"/>En findi bitanmane ra. Ɛ xa ɛ dii tɛmɛne fi nxu ma alogo nxu xa e dɔxɔ. Nayi, ɛ fan nɔɛ nɛn nxu gbeene dɔxɛ. <verse eid="GEN 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10"/>Ɛ fama nɛn ludeni nxu dɛxɔn ma, bɔxɔni ito yi rabi ɛ xa. Ɛ nɔɛ dɔxɛ nɛn be, ɛ yulayaan liga alogo ɛ xa hɛrisigɛn sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11"/>Siken yi a fala Dina baba nun a tada xa, a naxa, “Ɛ diɲa n ma, ɛ ɲɛnige faɲin ti n xa. Ɛ wama seen naxan xɔn, ɛ xa na fala n xa, n xa a so ɛ yii. <verse eid="GEN 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12"/>Ɛ nɔɛ futu se gbegbe maxɔdinɲɛ nɛn n ma e nun kiseene. Ɛ na seen naxan birin maxɔdin n ma, n nɔɛ a birin soɛ ɛ yii nɛn alogo n xa dii tɛmɛni ito dɔxɔ.” <verse eid="GEN 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13"/>Yaxubaa diine yi yanfa falan ti Siken nun a baba Xamori xa, bayo Siken bata yi e xunyɛn Dina rayagi. <verse eid="GEN 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14"/>E yi a fala e xa, e naxa, “Nxu mi nɔɛ nxu xunyɛ ɲaxalanmaan fiyɛ muxun ma naxan mi banxulanxi. A findima yagin nan na nxu xa. <verse eid="GEN 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15"/>Xa nxu fa nxu xuiin soma ɛ yii, fɔ en lan ito ma. Xɛmɛn naxan birin ɛ konni, e lan nɛn e xa banxulan alo nxu tan. <verse eid="GEN 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16"/>Na waxatini nxu nɔɛ nxɔ dii tɛmɛne fiyɛ ɛ ma nɛn, ɛ yi e dɔxɔ. Nxu fan ɛ gbeene dɔxɔma nɛn, nxu luma ɛ dɛxɔn ma na waxatini, en birin yi findi yama kedenna ra. <verse eid="GEN 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17"/>Koni xa ɛ mi fa sa tin ɛ banxulandeni, nxu nxu xunyɛ ɲaxalanmaan nasuxuma nɛn, nxu fa keli be.” <verse eid="GEN 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18"/>Xamori nun a dii Siken yi tin falani ito ma. <verse eid="GEN 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19"/>Na xɛmɛn mi bu a na feen liga, bayo Yaxuba a dii tɛmɛn bata rafan a ma. A tan nan yi binyaxi dangu a ngaxakedenne birin na.<verse eid="GEN 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20"/>Xamori nun Siken yi siga yamaan malandeni taan so dɛɛn na. E yi a fala e yamaan xa, e naxa, <verse eid="GEN 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21"/>“Muxuni itoe, en ma fe faɲina e kui. E xa lu bɔxɔni ito ma, e yulayaan liga, bayo en ma bɔxɔn gbo. En nɔɛ nɛn e dii tɛmɛne dɔxɛ, en fan en ma dii tɛmɛne fima e ma nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22"/>Muxuni itoe mi dɔxɔma be, en xa findi yama kedenna ra, fɔ xɛmɛn naxan birin en konni be yi, ne xa banxulan alo e kiinde. <verse eid="GEN 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23"/>Xa en bata tin e falan ma, na waxatini e dɔxɔma en konni nɛn. E xuruseene nun e yii seen birin findima en birin gbeen na nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24"/>Muxun naxan birin yi na taan so dɛɛn na na lɔxɔni, e birin yi tin Xamori nun a dii Siken ma falan ma. Xɛmɛn naxan birin yi na taan kui, e birin yi banxulan.<verse eid="GEN 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25"/>A xii saxande lɔxɔni, xɛmɛne fatine to yi e xɔlɔma, Yaxubaa dii xɛmɛ firinna Simeyɔn nun Lewi, Dina tada xɛmɛmane, e yi e dɛgɛmane tongo. E yi fu taan ma muxu yo mi sogin e ma, e yi xɛmɛn birin faxa. <verse eid="GEN 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26"/>E yi Xamori nun a dii Siken fan faxa. E yi Dina tongo Siken konni, e yi fa a ra. <verse eid="GEN 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27"/>Yaxubaa diine yi seen birin tongo faxa muxune xun ma, bayo e bata yi e xunyɛ ɲaxalanmaan nayagi. <verse eid="GEN 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28"/>E yi e yɛxɛɛne tongo e nun e siine nun e ɲingene nun e sofanle, naxanye yi taan kui e nun xɛɛn ma. <verse eid="GEN 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29"/>Nafunla naxan birin yi na, e yi a birin xali. E yi dii tɛmɛne nun ɲaxanle xali. E banxin birin kui geli.<verse eid="GEN 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30"/>Yaxuba yi a fala Simeyɔn nun Lewi xa, a naxa, “Ɛ bata lanbaranna ti n ma. Ɛ bata en naɲaxu Kanan kaane nun Perisi kaane ma alo se kunxin xirina. Muxu wuyaxi mi n yii. E e malanma nɛn n xili ma, e n yɛngɛ, n xabilan birin yi halagi.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “A mi lan a xa en xunyɛ ɲaxalanmaan findi yalunden na.”<verse eid="GEN 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba yi siga Betɛli yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1"/>Ala yi a fala Yaxuba xa, a naxa, “Keli, i sa dɔxɔ Betɛli yi. I saraxa ganden nafala n xa mɛnni, n bata yi n yɛtɛ yita i ra dɛnaxan yi, i yi i gima i tada Esayu bun ma waxatin naxan yi.” <verse eid="GEN 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2"/>Yaxuba yi a fala a denbayaan xa e nun muxun naxanye yi a fɛma, a naxa, “Ɛ xɔɲɛne suxurene yiba, ɛ ɛ yɛtɛ sariɲan, ɛ ɛ dugine fan masara ɛ ma. <verse eid="GEN 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3"/>Ɛ fa, en siga Betɛli yi. N xa saraxa ganden nafala Ala xa, naxan n malixi n yi lanbaranni waxatin naxan yi. A yi a yengi lu n xɔn ma n ma sigatini.”<verse eid="GEN 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4"/>Na waxatini e yi e suxurene birin so Yaxuba yii e nun e tunla soone. Yaxuba yi e birin bitin konden bun ma naxan Siken dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5"/>Yaxuba nun a diine to keli sigadeni, Ala yi gaxun lu e rabilin taane birin muxune bɔɲɛni, muxu yo mi susu birɛ e fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="GEN 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6"/>Yaxuba nun a fɔxɔrabirane yi siga Lusi yi, naxan mɔn xili Betɛli, Kanan bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7"/>A yi saraxa ganden nafala mɛnni. A yi na saraxa ganden xili sa “Betɛli a Ala,” bayo Ala a yɛtɛ yita a ra mɛnni nɛn, a yi a gima a tada bun waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8"/>Rebeka a dii masuxun Debora to faxa, e yi a maluxun Betɛli mabinni wariin dɛnaxan yi. Na wariin xili nɛn “wugadena.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9"/>Ala mɔn yi mini Yaxuba xa, a xɛtɛ xanbini Padan-Arami yi. A yi barakan nagidi a ma. <verse eid="GEN 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10"/>Ala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I xili nɛn Yaxuba, koni a mi falama na kiini sɔnɔn. To xanbi ra, i xinla fa falama nɛn Isirayila.” Awa, Ala yi a xili sa Isirayila. <verse eid="GEN 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11"/>A mɔn yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna nan n na. I xa wuya, i yiriwa alogo i xa findi siyana nde benban na. I mɔn findima nɛn siya wuyaxine benban na. Mangane minima nɛn i bɔnsɔnni. <verse eid="GEN 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12"/>N bɔxɔn naxan fi Iburahima nun Isiyaga ma, n na a fi i fan ma. Na dangu xanbini, n na a fima i bɔnsɔnna fan ma nɛn.”<verse eid="GEN 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13"/>Ala yi keli na, a falan ti Yaxuba xa dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14"/>Yaxuba yi gɛmɛ taxamasenna ti na, a yi turen nun min seen bɔxɔn a ma saraxan na. <verse eid="GEN 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15"/>A yi yireni ito xili sa Betɛli, Ala falan ti a xa dɛnaxan yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">35.15</char> <char style="fk">Betɛli</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Alaa banxina.”</note><verse eid="GEN 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rakeli faxa fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16"/>Yaxuba nun a denbayaan to keli Betɛli yi, e mɔn makuya Efarata ra, Rakeli yi diin sɔtɔ. Na dii bari feen yi xɔdɔxɔ ayi. <verse eid="GEN 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17"/>Rakeli yi diin barima waxatin naxan yi xɔlɛni, dii rasuxun yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Hali i mi gaxu, i mɔn xɛmɛn nan barixi.”<verse eid="GEN 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18"/>Rakeli bata yi lu alo faxa muxuna. A yi a niin makakama waxatin naxan yi, a yi a diin xili sa Benoni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">35.18</char> <char style="fk">Benoni</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Nimisa diina.”</note> Koni a baba tan yi a xili sa Bunyamin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">35.18</char> <char style="fk">Bunyamin</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “N yiifanna diina.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19"/>Rakeli to faxa, e yi a maluxun Efarata kiraan dɛxɔn ma. Na yiren xili nɛn iki Bɛtɛlɛmi. <verse eid="GEN 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20"/>Yaxuba yi gɛmɛn sa taxamasenna ra a gaburun fari. Han to na gɛmɛn na Rakeli gaburun taxamasenna ra.<verse eid="GEN 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">Taruxune Singena 2.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21"/>Isirayila yi sa a bubun ti Migidali-Ederi xanbi ra. <verse eid="GEN 35:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22"/>Isirayila to yi dɔxi na taani, Rubɛn nun Bila yi sa e sa, a baba konyi ɲaxanla. Isirayila yi a kolon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Isirayila dii xɛmɛn fu nun firinna naxanye sɔtɔ: <verse eid="GEN 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23"/>Leya yi Rubɛn bari dii saran na, na xanbi ra Simeyɔn nun Lewi nun Yuda nun Isakari nun Sabulon. <verse eid="GEN 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24"/>Rakeli yi Yusufu nun Bunyamin bari. <verse eid="GEN 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25"/>Rakeli a konyin Bila yi Nafatali nun Dan bari. <verse eid="GEN 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26"/>Leyaa konyin Silipa yi Gadi nun Aseri bari. Ne birin findixi Yaxubaa diine nan na, a naxanye sɔtɔ Padan-Arami yi.<verse eid="GEN 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27"/>Yaxuba yi siga a baba Isiyaga konni Mamire, Kiriyati-Aruba mabinni. Mɛn xili nɛn Xebiron, Iburahima nun Isiyaga dɔxɔde fonna. <verse eid="GEN 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28"/>Isiyaga a siimayaan yi siga ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge solomasɛxɛ. <verse eid="GEN 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29"/>A to faxa, a bata yi siimaya xunkuye sɔtɔ, a yi faxa, a siga laxira yi. A dii Esayu nun Yaxuba yi a maluxun.<verse eid="GEN 35:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36"/>
  <para style="s">Esayu bɔnsɔnna</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">Taruxune Singena 1.34-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1"/>Esayu, naxan mɔn xili Edɔn, a bɔnsɔnna taruxun ni i ra. <verse eid="GEN 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2"/>Esayu Kanan ɲaxanle dɔxɔ nɛn: Ada findi Elon ma diin nan na, Xiti kaana, e nun Yoholibama, Anaa dii tɛmɛna, Sibeyon Xiwin mamandenna nan a ra. <verse eid="GEN 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3"/>A yi Sumayila a dii tɛmɛn Basamati fan dɔxɔ, Nebayoti xunyɛ ɲaxalanmana. <verse eid="GEN 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4"/>Ada nan Elifasi sɔtɔ Esayu xa. Reyuli findi Basamati a diin nan na. <verse eid="GEN 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5"/>Yoholibama dii xɛmɛ saxan nan bari: Yewusi nun Yalami e nun Kora. Ne birin findi Esayu a diine nan na naxanye barixi Kanan bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6"/>Esayu yi a ɲaxanle nun a dii tɛmɛne nun a dii xɛmɛne nun a muxune birin tongo, e nun a xuruseene birin e nun a hɛrisigɛn naxan birin sɔtɔ Kanan bɔxɔni. A yi a birin xali bɔxɔ gbɛtɛn ma dɛnaxan makuya a xunyɛ Yaxuba ra, <verse eid="GEN 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7"/>bayo e hɛrisigɛn bata yi gbo ayi. E mi yi nɔɛ luyɛ e bode dɛxɔn ma. E yi dɛnaxan yi e xuruseene birin mi yi nɔɛ balo sɔtɛ mɛnni. <verse eid="GEN 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8"/>Na nan a to Esayu, naxan mɔn xili Edɔn, na yi siga a sa dɔxɔ Seyiri geya yireni.<verse eid="GEN 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9"/>Edɔn kaane benba Esayu bɔnsɔnna xinle ni itoe ra naxanye yi dɔxi Seyiri geya yireni: <verse eid="GEN 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10"/>Esayu a diine ni i ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:10">Elifasi, Ada a dii xɛmɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:10">Reyuli, Basamati a dii xɛmɛna.<verse eid="GEN 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11"/>Elifasi a diine ni ito ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:11">Teman nun Omaru nun Sefo nun Gatami e nun Kenasi.<verse eid="GEN 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12"/>Timina nan yi Elifasi a konyi ɲaxanla ra. Na Amalɛki bari nɛn Elifasi xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:12">Esayu nun a ɲaxanla Ada mamandenne ni ito ra.<verse eid="GEN 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13"/>Reyuli a diine ni i ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:13">Naxati nun Sera nun Sama e nun Misa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:13">Ne findi Esayu nun a ɲaxanla Basamati mamandenne nan na.<verse eid="GEN 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14"/>Esayu a ɲaxanla Yoholibama a diine ni i ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:14">Yewusi nun Yalami e nun Kora.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:14">Yoholibama findi Anaa dii tɛmɛn nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:14">Ana findi Sibeyon ma dii tɛmɛn nan na.<verse eid="GEN 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15"/>Mangan naxanye keli Esayu bɔnsɔnni, ne ni i ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:15">Elifasi, Esayu a dii singena, na diine ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:15">Manga Teman nun Manga Omaru nun Manga Sefo nun Manga Kenasi<verse eid="GEN 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16"/>nun Manga Kora nun Manga Gatami nun Manga Amalɛki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:16">Mangane nan yi ne ra naxanye fataxi Elifasi ra Edɔn yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:16">Ada mamandenne nan e ra.<verse eid="GEN 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17"/>Reyuli, Esayu a diina, a diine ni i ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:17">Manga Naxati nun Manga Sera nun Manga Sama e nun Manga Misa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:17">Mangane nan yi ne ra naxanye fataxi Reyuli ra Edɔn yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:17">Basamati mamandenne nan e ra.<verse eid="GEN 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18"/>Yoholibama, Esayu a ɲaxanla, a diine ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:18">Manga Yewusi nun Manga Yalami nun Manga Kora.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:18">Mangane ni itoe ra naxanye fataxi Yoholibama ra, Esayu a ɲaxanla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:18">Yoholibama findi Anaa diin nan na.<verse eid="GEN 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19"/>Esayu, naxan mɔn xili Edɔn, na a diine nan ne ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:19">Mangan naxanye keli Esayu bɔnsɔnni, ne nan ne ra.<verse eid="GEN 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 1.38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20"/>Seyiri Xori kaana diine ni itoe ra naxanye yi dɔxi na yamanani:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:20">Lotan nun Sobali nun Sibeyon nun Ana<verse eid="GEN 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21"/>nun Dison nun Eseri e nun Disan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:21">Seyiri a diine yi findi Xori mangane ra Edɔn yamanani.<verse eid="GEN 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22"/>Lotan ma dii xɛmɛne ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:22">Xori nun Heman.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:22">Timina findi Lotan xunyɛ dii tɛmɛn nan na.<verse eid="GEN 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23"/>Sobali a dii xɛmɛne ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:23">Aliban nun Manaxati nun Ebali nun Sefo e nun Onan.<verse eid="GEN 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24"/>Sibeyon ma dii xɛmɛne ni ito ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:24">Aya nun Ana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:24">Ana nan tigi wolonxine to tonbon yireni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:24">a to yi Sibeyon ma sofanle rabama.<verse eid="GEN 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25"/>Ana a diine ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:25">Dison nun Yoholibama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:25">Ana a dii tɛmɛna.<verse eid="GEN 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26"/>Dison ma dii xɛmɛne ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:26">Xemadan nun Eseban nun Itiran e nun Keran.<verse eid="GEN 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27"/>Eseri a dii xɛmɛne ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:27">Bilihan nun Saawan e nun Akan.<verse eid="GEN 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28"/>Disan ma dii xɛmɛne ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:28">Yusu nun Aran.<verse eid="GEN 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29"/>Xori kaane mangane ni i ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:29">Manga Lotan nun Manga Sobali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:29">nun Manga Sibeyon nun Manga Ana<verse eid="GEN 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30"/>nun Manga Dison nun Manga Eseri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:30">e nun Manga Disan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:30">Xori kaane Mangane findi ne nan na e bɔnsɔn yɛɛn ma Seyiri bɔxɔni.<verse eid="GEN 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Edɔn Mangane</para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 1.43-54</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31"/>Mangane nan itoe ra naxanye yi Edɔn yamanan xun na benun Isirayila kaane xa mangan dɔxɔ waxatin naxan yi: <verse eid="GEN 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32"/>Beyori a diin Bela yi findi Edɔn manga singen na, naxan ma taan yi xili Dinhaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33"/>Bela to faxa, Seraa diin Yobabo, Bosara kaan yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="GEN 36:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34"/>Yobabo to faxa, Xusama, naxan yi kelixi Teman yamanani, na yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="GEN 36:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35"/>Xusama to faxa, Bedadaa diin Xadada yi findi mangan na. A tan nan Midiyan kaane nɔ Moyaba bɔxɔni. A taan yi xili nɛn Abiti. <verse eid="GEN 36:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36"/>Xadada to faxa, Samala Masareka kaan yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="GEN 36:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37"/>Samala to faxa, Sayuli naxan yi kelixi Rehoboti taani baan dɛ, na yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="GEN 36:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38"/>Sayuli to faxa, Akibori a diin Baali-Xanan yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="GEN 36:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39"/>Baali-Xanan, Akibori a diin to faxa, Xadada yi findi mangan na. A taan yi xili nɛn Pawu. A ɲaxanla yi xili nɛn Mehetabeli, Matirɛdi a dii tɛmɛna, Mesahabi mamandenna.<verse eid="GEN 36:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40"/>Mangane ni i ra naxanye kelixi Esayu bɔnsɔnni, e bɔnsɔnna nun e yamanan yɛɛn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:40">Manga Timina nun Manga Aliwa nun Manga Yetɛti<verse eid="GEN 36:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41"/>nun Manga Yoholibama nun Manga Ela nun Manga Pinon<verse eid="GEN 36:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42"/>nun Manga Kenasi nun Manga Teman nun Manga Mibisari<verse eid="GEN 36:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43"/>nun Manga Magadiyɛli nun Manga Irami.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:43">Ne nan yi Edɔn mangane ra e nun e bɔxɔna e yi dɔxi dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:43">Esayu a feen nan na ra naxan findixi Edɔn kaane benban na.<verse eid="GEN 36:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu a xiyena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1"/>Yaxuba dɔxɔ nɛn Kanan yamanani, a baba yi dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2"/>Yaxuba bɔnsɔnne taruxun ni ito ra. Yusufu a dii ɲɔrɛyaan ɲɛɛ fu nun solofere nan yi a ra. A tan nun a tadane yi xuruseene nan kantanma, naxanye nga yi Bila nun Silipa ra, a babaa ɲaxanle. A yi e fe ɲaxine dɛntɛgɛn sama a baba xa. <verse eid="GEN 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3"/>Yusufu nan yi rafan Isirayila ma dangu a diine birin na, bayo a tan nan sɔtɔ a xɛmɛ foriyani. A yi doma kuye tofaɲin so a yii. <verse eid="GEN 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4"/>Yusufu tadane to na feen to, a a tan nan nafan e baba ma dangu e birin na, e yi a raɲaxu. Fala faɲi yo mi yi e tagi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="GEN 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5"/>Yusufu yi xiye sa, a yi a yɛba a tadane xa. E yi a raɲaxu dangu a fɔlɔn na. <verse eid="GEN 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tuli mati n ma xiyen na, n naxan saxi. <verse eid="GEN 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7"/>En birin yi xɛɛn ma malo raxidideni. Nanunna, n ma malo xidin yi keli, a ti. Ɛ gbee malo xidine yi lu bilinxi n gbee xidin na, e birin yi e xinbi sin n ma malo xidin bun.” <verse eid="GEN 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8"/>A tadane yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Ee! I waxi findi feni nxɔ mangan nan na alogo i xa nxu yamari?” E yi a raɲaxu dangu a fɔlɔn na a xiyena fe ra e nun a falana.<verse eid="GEN 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9"/>Yusufu mɔn yi xiye gbɛtɛ sa, a yi na fan yɛba a tadane xa. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ ɛ tuli mati, n mɔn bata xiye sa. Sogen nun kiken nun sare fu nun keden yi e xinbi sinma n bun ma.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10"/>A yi xiyeni ito yɛba a baba nun a tadane xa. A baba yi a kɔnkɔ a ma, a fa a fala a xa, a naxa, “I xiyen naxan saxi iki, nanse na ra? I nga nun i tadane nun n tan, nxu birin fama nxu xinbi sindeni i yɛtagi?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11"/>A tadane yi lu a maxɔxɔlɔnɲɛ, koni a baba yi a yengi lu a xiyen xɔn ma.<verse eid="GEN 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu tadane yi a mati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12"/>Yusufu tadane yi siga Siken yi e babaa xurusene rabadeni. <verse eid="GEN 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13"/>Isirayila yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “I tadane bata siga xuruse rabadeni Siken yi. Fa be, n xa i xɛ e ma.” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “Awa.” <verse eid="GEN 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14"/>Isirayila yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Siga mafurɛn, i sa a mato xa i tadane kɛndɛ, xa se mi xuruseene fan toxi, i yi fa na dɛntɛgɛn sa n xa.” A yi a xɛ keli Xebiron lanbanni siga Siken yi. <verse eid="GEN 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15"/>Xɛmɛna nde yi a to xɛɛne xun xɔn. Xɛmɛn yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I nanse fenma?” <verse eid="GEN 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16"/>A yi a yabi, a naxa, “N na n tadane nan fenma. A fala n xa, yandi, e xurusene rabama dɛnaxan yi.” <verse eid="GEN 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17"/>Xɛmɛn yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “E bata keli be, bayo n na e xuiin mɛ nɛn, e yi a falama, a e xa siga Dotan yi.” Yusufu yi bira a tadane funfu xɔn han a sa a tadane li Dotan yi.<verse eid="GEN 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18"/>E to a to wulani, benun a xa maso e ra, e lan a ma, a e xa a faxa. <verse eid="GEN 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19"/>E yi a fala e bode xa, e naxa, “Na xiye saan nan fama iki. <verse eid="GEN 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20"/>Ɛ fa be, en na a faxa, en na a woli xɔɲinna ra. Nayi, en na keli, en na a falama nɛn, a sube ɲaxin bata a don. Na waxatini en fama a kolondeni nɛn a xiyen findima a xa feen naxan na.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21"/>Rubɛn yi na feen mɛ. A yi kata a xa a xunba, a naxa, “En nama a faxa.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22"/>Rubɛn mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ nama a wunla ramini de! Ɛ a woli xɔɲinni ito ra naxan tonbon yireni ito yi. Muxu yo nama a yiin din a ra.” A yi wama a xunba feni alogo a xa nɔ a xalideni a baba fɛma.<verse eid="GEN 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23"/>Yusufu to so a tadane yireni, a doma kuye tofaɲin naxan yi ragodoxi a ma, e yi na rate a ma. <verse eid="GEN 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24"/>E yi Yusufu tongo, e a woli xɔɲinna ra, ige mi naxan kui.<verse eid="GEN 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25"/>Na xanbi, e yi dɔxɔ donse dondeni. E to e yɛɛn nakeli, e yi Sumayila bɔnsɔnna yulane to fɛ. E yi kelixi Galadi yi, wusulanna nun senna nun latikɔnɔnna yi e ɲɔgɔmɛne fari siga Misiran yi. <verse eid="GEN 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26"/>Yuda yi a fala a xunyɛne xa, a naxa, “Xa en na en xunyɛn faxa, en yi a wunla luxun, na tɔnɔn mundun en tan ma? <verse eid="GEN 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27"/>Ɛ fa, en na a mati Sumayila bɔnsɔnna muxune ma, koni en nama en yiin din a ra de! Bayo en xunyɛn na a ra, en wuli keden fasa keden.” A xunyɛne birin yi tin a falan ma.<verse eid="GEN 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28"/>Na xanbi, Midiyan yulane danguma, e yi Yusufu rate xɔɲinna ra. E yi Yusufu mati gbeti gbanan mɔxɔɲɛ ra Sumayila bɔnsɔnna muxune ma. E yi a xali Misiran yi.<verse eid="GEN 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29"/>Rubɛn to xɛtɛ xɔɲinna yireni, a mi Yusufu li na sɔnɔn. A yi a domaan birin yibɔ sununi. <verse eid="GEN 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30"/>A yi xɛtɛ a xunyɛne fɛma, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Diidin mi fa na! N tan fa nanse ligama sɔnɔn?” <verse eid="GEN 37:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31"/>E yi kɔtɔ keden faxa, e yi Yusufu a doma kuye tofaɲin maturuxun na sube wunli. <verse eid="GEN 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32"/>Na xanbi, e yi na doma kuye tofaɲin xali e baba fɛma. E yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Nxu bata ito to. Domani ito mato ba, xa i ya diin gbeen na a ra.” <verse eid="GEN 37:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33"/>Yaxuba yi domaan kolon. A yi a fala, a naxa, “N ma diina domaan na a ra! Sube xaɲɛna nde bata a faxa! A bata Yusufu yibɔ!” <verse eid="GEN 37:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34"/>Yaxuba yi a dugine yibɔ sununi, a mɔn yi kasa dugin nagodo a ma. A yi a diin ɲan feen liga xii wuyaxi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35"/>A dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne yi siga a madɛndɛndeni, koni a mi tin na ma. A yi a fala, a naxa, “N nan n ma diin saya feen ligama nɛn han n sa a li laxira yi.” A yi lu wugɛ a diina fe ra.<verse eid="GEN 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36"/>Midiyan kaane yi Yusufu mati Potifari ma Misiran yi, Misiran Mangana kuntigina nde naxan a kantan tiine xunna.<verse eid="GEN 37:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38"/>
  <para style="s">Yuda nun Tamari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1"/>Na waxatini, Yuda yi keli a ngaxakedenne xun ma, a siga Adulan kaana nde konni naxan xili Xira. <verse eid="GEN 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2"/>Yuda yi Suya Kanan kaana dii tɛmɛn to mɛnni. A yi a findi a ɲaxanla ra. E yi lu e bode xɔn. <verse eid="GEN 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3"/>A yi fudikan, a yi dii xɛmɛn bari. E yi na diin xili sa Eri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4"/>A mɔn yi fudikan dii firinden na, a yi dii xɛmɛn bari. E yi na diin xili sa Onan. <verse eid="GEN 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5"/>Na xanbi, a mɔn yi dii xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ bari, a yi na xili sa Selaxa. Yuda yi Kesibe taan nin a ɲaxanla yi diin barima waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="GEN 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6"/>Yuda yi ɲaxanla fen, a a so a dii singen Eri yii. Na ɲaxanla xili Tamari. <verse eid="GEN 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7"/>Muxu ɲaxin nan yi Yudaa dii singen Eri ra Alatala yɛɛ ra yi. Alatala yi a faxa. <verse eid="GEN 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8"/>Na xanbi Yuda yi a fala Onan xa, a naxa, “I tadaa ɲaxanla tongo, a xa findi i ya ɲaxanla ra. I a xɛmɛ xuriya wanla liga alogo i xa diin fi i tada faxa muxun ma.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9"/>Koni Onan yi a kolon, a na diin mi yi findɛ a gbeen na. Na nan a liga, a to yi a tada ɲaxanla kolonma ɲaxanla ra, igen naxan minima a fatini, a yi na makala bɔxɔn ma alogo a nama diin bari a tada xa. <verse eid="GEN 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10"/>A yi naxan ligama, na mi yi rafan Alatala ma. Nanara, a yi a faxa.<verse eid="GEN 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11"/>Awa, Yuda yi a fala a mamuxun Tamari xa, a naxa, “Lu kaɲayani i baba konni benun n ma dii Selaxa xa gbo waxatin naxan yi.” A yi mirixi nɛn yanyina nde Selaxa fan faxama nɛn alo a tadane faxaxi kii naxan yi. Tamari yi siga a sa lu a baba konni. <verse eid="GEN 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12"/>A mi bu Suya a dii tɛmɛna, Yudaa ɲaxanla yi faxa. Ɲan feen to ba a ra, Yuda yi siga Timana yi e nun a lanfaan Xira Adulan kaana. E yi siga Yuda xuruse yireni, e yi e xabene maxabama dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="GEN 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13"/>Muxuna nde yi a fala Tamari xa, a naxa, “I taɲe sigama Timana taani a xurusene xabene maxabadeni.” <verse eid="GEN 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14"/>A yi a kaɲa dugine ba a ma, a yi dugin so a yɛtagin xun na, a sa dɔxɔ Enayin taan so dɛɛn na Timana kiraan xɔn. A bata yi a to Selaxa bata findi banxulanna ra, koni e mi a fi a ma a xa findi a ɲaxanla ra.<verse eid="GEN 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15"/>Yuda to a to a dugin soxi a yɛtagin xun na, a yi a miri a yalunden na a ra. <verse eid="GEN 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16"/>A yi a fala a xa kiraan na, a naxa, “En siga, en sa kafu.” A mi yi a kolon a mamuxun na a ra. Koni, Tamari yi Yuda maxɔdin, a naxa, “I nanse fima n ma en na kafu?” <verse eid="GEN 38:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17"/>A yi a yabi, a naxa, “N sii keden nan tongoma n ma xuruseene tagi, n fa a ra i yɛɛ ra.” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “Awa, tolimana nde lu n yii be singe benun i xa fa siin na waxatin naxan yi.” <verse eid="GEN 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18"/>A yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I wama n xa nanse so i yii tolimaan na?” Tamari yi a yabi, a naxa, “I ya taxamasenna nun a lutin nun i ya dunganna so n yii.” A yi na seene so a yii, e fa kafu. Tamari yi fudikan a diin na. <verse eid="GEN 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19"/>A yi xɛtɛ a konni. A yi dugin ba a yɛtagin xun na, a mɔn yi a kaɲa domaan nagodo a ma.<verse eid="GEN 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20"/>Yuda yi a lanfa Adulan kaan xɛ sii diin tideni ɲaxanla ma alogo a xa fa seene ra a naxanye so ɲaxanla yii tolimaan na. Koni a mi ɲaxanla to. <verse eid="GEN 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21"/>A yi mɛn kaane maxɔdin, a naxa, “Yalunde ɲaxanla naxan yi kiraan dɛ Enayin taani, na minɛn yi?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Yalunde yo mi be.” <verse eid="GEN 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22"/>A yi xɛtɛ Yuda yireni, a fa a fala, a naxa, “N mi a lixi na. Mɛn kaane mɔn bata a fala n xa a yalunde yo mi na e tan konni.” <verse eid="GEN 38:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23"/>Yuda yi a fala, a naxa, “A xa na seene mara. En fan nama en yɛtɛ rayagi. N bata sii diin nasanba a ma, koni i mi a lixi na.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24"/>Kike saxan dangu xanbi, muxuna nde yi a fala Yuda xa, a naxa, “I mamuxun Tamari bata findi yalunden na, a bata fudikan a yalunyani.” Yuda yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ a ramini, a gan.” <verse eid="GEN 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25"/>E yi fama a ra waxatin naxan yi, a yi xɛraan nasiga a taɲe ma, a naxa, “Seni itoe mato naxanye n yii. Taxamasenni ito nun a lutin nun dunganni ito na findi muxun naxan gbee ra na nan n nafudikanxi. I lan nɛn i xa a kanna kolon.” <verse eid="GEN 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26"/>Yuda yi na feene kolon. A yi a fala, a naxa, “A tinxin dangu n tan na bayo n mi a fixi n ma dii Selaxa ma.” Na xanbi ra, e mi fa kafu.<verse eid="GEN 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27"/>A yi diin barima waxatin naxan yi, e yi a kolon a gulunne nan a kui. <verse eid="GEN 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28"/>Diin bari waxatini, keden yi a yiin namini. Dii rasuxun yi a yiin suxu, a gari gbeela xidi a yiin na. A fa a fala, a naxa, “Ito nan singe barixi.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29"/>Koni na diin yi a yiin naso, a xunyɛn yi bari. Dii rasuxun yi a fala, a naxa, “I yɛtɛ raminixi fangan mundun na iki?” A yi a xili sa Peresi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">38.29</char> <char style="fk">Peresi</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “A rabi fena.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30"/>Na xanbi boden fan yi bari gari gbeela xidixi a yiin na. Yuda yi a xili sa Sera.<verse eid="GEN 38:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu Potifari konni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1"/>Sumayila bɔnsɔnna muxune yi siga Yusufu ra Misiran yamanani. Potifari, Misiran Mangan kantan tiine xunna yi a sara. <verse eid="GEN 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2"/>Alatala yi Yusufu xɔn. A yi feen naxanye birin suxuma, ayi birin gasama. A yi lu a kanna Misiran kaan konni. <verse eid="GEN 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3"/>A kanna yi a kolon, a Alatala yi Yusufu xɔn, bayo Alatala bata yi a feen birin nasɔnɔya. <verse eid="GEN 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4"/>Yusufu yi rafan a kanna ma, a yi a findi a banxi xunna ra. A yi a hɛrisigɛn birin taxu a ra.<verse eid="GEN 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5"/>Na xanbi Yusufu to findi a banxi xunna ra e nun a yii seene birin, Alatala yi barakan sa Misiran kaana denbayani Yusufu a fe ra. Alatala yi barakan sa a yii seene birin yi, e nun a banxin nun a xɛɛne. <verse eid="GEN 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6"/>Nanara, seen naxanye birin yi Potifari yii, a yi a birin nabeɲin Yusufu yii. A tan mi yi fa a yengi saxi fefe xɔn ma fɔ a yi donseen naxan donma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusufu yi tofan han. <verse eid="GEN 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7"/>Na feene danguxina, a kanna ɲaxanla yi a yɛɛn ti Yusufu ra. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Fa be, en fa kafu.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8"/>Yusufu yi tondi, a a fala a kanna ɲaxanla xa, a naxa, “Xabu n fa n kanna konni a mi a yengi luxi fefe xɔn ma sɔnɔn a banxini. A bata a yii seene birin taxu n na. <verse eid="GEN 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9"/>A banxin kui be, n tan nan dangu muxun birin na. A mi sese rafisaxi n xa, fɔ i kedenna, bayo i tan bata findi a ɲaxanla ra. Iki, n fe ɲaxi gbee sifani ito ligama nanfera naxan findɛ yulubi feen na Ala yii?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10"/>Na ɲaxanla yi na falama Yusufu xa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ. Koni hali na, Yusufu mi yi a tuli matima e kafu feen miriyaan na.<verse eid="GEN 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11"/>Lɔxɔna nde, Yusufu yi so banxini wali kɛdeni. Banxi kui konyi yo mi yi na na waxatini. <verse eid="GEN 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12"/>Na ɲaxanla yi dutun a domaan ma. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “En kafu!” Yusufu yi a ba a domani, a yi a lu ɲaxanla yii. A yi mini a giyɛ tandeni.<verse eid="GEN 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13"/>Ɲaxanla to a to a bata a gi, a a domaan lu a yii, a mini tanden ma, <verse eid="GEN 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14"/>a yi a banxi kui konyine xili, a fa a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ ito mato, n ma xɛmɛn faxi Heburu nan na a xa fa sabaan so en na. A faxi nɛn n fɛma a nxu xa kafu, koni n yi sɔnxɔn nate. <verse eid="GEN 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15"/>A to n sɔnxɔ xuiin mɛ, a yi a gi, a a domaan lu n dɛxɔn ma. A yi mini a giyɛ tandeni.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16"/>A yi Yusufu a domaan namara han a kanna fa waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17"/>A yi feni ito yɛba a xa, a naxa, “I faxi Heburu konyi xɛmɛn naxan na, a faxi nɛn a xa sabaan so n na. <verse eid="GEN 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18"/>Koni n to sɔnxɔn nate, a yi a domaan lu n yii, a yi mini a giyɛ tandeni.” <verse eid="GEN 39:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19"/>Yusufu kanna to a ɲaxanla falan mɛ, a yi naxan falama a xa iki, a naxa, “A mato, i ya konyin naxan nabaxi n na,” <verse eid="GEN 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20"/>a bɔɲɛn yi te, a xɔlɔ. A yi Yusufu balan mangana kasorasane yi dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:20">Koni kasoon na, <verse eid="GEN 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21"/>Alatala yi lu Yusufu xɔn ma, a hinan a ra. A yi a ragidi Yusufu ma e nun kaso mangan yi dɛ fan. <verse eid="GEN 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22"/>Kaso mangan yi kasorasaan birin taxu Yusufu ra. Feen naxan birin yi ligama a yi danguma a tan nan yii. <verse eid="GEN 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23"/>Kaso mangan mi yi Yusufu a wanla xun matoma a ra, bayo Alatala yi Yusufu xɔn ma. A bata yi a feen birin nasɔnɔya.<verse eid="GEN 39:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kasoon na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1"/>Na xanbi, Misiran Mangana muxun naxan yengi dɔxi a minseen xɔn ma, na nun a buru ganna yi e kanna Misiran Mangan hakɛn tongo. <verse eid="GEN 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2"/>Misiran Mangan yi xɔlɔ a banxi kui konyin firinne ma, naxan yengi saxi a minseen xɔn ma e nun naxan a burun ganma. <verse eid="GEN 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3"/>A yi e suxu, a e balan sofane mangana kaso banxini, Yusufu yi dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4"/>Sofane mangan yi e taxu Yusufu ra, naxan yi walima e yii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:4">E to waxati ti kasoon na, <verse eid="GEN 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5"/>naxan yengi saxi mangana minseen xɔn ma, e nun naxan burun ganma Misiran mangan xa, e yi xiye sa kasoni kɔɛna nde ra. Na xiye firinna birin nun a bun. <verse eid="GEN 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6"/>Yusufu yi fa e matodeni xɔtɔnni, a yi e li kuisanxi. <verse eid="GEN 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7"/>A yi Misiran Mangana banxi kui konyini itoe maxɔdin naxanye fan yi kasoni, a naxa, “Nanfera ɛ kuisanxi to?” <verse eid="GEN 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu bata xiyena nde nan sa, koni muxu yo mi be naxan nɔɛ na yɛbɛ.” Yusufu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ mi a kolon Ala nan xiyene bunne kanna ra? Ɛ ɛ xiyene fala n xa.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9"/>Naxan yengi yi saxi mangana minseen xɔn ma, na yi a xiyen fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “N tan ma xiyeni, n manpa binla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note> nan to, a tixi n yɛtagi alo ɲaxundan binla, <verse eid="GEN 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10"/>a yii saxan tixi a ma. A to fuga, a fugen yi bogi mɔxine ramini alo ɲaxundan tɔnsɔnne. <verse eid="GEN 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11"/>Misiran Mangana igelengenna suxi n yii. N yi manpa bogi mɔxine ba, n yi e bundu Misiran Mangana igelengenna kui, n fa a so a yii.” <verse eid="GEN 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12"/>Yusufu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “A bunna ni ito ra: Na yii saxanna naxanye na kiini a xii saxan nan yitaxi. <verse eid="GEN 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13"/>Xii saxan na dangu, Misiran Mangana i xunnakelima nɛn, a mɔn yi i raxɛtɛ i ya walide fonni. I mɔn fama nɛn igelengenna sodeni Misiran Mangan yii alo i darixi a ra kii naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14"/>Koni i ɲɔxɔ lu n xɔn ma i na hɛrin sɔtɔ waxatin naxan yi. I xa hinan n na, i xa n ma fe fala Misiran Mangan xa alogo n xa mini kasoni. <verse eid="GEN 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15"/>Bayo e n tongoxi fangan nan na Heburu bɔxɔni. Be fan, n mi fefe ligaxi naxan a ligɛ n xa kasoon sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16"/>Naxan burun ganma mangan xa, a to a to fa fala xiyen bunna fan, a yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “N tan fan xiye saxi nɛn. Debe saxan dɔxi n xun ma buru fixɛna e kui. <verse eid="GEN 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17"/>Deben naxan dɔxi a fari, buru ganna donseen naxan birin nafalama Misiran Mangan xa, ne a kui. Koni xɔline yi fa na donseen donɲɛ naxan dɔxi n xun ma.” <verse eid="GEN 40:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18"/>Yusufu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Xiyen bunna ni ito ra: Na debe saxanna naxan na kiini, e xii saxan nan yitaxi. <verse eid="GEN 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19"/>Xii saxan na dangu, Misiran Mangana i xunna sɛgɛma nɛn i dɛ. A i singanma nɛn wudin na, xɔline yi i suben don.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20"/>Xii saxande lɔxɔni, Misiran Mangan bari lɔxɔni, a yi sumun belebele yitɔn a kuntigine xa. Naxan yengi saxi mangana minseen xɔn ma, e nun a buru ganna, Misiran Mangan yi e ramini kasoon na, a fa e ra kuntigine yɛtagi. <verse eid="GEN 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21"/>Naxan yengi saxi minseen xɔn ma, a yi na raxɛtɛ a walide fonni alogo a mɔn xa minseen so a yii. <verse eid="GEN 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22"/>Koni a yi a buru ganna singan wudin na alo Yusufu bata yi a yɛba kii naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23"/>Naxan yengi saxi minse feen xɔn ma, Yusufu a fe mi rabira na ma. A yi ɲinan a xɔn ma.<verse eid="GEN 40:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41"/>
  <para style="s">Misiran Mangan yi xiye sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1"/>Ɲɛɛ firin dangu xanbi, Misiran Mangan yi xiye sa. A tixi xude dɛni. <verse eid="GEN 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2"/>A yi ɲinge to faɲi tuyanxi solofere to kelɛ xuden kui, e e dɛgema mɛrɛni. <verse eid="GEN 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3"/>Na xanbi, ɲinge solofere gbɛtɛ, naxanye to ɲaxu, e doyenxi, ne fan yi keli xuden kui ɲingen bonne dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4"/>Ɲinge to ɲaxi doyenxi solofereni itoe yi ɲinge to faɲi tuyanxi solofereni itoe don. Nayi, Misiran Mangan yi xulun.<verse eid="GEN 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5"/>A mɔn yi xi, a xiye gbɛtɛ sa. <verse eid="GEN 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6"/>Tɔnsɔn solofere faɲi rafexine tixi bili kedenna ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7"/>Na xanbi, tɔnsɔn solofere gbɛtɛ, naxanye xurun, foyen bata e rafofo ayi, ne tixi tɔnsɔnna bodene dɛxɔn ma. Tɔnsɔn xurunni itoe yi tɔnsɔn nafexi faɲine gerun. Nayi, Misiran Mangan yi xulun. Xiyen nan yi a ra.<verse eid="GEN 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8"/>Xɔtɔnni Misiran Mangan bɔɲɛn yi mini. A yi woyimɛne nun fekolonne birin xili naxanye Misiran yi. A yi xiyeni itoe fala e xa, koni muxu yo mi nɔ xiyene yɛbɛ a xa. <verse eid="GEN 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9"/>Na waxatini, naxan yengi saxi mangana minseen xɔn ma, na yi a fala Misiran Mangan xa, a naxa, “N ma kala fonne bata rabira n ma to. <verse eid="GEN 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10"/>Misiran Mangan xɔlɔ nɛn a konyine ma waxatina nde yi. A yi n suxu, a n balan sofa mangana kasoon na, nxu nun naxan yi burun ganma mangan xa. <verse eid="GEN 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11"/>A tan nun n tan, nxu birin xiye sa nɛn kɔɛ kedenna ra, xiye firinna birin nun a bun. <verse eid="GEN 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12"/>Kasoni, nxu nun sofa mangana konyina, Heburu banxulanna nan yi na yi. Nxu yi xiyeni itoe fala a xa, a yi e birin bunna fala nxu xa. Nxu xiyen naxanye saxi, a yi e bunne fala nxu xa. <verse eid="GEN 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13"/>A xiyen yɛba nxu xa kii naxan yi, a mɔn birin ligaxi na kiini nɛn. Misiran Mangan bata n naxɛtɛ n walide fonni. A yi boden fan singan wudin na.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14"/>Misiran Mangan yi Yusufu xili. E yi a ramini kasoni mafurɛn! A yi a xunna bi, a marabɛri baane yi masara a ma. A fa siga Misiran Mangan fɛma. <verse eid="GEN 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15"/>Misiran Mangan yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “N bata xiye sa. Muxu yo mi nɔxi a yɛbadeni, koni n bata a mɛ a i tan nɔɛ xiyen bunna falɛ, naxan na fala i xa.” <verse eid="GEN 41:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16"/>Yusufu yi Misiran Mangan yabi, a naxa, “N tan mi a ra, Ala nan Misiran Mangana a xiyen bun faɲin fima a ma.” <verse eid="GEN 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17"/>Misiran Mangan yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “N xiyeni, n yi tixi xude dɛɛn nin. <verse eid="GEN 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18"/>N yi ɲinge to faɲi tuyanxi solofere to kelɛ xuden kui, e e dɛgema mɛrɛni. <verse eid="GEN 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19"/>Nayi, ɲinge solofere gbɛtɛye yi te e xanbi ra, e doyenxi, e to ɲaxu, e xɔsixi. Han to n munma yi na ɲinge to ɲaxi sifan to Misiran bɔxɔn birin ma singen. <verse eid="GEN 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20"/>Ɲinge xɔsixi to ɲaxine yi ɲinge tuyanxi solofere singene don. <verse eid="GEN 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21"/>Koni na xanbi, muxu yo mi nɔɛ a kolonɲɛ xa e bata e don, masɔtɔ e doyen kiin ma mɔn. Nayi, n yi xulun.”<verse eid="GEN 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22"/>“N mɔn yi xiye gbɛtɛ sa. Tɔnsɔn nafexi faɲi solofere tixi bili kedenna ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23"/>Na xanbi tɔnsɔn solofere gbɛtɛye naxanye xurun, foyen naxanye rafofoxi ayi, ne yi te bodene dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24"/>Tɔnsɔn fofone yi tɔnsɔn faɲi soloferene gerun. N bata a fala woyimɛne xa, koni muxu yo mi nɔxi a yɛbadeni n xa.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25"/>Yusufu yi a fala Misiran Mangan xa, a naxa, “I ya xiye firinna birin fe kedenna nan yitaxi. Ala bata i rakolon feen ma a fama naxan ligadeni. <verse eid="GEN 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26"/>Na ɲinge to faɲi soloferene nun tɔnsɔn faɲi soloferene, ne ɲɛɛ solofere nan yitaxi na kiini. Xiye keden nan a ra. <verse eid="GEN 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27"/>Ɲinge xɔsixi to ɲaxi soloferene nun tɔnsɔn fofo soloferene foyen naxanye rafofoxi ayi, ne fan ɲɛɛ solofere fitina kamɛn nan yitaxi. <verse eid="GEN 41:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28"/>N na a falaxi i xa kii naxan yi, Ala bata na feene yita Misiran Mangan na a fama naxanye ligadeni. <verse eid="GEN 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29"/>Ɲɛɛ soloferen naxanye fama iki, a findima lugo ɲɛɛne nan na Misiran bɔxɔn xa. <verse eid="GEN 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30"/>Na xanbi, ɲɛɛ solofere kamɛn fama nɛn, en ɲinanma nɛn na lugon birin na. Kamɛn Misiran bɔxɔn halagima nɛn. <verse eid="GEN 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31"/>Fitina kamɛn findima fe magaxuxin nan na, han muxune birin yi ɲinan lugo ɲɛɛne xɔn bɔxɔni ito yi.”<verse eid="GEN 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32"/>“I xiyeni ito saxi nɛn dɔxɔɲa yi firin bayo Ala bata a feen nagidi, a mɔn mi buma a ligadeni. <verse eid="GEN 41:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33"/>Iki mangana, xaxilimaan fen, fe kolonna, i yi a dɔxɔ Misiran bɔxɔn xun na. <verse eid="GEN 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34"/>Mangana, i xa muxune sugandi naxanye dɔxɔma na wanla xun na lugo ɲɛɛ soloferen bun ma. Se xaba waxatin na a li, naxan yo na maala xidi naanin xaba, a suulundena, a xa fa na ra, a ramara. <verse eid="GEN 41:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35"/>E xa donseene birin malan lugo ɲɛɛ solofere famatɔɔn bun, e xa a ramara taane kui, Misiran Mangana nɔɔn bun ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36"/>Donse maraxini ito fama Misiran bɔxɔn natangadeni kamɛn ma nɛn naxan fama ɲɛɛ soloferen bun ma.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37"/>Falani ito yi rafan Misiran Mangan nun a kuntigine birin ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38"/>Misiran Mangan yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “En nɔɛ muxuna nde sɔtɛ naxan ligaxi alo ito, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin naxan yi?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39"/>Misiran Mangan yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “Bayo Ala bata na feen birin yita i ra, muxu yo mi na naxan xaxili fan alo i tan, naxan fe kolon dangu i ra. <verse eid="GEN 41:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40"/>I tan nan fama findideni n ma banxi xunna ra. N ma yamaan fama biradeni i ya yamarin nan fɔxɔ ra. N ma manga gbɛdɛn nan tun luma i xun na.” <verse eid="GEN 41:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41"/>Misiran Mangan mɔn yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “A mato, n bata nɔɔn so i yii Misiran bɔxɔn birin xunna.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42"/>A yi a gbeti wuredin ba a yiin na, a yi a so Yusufu yiin na. A yi a marabɛri ba taa dugi faɲin na. A yi xɛma ɲɛrɛn bira a kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 41:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43"/>A yi a rate sofa wontoron kui, naxan Misiran Mangan wontoron xanbi ra. E yi lu sarinɲɛ a yɛɛ ra, e naxa, “Ɛ xinbi sin!” Misiran mangana a mangayaan taxu a ra na kii nin.<verse eid="GEN 41:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44"/>Misiran Mangan mɔn yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “N tan nan mangan na. Xa i mi yamarin fi naxan ma, fefe mi ligɛ Misiran bɔxɔ yo ma.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45"/>Misiran Mangan yi Yusufu xili sa Safanati-Paniya. A yi Potifari a dii tɛmɛna Asenati fi a ma a ɲaxanla ra. Hon taana saraxaraliin nan yi Potifari ra. Yusufu yi xun matoon fɔlɔ Misiran bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46"/>Yusufu barin bata yi ɲɛɛ tonge saxan ti nun a fa Misiran Mangan yɛtagi waxatin naxan yi, Misiran mangana. A yi keli Misiran Mangan fɛma, a yi bɔxɔn birin yisiga.<verse eid="GEN 41:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47"/>Lugo ɲɛɛ soloferen bun ma, bɔxɔn birin yi rawali ki faɲi. <verse eid="GEN 41:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48"/>Yusufu yi donseen birin malan naxan sɔtɔxi ɲɛɛ solofereni ito bun ma Misiran bɔxɔn ma. Donseen naxanye sɔtɔxi banxidɛne yi, a yi ne ramara taa gbeene kui. <verse eid="GEN 41:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49"/>Yusufu yi donse xɔri gbegbe malan alo baa xɔn mɛɲɛnsinna. A yi gbo ayi, han e fata a tɛngɛn ma bayo a mi yi gasɛ.<verse eid="GEN 41:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50"/>Benun kamɛn ɲɛɛ singen xa a li, Yusufu a ɲaxanla Asenati, Hon taana saraxaraliin Potifari a dii tɛmɛna, na yi dii firin bari. <verse eid="GEN 41:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51"/>Yusufu yi dii singen xili sa Manase, a naxa, “Bayo Ala bata a liga n ɲinan n ma tɔrɔyaan birin xɔn, e nun n baba a denbayana.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">41.51</char> <char style="fk">Manase </char>bunna nɛɛn “A bata ɲinan.”</note> <verse eid="GEN 41:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52"/>A yi dii firinden xili sa Efirami, a naxa, “Bayo Ala bata n findi wuyalaan na n nayarabi bɔxɔn ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">41.52</char> <char style="fk">Efirami </char>bunna nɛɛn “A bata n findi wuyalaan na.”</note><verse eid="GEN 41:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53"/>Lugo ɲɛɛ soloferen yi dangu Misiran bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54"/>Kamɛ ɲɛɛ soloferen yi a li fɔlɔ alo Yusufu a yɛba kii naxan yi. Kamɛn yi so bɔxɔne birin yi, koni burun yi na Misiran bɔxɔn birin ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55"/>Kamɛn to Misiran bɔxɔn birin suxu, yamaan yi sɔnxɔn nate Misiran Mangan ma donse feen na. Misiran Mangan yi a fala Misiran kaane birin xa, a naxa, “Ɛ sa a fala Yusufu xa, a na feen naxan fala ɛ xa, ɛ na liga.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56"/>Kamɛn yi din bɔxɔn birin na. Yusufu yi donse ramaradene rabi, a yi donseen sara Misiran kaane ma. Kamɛn yi sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ Misiran bɔxɔn birin ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57"/>Muxune yi fa, sa keli yamanane birin yi, e fa donseen sara Yusufu ma Misiran bɔxɔni, bayo kamɛn bata yi sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ yamanane birin yi.<verse eid="GEN 41:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxubaa diine yi siga Misiran yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1"/>Yaxuba to a mɛ a murutun Misiran yi, a yi a fala a diine xa, a naxa, “Nanfera ɛ dɔxi tun? <verse eid="GEN 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2"/>N bata a mɛ a murutun Misiran yi. Ɛ siga, ɛ sa murutun sara en xa alogo en xa balo, en nama faxa.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3"/>Yusufu tadan muxu fu yi siga donse xɔri saradeni Misiran yi. <verse eid="GEN 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4"/>Yaxuba mi tin Bunyamin xa bira e fɔxɔ ra, Yusufu xunyɛna. A yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata gaxu fe ɲaxin nama fa a sɔtɔ.” <verse eid="GEN 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5"/>Isirayilaa diine yi siga murutu saradeni, e nun muxu gbɛtɛn naxanye yi waxi murutun xɔn, bayo kamɛn bata yi din Kanan bɔxɔn birin na.<verse eid="GEN 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6"/>Yusufu nan yi yamana kanna ra bɔxɔn xun na. A tan nan yi murutun matima yamaan birin ma yamanani. Yusufu tadane yi fa e xinbi sin a bun, e e yɛtagine lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7"/>Yusufu to a tadane to, a yi e kolon, koni a yi a yɛtɛ rasan e ma. A yi falan ti e xa a xɔdɛxɛn na, a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ kelixi minɛn yi?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu kelixi Kanan bɔxɔn nan ma fa donse saradeni.” <verse eid="GEN 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8"/>Yusufu yi a tadane kolon, koni e tan mi a kolon. <verse eid="GEN 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9"/>Yusufu a xiyene fe yi rabira a ma a naxanye sa e fe yi. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Yaxune nan ɛ ra. Ɛ faxi yamanan fangatare yirene nan kolonde yi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, nxu kanna, nxu tan i ya konyine faxi donse saraden nin. <verse eid="GEN 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11"/>Xɛmɛ kedenna diine nan nxu ra. Nxu tinxin. Nxu tan i ya konyine, yire mato mi nxu ra.” <verse eid="GEN 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ wule. Ɛ faxi yamanan fangatare yirene nan kolonde yi.” <verse eid="GEN 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu tan, i ya konyine, xɛmɛ kedenna dii muxu fu nun firin nan nxu ra Kanan bɔxɔni. Iki nxu birin ma bolokada nxu baba dɛxɔn. Keden mi fa na.” <verse eid="GEN 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14"/>Yusufu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N yi na nan falama ɛ xa, a yire matone nan ɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15"/>N na ɛ kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛma ito nan na. N bata n kɔlɔ Misiran Mangan siini, ɛ mi minima be xa ɛ bolokadaan mi fa. <verse eid="GEN 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16"/>Ɛ muxu keden nasiga ɛ yɛ, a xa sa fa ɛ bolokadaan na. Ɛ tan dɔnxɛne sigama kasoon nin. Ɛ falane matoma nɛn, n na a kolonɲɛ xa ɛ ɲɔndin falama, xanamu n bata n kɔlɔ Misiran Mangan siini, yire matone nan ɛ ra.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17"/>A yi e birin suxu han xii saxan.<verse eid="GEN 42:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18"/>Xii saxande lɔxɔni, Yusufu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ ito liga alogo ɛ xa kisi. N gaxuma Ala yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19"/>Xa tinxin muxun nan ɛ ra, ɛ muxu keden lu kasoon na. Bodene xa donseen xali ɛ denbaya kamɛtɔne xa. <verse eid="GEN 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20"/>Ɛ sa fa ɛ bolokadaan na n xɔn alogo n xa a kolon xa ɲɔndi falan nan ɛ ra, alogo ɛ nama faxa.” <verse eid="GEN 42:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21"/>E yi tin na falan ma, koni e bode tagi e naxa, “En tan nan yati findixi sɔnmaan na en xunyɛna a fe ra, bayo en bata a niina a tɔrɔyaan to, a to yi en mafanma kininkininni koni en mi en tuli mati a ra. Na nan a toxi tɔrɔyani ito en lixi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22"/>Rubɛn yi ito sa a fari, a naxa, “N mi yi a fala ɛ xa, ɛ nama fe ɲaxin naba diidini ito ra. Koni ɛ mi ɛ tuli ti. Iki en fa a faxan saren nan fima.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23"/>E mi yi a kolon xa Yusufu a mɛma, bayo xui maxɛtɛn yi e tagi. <verse eid="GEN 42:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24"/>Yusufu yi a makuya e ra, a wuga. Na xanbi, a yi fa falan tiyɛ e xa. A yi Simeyɔn tongo e tagi, a yi a sa kasoon na e yɛɛ xɔri.<verse eid="GEN 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25"/>Yusufu yi yamarin fi, a muxune xa a tadane bɛnbɛnle rafe donse xɔnna ra, e mɔn xa e keden kedenna birin ma gbeti sa a bɛnbɛnla kui sa fandana ndee fari e naxanye donɲɛ kira yi. Na yi liga e xa. <verse eid="GEN 42:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26"/>E yi e murutu goronne sa e sofanle fari, e yi siga. <verse eid="GEN 42:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27"/>E kɔɛɛn nadangu dɛnaxan yi, keden yi a bɛnbɛnla rabi alogo a xa balon so a sofanla yii. A yi a gbetin to a bɛnbɛnla dɛɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 42:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28"/>A yi a fala a ngaxakedenne xa, a naxa, “N ma gbetin bata xɛtɛ n ma. I mi a to n ma bɛnbɛnla kui mɔn?” E bɔɲɛne yi mini. Birin yi a kuisan feen fala a boden xa e naxa, “Ala nanfe ligaxi en na?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29"/>E to so e baba Yaxuba konni Kanan bɔxɔni, feen naxanye birin e li, e yi a birin yɛba a xa. <verse eid="GEN 42:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Xɛmɛn naxan na yamana kanna ra, a falan tixi nxu xa a xɔdɛxɛn nan na, a nxu kansun a yire mato nan nxu ra. <verse eid="GEN 42:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31"/>Nxu yi a fala a xa, nxu naxa, ‘Nxu tinxin, yire matone mi nxu ra. <verse eid="GEN 42:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32"/>Nxu dii fu nun firin na a ra, nxu birin baba keden. Keden mi fa na, nxɔ bolokadana nxu baba fɛma Kanan bɔxɔni.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33"/>Xɛmɛni ito naxan yamana kanna ra, na yi a fala nxu xa, a naxa, ‘Ɛ mi a to, a kolonma kii naxan yi a ɛ tinxin. Ɛ muxu keden lu n fɛma. Naxan daxa ɛ denbaya kamɛtɔɔn xa, ɛ na xali. <verse eid="GEN 42:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34"/>Ɛ siga, ɛ sa fa ɛ bolokada ra n xa. N na a kolonma nɛn nayi fa fala yire mato mi ɛ ra, ɛ tinxin. Na waxatini, n na ɛ xunyɛn soma ɛ yii nɛn, ɛ yulayaan liga bɔxɔni ito ma.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 42:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35"/>E to yi e bɛnbɛnle yixɛlɛma, birin ma sare so gbetin yi a bɛnbɛnla kui. E tan nun e baba yi gbetine to, e birin yi gaxu.<verse eid="GEN 42:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36"/>E baba Yaxuba yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ bata n nafula n ma diine ra. Yusufu mi fa na, Simeyɔn fan mi na. Ɛ mɔn waxi Bunyamin nan fan tongo fe yi iki. Na goronna ngaan sama n tan nan xun ma.” <verse eid="GEN 42:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37"/>Rubɛn yi a fala a baba xa, a naxa, “Xa n mi fa Bunyamin na, i xa n ma dii firinne faxa. A so n yii, n fama a ra nɛn i xa.” <verse eid="GEN 42:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38"/>Yaxuba yi a yabi, a naxa, “N ma diin mi sigama ɛ fɔxɔ ra, bayo a tada bata faxa, a kedenna nan fa luxi. Xa fena nde fa a sɔtɔ ɛ sigatini, ɛ n nagodoma nɛn sɔxɔlɛni laxira yi, nxu nun n fuge fixɛne.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxubaa diine sigatiin firindena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1"/>Kamɛn yi fa gbo ayi bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2"/>E to yelin na murutun birin donɲɛ e fa naxan na sa keli Misiran yi, Yaxuba yi a fala a diine xa, a naxa, “Ɛ mɔn xa siga ɛ sa donsena nde sara en xa.” <verse eid="GEN 43:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3"/>Yuda yi a yabi, a naxa, “Na xɛmɛna nxu rakolonxi nɛn a faɲin na, a naxa, ‘Ɛ mi fa n yɛtagin toma nɛn sɔnɔn fɔ ɛ bolokadaan na taran ɛ yɛ.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4"/>Xa i bata tin nxu nun Bunyamin birin xa siga, nxu sigɛ, nxu sa donseen sara i xa. <verse eid="GEN 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5"/>Koni xa i mi tin na ma, nxu mi sigɛ, bayo na xɛmɛna a fala nɛn nxu xa, a naxa, ‘Ɛ mi fa n yɛtagin toma fɔ ɛ bolokadaan taran ɛ yɛ.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6"/>Na waxatini Isirayila yi a fala, a naxa, “Nanfera ɛ fe ɲaxini ito ligaxi n na, ɛ a fala na xɛmɛn xa a ɛ ngaxakedenna nde mɔn na yi?” <verse eid="GEN 43:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Xɛmɛni ito nxu maxɔdinxi nɛn a gbengbenna ra e nun nxu bari kiin ma. A yi fa a fala, a naxa, ‘Ɛ baba mɔn barixi? Ɛ xunyɛna nde na?’ Nxu fan yi a maxɔdinna birin yabi. Nxu yi a kolonɲɛ ba, a a falɛ, a naxa, ‘Ɛ fa ɛ xunyɛn na?’ ” <verse eid="GEN 43:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8"/>Yuda yi a fala a baba Isirayila xa, a naxa, “A lu nxu nun diin xa siga. Nxu kelima nɛn, nxu siga, nayi en balon sɔtɔma nɛn en mi faxɛ, i tan nun nxɔ diine, e nun nxu tan. <verse eid="GEN 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9"/>N tan nan findixi tolimaan na a funfuni. I fama a maxɔdindeni n tan nan na. Xa n mi fa a ra, n fa a ti i yɛtagi, n bata findi sɔnmaan na i mabinni. <verse eid="GEN 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10"/>Anu, xa en mi yi buxi, nxu bata yi siga nun dɔxɔɲa yi firin.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11"/>E baba Isirayila yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Bayo na kiin na a ra, ɛ ito liga: Ɛ yamanan wali xɔnna nde sa ɛ bɛnbɛnle kui sanban na xɛmɛni ito xa, wudi dole senna nde nun kumin nun ture xiri ɲaxumɛne nun latikɔnɔnne nun wudi kɛsɛne nun a tinna nde. <verse eid="GEN 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12"/>Ɛ xa gbetin dɔxɔde firin tongo. Ɛ siga na gbetin na e naxan sa ɛ bɛnbɛnle dɛ ra. Yanyina nde tantanna na a ra. <verse eid="GEN 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13"/>Ɛ ɛ xunyɛn tongo, ɛ xɛtɛ xɛmɛni ito fɛma. <verse eid="GEN 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14"/>Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna xa a liga, xɛmɛni ito yi kininkinin ɛ ma, a ɛ xunyɛn so ɛ yii e nun Bunyamin. N tan fan, xa n fulama n ma diine ra nɛn, n xa fula.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15"/>Xɛmɛni itoe yi sanbane yitɔn, e yi gbetin dɔxɔde firin tongo e nun Bunyamin. E yi keli e siga Misiran yi, e sa e yɛtɛ yita Yusufu ra. <verse eid="GEN 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16"/>Yusufu to e to e nun Bunyamin, a yi a fala a banxi xunna xa, a naxa, “Xɛmɛni itoe raso banxini. Suben faxa, i yi a yitɔn bayo nxu nun xɛmɛni itoe nan nxu dɛgema to yanyin na.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17"/>Yusufu feen naxanye fala a banxi xunna xa, a ne liga. A yi xɛmɛni itoe mati Yusufu a banxini. <verse eid="GEN 43:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18"/>Gaxun yi e suxu e sa e mati Yusufu a banxini waxatin naxan yi. E yi fa a fala, e naxa, “E faxi en na gbetin nan ma fe ra e naxan sa en ma bɛnbɛnle kui a fɔlɔni. E fama sodeni en xunna, e fa en suxu, e yi en findi konyine ra en nun en ma sofanle.”<verse eid="GEN 43:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19"/>E yi e maso Yusufu a banxi xunna ra, e yi falan ti a xa banxin so dɛɛn na. <verse eid="GEN 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Yandi n kanna, nxu bata yi siga a singeni donse saradeni. <verse eid="GEN 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21"/>Na xanbi, nxu to ti kɔɛɛn na, nxu yi bɛnbɛnle rafulun. Nxu keden kedenna ngaan yi gbetin to nxɔ bɛnbɛnle kui, nxɔ balon saraxi gbetin naxanye yɛtɛ ra. Iki nxu mɔn bata fa na ra. <verse eid="GEN 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22"/>Nxu mɔn bata fa gbeti gbɛtɛ ra alogo nxu xa donse gbɛtɛ sara. Nxu mi a kolon naxan gbetin sa nxɔ bɛnbɛnle kui.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23"/>A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ bɔɲɛn xa xunbeli, ɛ nama gaxu. Ɛ Ala na a ra, ɛ babaa Ala nan hɛrisigɛn fixi ɛ ma ɛ bɛnbɛnle kui. Ɛ gbetin soxi n yii nɛn.” A yi Simeyɔn namini e ma. <verse eid="GEN 43:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24"/>Xɛmɛni ito yi e raso Yusufu a banxin kui. A yi igen so e yii, e yi e sanne maxa, a yi balon so e sofanle yii. <verse eid="GEN 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25"/>E yi sanba seni tɔn benun Yusufu xa so waxatin naxan yi yanyi tagini, bayo e bata yi a mɛ e e dɛgema mɛnna nin.<verse eid="GEN 43:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26"/>Yusufu to so banxini, e yi sanba seene so a yii, e e xinbi sin a yɛtagi. <verse eid="GEN 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27"/>Yusufu yi e maxɔdin e kɛndɛyaan ma. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ ɛ baba forixin naxan ma fe fala, tana mi a ma? A mɔn barixi?” <verse eid="GEN 43:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “I ya konyina, nxu baba, tana yo mi a ma. A mɔn barixi.” E mɔn yi e xinbi sin a bun. <verse eid="GEN 43:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29"/>Yusufu yi a yɛɛn nakeli, a yi a xunyɛn Bunyamin to, a nga a diina. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Ito nan ɛ xunyɛn na ɛ naxan ma fe fala n xa?” A mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala xa hinan i ra, n ma diina.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30"/>A xunyɛn hinanna yi so Yusufu yi, a yi wa wuga feni. A yi keli, a so a xideni, a wuga.<verse eid="GEN 43:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31"/>A to a yɛɛn naxa, a yi mini. A yi a yixɔdɔxɔ alogo a xa a yɛtɛ nɔ. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ donseni taxun.” <verse eid="GEN 43:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32"/>E yi a gbeen sa a danna, a tadane fan yi dɔxɔ e danna. Misiran kaan naxanye yi e dɛgema a xɔn ma ne fan yi lu e danna, bayo Misiran kaane nun Heburu muxune mi yi e dɛgɛ yire kedenni. Misiran kaane e namunna mi yi tinɲɛ na ma feu. <verse eid="GEN 43:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33"/>Yusufu tadane yi radɔxɔ a yɛtagi e bari yɛɛn ma, fɔlɔ saran ma han bolokadana. E lu e bode matoɛ xaminxin na. <verse eid="GEN 43:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34"/>Yusufu yi e donseene so e yii. Bunyamin ma donseen yi dangu a tadane gbeen na dɔxɔɲa ma suulun. E birin yi e dɛge, e e min, han e yi wasa.<verse eid="GEN 43:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu yi a tadane mato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1"/>Yusufu yi yamarini ito so a banxi xunna yii, a naxa, “Muxuni itoe e bɛnbɛnle rafe donseen na han e nɔɛ yatɛn naxan xalɛ. I mɔn xa e gbetin sa e bɛnbɛnle dɛ ra. <verse eid="GEN 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2"/>I n ma igelengenna gbeti daxin fan sa e bolokadana bɛnbɛnla dɛ ra, e nun a murutu sara gbetina.” Yusufu feen naxan birin fala a banxi xunna xa, a yi na birin liga.<verse eid="GEN 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3"/>Kuye to yiba e yi muxuni itoe yiiba. E yi siga e nun e sofanle. <verse eid="GEN 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4"/>E yi mini taani. Koni e mi yi makuyaxi, Yusufu yi a fala a banxi xunna xa, a naxa, “Keli, i siga muxuni itoe fɔxɔ ra, i yi e suxu, i yi a fala e xa, i naxa, ‘Nanfera ɛ fe faɲin ɲɔxɔxi fe kobin na? <verse eid="GEN 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5"/>Nanfera ɛ n kanna igelengenna muɲaxi a a minma naxan yi, a yiimato sena? Ɛ bata fe ɲaxin liga na yi!’ ” <verse eid="GEN 44:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6"/>Banxi xunna to e yiren li, a yi xɛtɛ falani ito ma e xa. <verse eid="GEN 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nanfera nxu kanna fala sifani itoe tima? Nxu tan, i ya konyine mi nɔɛ na fe sifan ligɛ. <verse eid="GEN 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8"/>Nxu gbetin naxan to bɛnbɛnle kui Kanan yi, nxu bata fa a ra. Nayi, nxu gbetin nun xɛmaan muɲama i kanna banxini di? <verse eid="GEN 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9"/>I na se keden peen to i ya konyi kedenna naxan yii, a xa faxa. Nxu tan fan yi findi mangana konyine ra.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10"/>Mangana a banxi xunna yi a fala, a naxa, “Na bata fan, ɛ naxan falaxi na ra, n fan bata tin na ma. N na se keden peen to muxun naxan yii, na tan bata findi n ma konyin na, ɛ tan dɔnxɛne yi yiiba.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11"/>E birin yi e bɛnbɛnle ragodo mafurɛn, e yi e rafulun. <verse eid="GEN 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12"/>Banxi xunna yi e kui to, fɔlɔ dii saran ma sa dɔxɔ bolokadaan na. Igelengenna yi to Bunyamin ma bɛnbɛnla kui. <verse eid="GEN 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13"/>E yi e domane yibɔ. E birin yi e goronne rate sofanle fari, e mɔn yi xɛtɛ taani.<verse eid="GEN 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14"/>Yuda nun a xunyɛne yi xɛtɛ Yusufu a banxini, a mɔn yi dɛnaxan yi. E bira bɔxɔni a yɛtagi, e yɛtagin yi lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15"/>Yusufu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Nanfera ɛ ito ligaxi? Ɛ mi a kolon, a n tan muxu sifan nɔɛ feene kolonɲɛ nɛn yiimatoon xɔn?” <verse eid="GEN 44:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16"/>Yuda yi a yabi, a naxa, “N nanse falama n kanna xa? N lan n xa nanse fala? Nxu nɔɛ fixɛ di? Ala bata nxu tan i ya konyine to hakɛn xun ma. Nxu bata findi n kanna konyine ra, nxu nun igelengenna toxi muxun naxan yii.” <verse eid="GEN 44:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17"/>Yusufu yi a fala, a naxa, “N mi nɔɛ na fe sifan ligɛ! Igelengenna toxi muxun naxan yii, na nan n ma konyin na, koni ɛ tan, ɛ xɛtɛ bɔɲɛ xunbenli ɛ baba fɛma.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18"/>Na xanbi ra, Yuda yi a maso a ra, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N bata i mafan n kanna, a lu n tan i ya konyin xa falan ti n kanna xa. I bɔɲɛn nama te i ya konyin xili ma, bayo i luxi nɛn alo Misiran Mangana. <verse eid="GEN 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19"/>N kanna bata yi nxu tan i ya konyine maxɔdin, a a fala, a naxa, ‘Ɛ baba na yi, xanamu ɛ xunyɛna?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20"/>Nxu yi n kanna yabi, nxu naxa, ‘Nxu baba forixin na yi, e nun nxu xunyɛna, a naxan sɔtɔxi xɛmɛ foriyani. A tada bata faxa, a kedenna nan fa luxi a nga a diin na, a rafan a baba ma.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21"/>“I bata a fala i ya konyine xa, i naxa, ‘Ɛ fa a ra n fɛma alogo n xa a to n yɛɛn na.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22"/>Nxu yi n kanna yabi, nxu naxa, ‘Dii ɲɔrɛni ito mi kelɛ a baba dɛxɔn ma, xa a keli na, a baba faxama nɛn.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23"/>Koni, i yi a fala i ya konyine xa, i naxa, ‘Xa ɛ nun ɛ xunyɛn birin mi fa, ɛ mi n yɛtagin toɛ sɔnɔn.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24"/>Nxu to siga n baba konni, i ya konyina, nxu yi i tan n kanna dɛntɛgɛn sa a xa.”<verse eid="GEN 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25"/>“Nxu baba yi a fala, a naxa, ‘Ɛ siga ɛ sa donsena nde sara en xa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26"/>Nxu yi a yabi, nxu naxa, ‘Nxu mi nɔɛ sigɛ xa nxu nun nxu xunyɛn birin mi a ra. Nxu sigɛ nɛn xa nxu birin na a ra. Xa na mi a ra nxu mi nɔɛ xɛmɛni ito yɛtagin toɛ.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27"/>I ya konyina, nxu baba a fala nɛn nxu xa, a naxa, ‘Ɛ a kolon n ma ɲaxanla dii xɛmɛ firin nan barixi n xa. <verse eid="GEN 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28"/>Kedenna kelixi nɛn n xun ma, n mirixi a ma yanyina nde suben bata a yibɔ, bayo han iki n munma a to. <verse eid="GEN 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29"/>Xa ɛ ito fan tongo n xun ma, fe ɲaxina nde yi a sɔtɔ, ɛ n nagodoma sɔxɔlɛni nɛn laxira yi nxu nun n ma fuge fixɛne.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30"/>“Iki xa n xɛtɛ n baba yireni, i ya konyina, xa nxu nun diidini ito mi a ra, <verse eid="GEN 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31"/>n baba faxama nɛn bayo a nii lutin nan a diin na, Bunyamin. A na a to diidini ito mi faxi, i ya konyine bata e baba ragodo nayi sɔxɔlɛni laxira yi e nun a fuge fixɛne. <verse eid="GEN 44:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32"/>Bayo, n tan, i ya konyina a yɛtɛ dɔxi nɛn tolimani diidini ito a fe ra. N bata yi a fala n baba xa, n naxa, ‘Xa n mi xɛtɛ a ra i yireni, n findima sɔnmaan nan na n baba mabinni habadan.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33"/>“Iki n bata i mafan, i ya konyin xa lu diidini ito ɲɔxɔni alo n kanna a konyina, alogo diidini ito nun a tadane birin xa siga. <verse eid="GEN 44:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34"/>N nɔɛ sigɛ n baba yireni di, xa nxu nun diidini ito birin mi a ra? N mi nɔɛ n yɛɛn tiyɛ na sunun na naxan n baba suxɛ.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu yi a yɛtɛ yita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1"/>Yusufu mi yi nɔɛ a yɛtɛ yisuxɛ a walikɛne yɛtagi. A yi sɔnxɔ, a naxa, “Ɛ birin xa mini n xun ma!” Yusufu a yɛtɛ yitama a tadane ra waxatin naxan yi, muxu yo mi yi a fɛma. <verse eid="GEN 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2"/>A yi wuga sɔbɛɛn na. Misiran kaane yi a xuiin mɛ, Misiran Mangana banxin muxune yi a feen mɛ. <verse eid="GEN 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3"/>Yusufu yi a fala a tadane xa, a naxa, “N tan nan Yusufu ra! N baba mɔn na?” Koni a tadane mi nɔ a yabideni bayo e bata dɛ xara, e yigitɛgɛ a yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="GEN 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4"/>Yusufu yi a fala a tadane xa, a naxa, “N bata ɛ maxandi, ɛ ɛ maso n na.” E yi e maso a ra. A yi a fala, a naxa, “N tan nan Yusufu ra, ɛ xunyɛna, ɛ naxan mati Misiran kaane ma konyin na. <verse eid="GEN 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5"/>Iki, ɛ bɔɲɛn nama mini, ɛ mɔn nama gaxu n mati feen ma, bayo Ala n xɛxi nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra alogo n xa ɛ nii ratanga. <verse eid="GEN 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6"/>Ɛ bata a to, xabu ɲɛɛ firin kamɛn waraxi bɔxɔni, ɲɛɛ suulun mɔn luxi, bɔxɔn mi nɔɛ rawalɛ, sansiin mi nɔɛ xabɛ. <verse eid="GEN 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7"/>Ala n nasanbaxi nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra alogo ɛ nun ɛ yixɛtɛne xa kisi dunuɲa yi, maratanga gbeen barakani. <verse eid="GEN 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8"/>Nayi, ɛ tan xa mi faxi n na be, koni Ala na a ra. A yi n findi Misiran Mangan baba ra, a banxi mangana, e nun Misiran bɔxɔn birin yamana kanna.”<verse eid="GEN 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9"/>“Ɛ xulun, ɛ siga n baba yireni. Ɛ a fala a xa, ɛ naxa, ‘I ya diin Yusufu ito nan falaxi, Ala bata n findi Misiran bɔxɔn birin mangan na. Fa n fɛma, i nama bu. <verse eid="GEN 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10"/>I luma Gosen bɔxɔn nan ma. I luma n fɛma nɛn, i tan nun i ya diine nun i mamandenne nun i ya xuruse kurun birin, e nun i yii seen birin. <verse eid="GEN 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11"/>Mɛnni n ni i makoon birin fanma nɛn, bayo ɲɛɛ suulun kamɛn mɔn luxi. Xa na mi a ra i fama nɛn halagideni ɛ nun i ya denbayana, e nun i yii seen birin.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12"/>“Ɛ bata a to ɛ yɛɛn na, n xunyɛn Bunyamin fan bata a to a yɛɛn na, a n tan nan falan tixi ɛ xa. <verse eid="GEN 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13"/>Ɛ xa n ma mangaya nɔrɔn yɛba n baba xa n naxan yi Misiran bɔxɔni, e nun ɛ feen naxan birin toxi. Ɛ xulun, ɛ fa n baba ra han be.” <verse eid="GEN 45:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14"/>A yi dutun a xunyɛn Bunyamin ma, a yi wuga. Bunyamin fan yi wuga. <verse eid="GEN 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15"/>A yi a tadane birin sunbu, a wugama. Na birin to ɲan, e nun a tadane yi batu.<verse eid="GEN 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16"/>Na feen xibarun yi Misiran Mangana banxin li, a Yusufu tadane bata fa. Na yi rafan Misiran Mangan ma e nun a kuntigine birin. <verse eid="GEN 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17"/>Misiran Mangan yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “A fala i tadane xa, i naxa, ‘Ɛ goronne rate ɛ sofanle fari. Ɛ keli, ɛ siga Kanan bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 45:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18"/>Ɛ sa ɛ baba tongo e nun ɛ denbayane, ɛ fa n fɛma. Se faɲin naxan birin Misiran bɔxɔni, n na a soɛ ɛ yii, ɛ mɔn yi bɔxɔn donse faɲine don.’ <verse eid="GEN 45:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19"/>N bata i yamari, a fala i tadane xa, i naxa, ‘Ɛ wontorone tongo Misiran bɔxɔni, ɛ diine nun ɛ ɲaxanle xa. Ɛ ɛ baba fan nate, ɛ birin yi fa. <verse eid="GEN 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20"/>Hali ɛ nama mɔnɛ ɛ yii seene fe ra, bayo se faɲin naxanye birin Misiran bɔxɔni, a findima nɛn ɛ gbeen na.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21"/>Isirayila a diine yi na liga. Yusufu yi wontorone so e yii alo Misiran Mangana a fala a xa kii naxan yi. E yi fandan so e yii e naxan donma kira yi. <verse eid="GEN 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22"/>A yi domane so e birin yii. A gbeti gbananna kɛmɛ saxan fan so Bunyamin yii e nun doma suulun. <verse eid="GEN 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23"/>Se faɲin naxan birin Misiran bɔxɔni, a na ndee rate sofali fu fari, a e sanba a baba ma e nun donse xɔnna nun burun nun fandan birin a baba naxan donɲɛ kira yi, na yi rate sofali gilɛ fu fari. <verse eid="GEN 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi a tadane yiiba, e yi siga. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ nama sɔnxɔ kira yi de!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25"/>E yi keli Misiran yi, e te Kanan bɔxɔn ma e baba Yaxuba yireni. <verse eid="GEN 45:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26"/>E yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Yusufu mɔn barixi, a tan nan Misiran bɔxɔn birin yamarima.” Koni Yaxuba bɔɲɛn mi sɛwa, bayo a mi laxi e ra. <verse eid="GEN 45:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27"/>Yusufu falan naxanye birin ti e xa, e yi na birin yɛba a xa. Yaxuba yi wontorone to Yusufu naxanye rasanbaxi a ma a xali feen na. Na yi a liga e baba Yaxuba niin yi sɛwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28"/>Isirayila yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata sɛwa, n ma diin Yusufu mɔn na. Benun n xa faxa, n sa a toma nɛn.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba yi siga Misiran yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1"/>Seen naxan birin yi findixi Isirayila gbeen na, a yi na birin xali a yii. A to Bɛriseba li, a yi saraxan ba a baba Isiyagaa Ala xa. <verse eid="GEN 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2"/>Isirayila yi fe toon ti kɔɛɛn na alo xiyena, Ala yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Yaxuba, Yaxuba!” Isirayila yi a ratin, a naxa, “N tan ni i ra!” <verse eid="GEN 46:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3"/>Ala yi a fala, a naxa, “N tan nan Ala ra, i babaa Ala. Hali i nama gaxu siga feen na Misiran yi, bayo n ni i findima siya gbeen nan na mɛnni. <verse eid="GEN 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4"/>En birin nan sigama Misiran yi, n tan nan mɔn fama i raxɛtɛdeni. Yusufu nan i yɛɛne raxima, i na faxa waxatin naxan yi.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5"/>Yaxuba yi keli Bɛriseba yi. Isirayilaa diine yi e baba Yaxuba nun e diine nun e ɲaxanle xali wontorone kui Misiran Mangan naxanye rasanba e ma. <verse eid="GEN 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6"/>E yi e xuruseene tongo e nun e seen naxanye birin sɔtɔ Kanan bɔxɔn ma. Yaxuba yi siga Misiran yi e nun a bɔnsɔnna birin. <verse eid="GEN 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7"/>A yi a dii xɛmɛne xali a yii Misiran yamanani e nun a mamanden xɛmɛne nun a dii tɛmɛne nun a mamanden ɲaxalanmane, e nun a bɔnsɔnna birin.<verse eid="GEN 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxubaa denbayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8"/>Isirayilaa diine xinle ni itoe ra naxanye siga Misiran yi Yaxuba nun a dii xɛmɛne: Yaxuba a dii singen nan Rubɛn na.<verse eid="GEN 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9"/>Rubɛn ma diine: Xanɔki nun Palu nun Xesirɔn e nun Karimi.<verse eid="GEN 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10"/>Simeyɔn ma diine: Yemuyeli nun Yamin nun Ohadi nun Yakin nun Soxara, e nun Sayuli. Sayuli findi Kanan ɲaxanla diin nan na.<verse eid="GEN 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11"/>Lewi a diine: Gɛrisɔn nun Kehati e nun Merari.<verse eid="GEN 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12"/>Yudaa diine: Eri nun Onan nun Selaxa nun Peresi e nun Sera. Koni Eri nun Onan faxa Kanan bɔxɔn nin. Peresi a diine findi Xesirɔn nun Xamuli nan na.<verse eid="GEN 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13"/>Isakari a diine: Tola nun Puwa nun Yobo e nun Simiron.<verse eid="GEN 46:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14"/>Sabulon ma diine: Seredi nun Elon e nun Yalele.<verse eid="GEN 46:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15"/>Diine nan ne ra, Leya naxanye bari Yaxuba xa Padan-Arami yi, e nun a dii tɛmɛn Dina. A dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne yatɛn birin malanxina, muxu tonge saxan muxu saxan.<verse eid="GEN 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16"/>Gadi a diine: Sifiyɔn nun Xagi nun Suni nun Ɛsibon nun Eriya nun Arodi e nun Areli.<verse eid="GEN 46:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17"/>Aseri a diine: Yimina nun Yisiwa nun Yisiwi nun Beriya e nun e magilɛn Sera. Beriya a diine findi Xeberi nun Malikili nan na.<verse eid="GEN 46:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18"/>Silipa, Laban naxan so a dii tɛmɛn Leya yii, na diin naxanye bari Yaxuba xa, na diine nan ne ra. E birin malanxi muxu fu nun sennin.<verse eid="GEN 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19"/>Rakeli a diine, Yaxuba a ɲaxanla: Yusufu nun Bunyamin. <verse eid="GEN 46:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20"/>Asenati yi dii firin sɔtɔ Yusufu xa Misiran bɔxɔni: Manase nun Efirami. Asenati findi Hon taan saraxaralina dii tɛmɛn nan na, naxan xili Potifari.<verse eid="GEN 46:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21"/>Bunyamin ma diine: Bela nun Bekeri nun Asibeli nun Gera nun Naman nun Exi nun Roxi nun Mupin nun Xupimi e nun Arade.<verse eid="GEN 46:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22"/>Rakeli diin naxanye bari Yaxuba xa, na diine nan ne ra. E birin malanxina, muxu fu nun naanin.<verse eid="GEN 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23"/>Dan ma diina: Xusimi.<verse eid="GEN 46:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24"/>Nafatali a diine: Yaseli nun Guni nun Yeseri e nun Silen.<verse eid="GEN 46:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25"/>Bila, Laban naxan so a dii tɛmɛn Rakeli yii, a diin naxanye bari Yaxuba xa ne ni itoe ra. E birin malanxina, muxu solofere.<verse eid="GEN 46:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26"/>Yaxuba nun muxun naxanye birin siga Misiran yi, a bɔnsɔnna birin malanxina, muxu tonge sennin e nun sennin, ba a diine e ɲaxanle ra. <verse eid="GEN 46:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27"/>Yusufu dii xɛmɛ firin nan bari Misiran yi. Yaxuba xabilan muxune yatɛn birin malanxina, naxanye siga Misiran bɔxɔn ma, e muxu tonge solofere nan yi a ra.<verse eid="GEN 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28"/>Yaxuba yi Yuda xɛ a yɛɛ ra Yusufu fɛma alogo e birin xa siga Gosen yi. E yi so Gosen bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 46:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29"/>Yusufu yi a yɛngɛso wontoron tongo, a yi siga Gosen yi a baba Isirayila ralandeni. A to a li, a yi filinfilin a ma, a yi bu wugɛ a kɔɛɛn xɔn. <verse eid="GEN 46:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30"/>Isirayila yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “Hali n faxa fa, bayo n bata i yɛtagin to, i mɔn yengima!”<verse eid="GEN 46:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31"/>Yusufu yi a fala a tadane xa, e nun a babaa denbayana, a naxa, “N xa siga, n xa sa a fala Misiran Mangan xa, n naxa, ‘N tadane nun n babaa denbayaan naxanye yi dɔxi Kanan bɔxɔni, e birin bata fa n fɛma. <verse eid="GEN 46:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32"/>Muxuni itoe xuruse kantanne nan ne ra. E xuruseene rabama. E bata fa e xuruse kurune ra, siine nun yɛxɛɛne nun ɲingene e nun e yii seen birin.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33"/>Misiran Mangan na ɛ xili waxatin naxan yi, a ɛ maxɔdinma nɛn a ɛ wanla nanse a ra. <verse eid="GEN 46:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34"/>Ɛ a yabima nɛn, ɛ naxa, ‘Nxu tan i ya konyine xuruse rabaan nan nxu ra, xabu nxu dii ɲɔrɛne han iki, alo nxu baba yi a ma kii naxan yi.’ Na kiini, ɛ fama ludeni Gosen bɔxɔn nan ma, bayo xuruse rabane raɲaxu Misiran kaane ma.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1"/>Yusufu yi siga, a sa a fala Misiran Mangan xa, a naxa, “N baba nun n fafaxakedenne bata fa sa keli Kanan bɔxɔn ma, e nun e xuruseene birin nun e yii seene birin. E na yi iki Gosen bɔxɔni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2"/>A yi a tada suulun yita Misiran Mangan na. <verse eid="GEN 47:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3"/>Misiran Mangan yi Yusufu tadane maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ wanla mundun maxaranxi?” E yi Misiran Mangan yabi, e naxa, “Nxu tan i ya konyine xuruse rabane nan nxu ra alo nxu benbane yi a ma kii naxan yi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4"/>E mɔn yi a fala Misiran Mangan xa, e naxa, “Nxu faxi nɛn nxu xa lu bɔxɔni ito ma singen, bayo xuruseene rabade mi i ya konyine yii sɔnɔn. Kamɛn bata gbo ayi Kanan bɔxɔn ma. I ya konyine sago sa e xa lu Gosen bɔxɔni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5"/>Misiran Mangan yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “I baba nun i tadane bata fa i fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="GEN 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6"/>Misiran bɔxɔna i sagoni. Yire faɲin fen bɔxɔni ito ma, i baba nun i fafaxakedenne luyɛ dɛnaxan yi. E xa lu Gosen bɔxɔni. Xa i muxu faɲine kolon e yɛ, e findi n ma xuruse kantanne ra.” <verse eid="GEN 47:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7"/>Yusufu yi fa a baba ra, a yi a yita Misiran Mangan na. Yaxuba yi duba Misiran Mangan xa. <verse eid="GEN 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8"/>Misiran Mangan yi Yaxuba maxɔdin, a naxa, “I ya siimayaan ɲɛɛ yoli a ra iki?” <verse eid="GEN 47:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9"/>Yaxuba yi Misiran Mangan yabi, a naxa, “N ma siimayaan ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge saxan na a ra iki. N siimaya dungi naxasixin nan sɔtɔxi. A yɛtɛ mi masoxi n benbane siimayaan yatɛn na.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10"/>Yaxuba mɔn yi duba Misiran Mangan xa, a fa siga.<verse eid="GEN 47:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11"/>Yusufu yi bɔxɔ faɲin fi a baba nun a tadane ma alo Misiran Mangana a yamari kii naxan yi. E bɔxɔn naxan sɔtɔ, na fan Misiran bɔxɔn birin xa. A xili Ramisesi. <verse eid="GEN 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12"/>A yi ti a baba nun a tadane nun a babaa denbayaan birin bun ma.<verse eid="GEN 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu a mangayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13"/>Kamɛn yi ɲaxu ayi, donseen mi yi toma bɔxɔ yo yi, keli Misiran ma dɔxɔ Kanan na. Yamaan yi doyen kamɛn ma. <verse eid="GEN 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14"/>Gbetin naxan birin yi na Misiran nun Kanan bɔxɔni, e yi a birin sara murutun na. Yusufu yi na gbetin namara Misiran Mangana banxini. <verse eid="GEN 47:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15"/>Misiran bɔxɔn gbetin nun Kanan bɔxɔn gbetin to ɲan, Misiran kaane yi fa Yusufu fɛma, e yi a fala, e naxa, “Burun so nxu yii! Fɔ nxu faxa i yɛɛ xɔri bayo gbeti mi fa nxu yii sɔnɔn?” <verse eid="GEN 47:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16"/>Yusufu yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ fa ɛ xuruseene ra, en ɲa a masara burun na bayo gbeti mi fa ɛ yii.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17"/>E yi fa e xuruseene ra Yusufu ma. A fan yi donseen so e yii e soone nun siine nun yɛxɛɛne nun ɲingene nun sofanle ɲɔxɔn na. A yi burun taxun e ra e xuruseene masaran na.<verse eid="GEN 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18"/>Na ɲɛɛn to dangu, e yi fa a fɛma. E yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Nxu mi nɔɛ a luxunɲɛ nxɔ mangan ma. Gbeti yo mi nxu yii. Nxɔ xuruseen fan birin nxɔ mangan yii. Nxu gbindine nun nxɔ bɔxɔne gbansanna nan luxi nxɔ mangan xa. <verse eid="GEN 47:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19"/>Fɔ nxu xa faxa i yɛɛ xɔri, nxu tan nun nxɔ bɔxɔne? Nxu tan nun nxɔ bɔxɔne masara burun na, nxu xa findi Misiran Mangana konyine ra, nxu nun nxɔ bɔxɔne. Sansiin so nxu yii, nxu xa a rawali, nxu xa balo alogo nxu nama faxa, bɔxɔn nama rabeɲin.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20"/>Yusufu yi Misiran bɔxɔn birin sara Misiran Mangan xa, bayo Misiran kaane birin e bɔxɔne mati nɛn. Kamɛn bata yi dɔxɔ e yi. Bɔxɔn yi findi Misiran Mangan gbeen na. <verse eid="GEN 47:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21"/>A yi yamaan findi konyine ra, keli Misiran yamanan bode fɔxɔn ma sa dɔxɔ a naninna boden na. <verse eid="GEN 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22"/>Hali na birin to liga, a mi saraxaraline bɔxɔn sara bayo Misiran Mangan bata yi sariya faɲin tongo e fe ra. E mi e bɔxɔne mati bayo Misiran Mangan yi burun taxunma e ra.<verse eid="GEN 47:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23"/>Yusufu yi a fala yamaan xa, a naxa, “N bata ɛ sara to. Ɛ nun ɛ bɔxɔne luma nɛn Misiran Mangan xa. Ɛ sansine ni itoe ra, ɛ xa bɔxɔne rawali. <verse eid="GEN 47:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24"/>Se xaba waxatini, naxan yo na maala xaba xidi naanin, a suulunden nan soma Misiran Mangan yii. Xidi naaninna, na xa findi sansiin na e nun ɛ balona, ɛ tan nun ɛ diine nun muxun naxanye birin ɛ yii banxine kui.” <verse eid="GEN 47:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “I bata nxu ratanga! Nxu bata nxɔ mangana a fe faɲin to a naxan ligaxi nxu xa. Nxu findima Misiran Mangana konyine nan na.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26"/>Yusufu yi na findi sariyan na, na nan nakamalixi han to. Misiran bɔxɔni, se xabaxine xidi suulunden findin Misiran Mangan nan gbee ra, fɔ saraxaraline bɔxɔne. Ne mi findixi Misiran Mangan gbeen na.<verse eid="GEN 47:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba waxɔn fe dɔnxɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27"/>Isirayila yi dɔxɔ Misiran bɔxɔni Gosen binni. Na bɔxɔn yi findi e gbeen na. E yi findi dii barine ra, e yi wuya ayi. <verse eid="GEN 47:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28"/>Yaxuba ɲɛɛ fu nun solofere nan liga Misiran bɔxɔni. Yaxuba a siimayaan ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge naanin e nun solofere nan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="GEN 47:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29"/>Isirayilaa siimayaan fa ɲan feni, a yi a dii Yusufu xili, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Xa i wama n nafan feen liga feni, n bata i mafan i yiin naso n danban bun ma,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">47.29</char> Mɛn kaane yi na nan ligama e na muxun nakɔlɔ waxatin naxan yi.</note> i xa i kɔlɔ n xa. I xa hinan n na lannayani. N bata i maxandi i nama n maluxun Misiran bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 47:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30"/>N na laxiraya waxatin naxan yi, i n naminima nɛn Misiran yi, i sa n maluxun n baba gaburun yireni.” Yusufu yi a yabi, a naxa, “I naxan falaxi n xa, n na a ligama nɛn.” <verse eid="GEN 47:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31"/>Isirayila yi a fala, a naxa, “I kɔlɔ n xa.” Yusufu yi a kɔlɔ a xa. Na xanbi, Isirayila yi a xinbi sin Ala yɛtagi a saden xunsaden na.<verse eid="GEN 47:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48"/>
  <para style="s">Manase nun Efirami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1"/>Na feen birin to dangu, e yi a fala Yusufu xa, e naxa, “I bata a to, i baba mi yalan.” A yi siga e nun a dii xɛmɛ firinna, Manase nun Efirami. <verse eid="GEN 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2"/>E yi a fala Yaxuba xa, e naxa, “I ya diin Yusufu fama i fɛma.” Isirayila yi fangan sɔtɔ, a keli, a dɔxɔ a saden ma. <verse eid="GEN 48:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3"/>Yaxuba yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna fa nɛn n ma Lusi yi, Kanan bɔxɔni. A yi barakan nagidi n ma. <verse eid="GEN 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4"/>A yi a fala n xa, a naxa, ‘N tan ni i ra. I findima dii barin na nɛn. N na i rawuyama ayi nɛn, siya wuyaxi yi mini i yi. N bɔxɔni ito fima nɛn i bɔnsɔnna ma, hali i dangu xanbini. A findi e gbeen na habadan.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5"/>“Dii firinni itoe i naxanye barixi Misiran yi benun n tan xa fa, n bata e findi n ma diine ra. Efirami nun Manase findima n tan nan gbee ra, alo Rubɛn nun Simeyɔn. <verse eid="GEN 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6"/>Koni i diin naxanye barixi ne xanbi ra, i gbeen nan ne ra. E fama nɛn ludeni e tadane bun ma e kɛɛna a fe ra. <verse eid="GEN 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7"/>N to keli Padan yi, Rakeli yi faxa n yii kira yi Kanan bɔxɔni. Na mi yi makuya Efarata ra. N yi a maluxun mɛnni Efarata kiraan na, dɛnaxan xili Bɛtɛlɛmi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8"/>Isirayila yi Yusufu a diine mato, a a fala, a naxa, “Nde ne ra?” <verse eid="GEN 48:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9"/>Yusufu yi a baba yabi, a naxa, “N ma dii xɛmɛne nan e ra Ala naxanye fixi n ma be.” Isirayila naxa, “N bata i mafan, e maso n na alogo n xa duba e xa.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10"/>Yaxuba bata yi yelin forɛ, a yɛɛne mi yi seni gbɛma. A mi yi seen toma ki faɲi. Yusufu yi a diine maso a ra. Isirayila yi a yiin filinfilin e ma, a e sunbu. <verse eid="GEN 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11"/>Isirayila yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “N mi yi laxi a ra xa n ni i yɛtagin toɛ sɔnɔn, koni Ala bata a ragidi n bata i ya diine fan to.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12"/>Yusufu yi a diine tongo a baba sanna fari, a a xinbi sin a bun ma, a yɛtagin yi lan bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="GEN 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13"/>Na xanbi ra, Yusufu yi a dii firinna suxu e yiine ma. A yi Efirami suxu a yiifanna ra, Isirayila kɔmɛnna mabinni. A yi Manase suxu a kɔmɛnna ra, Isirayila yiifanna mabinni. A yi e maso a ra. <verse eid="GEN 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14"/>Koni Yaxuba yi a yiifanna sa Efirami xunna fari naxan yi dii ɲɔrɛn na. A yi a kɔmɛnna sa Manase xunna fari naxan yi dii singen na. A a yiine gindingalan. <verse eid="GEN 48:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15"/>A yi duba Yusufu xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Ala, n fafane Iburahima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">nun Isiyaga sigan ti naxan yɛɛ xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Ala naxan n kantanma xabu n bari lɔxɔni han to,<verse eid="GEN 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16"/>malekan naxan n natangaxi fe xɔdɛxɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">na xa dii ɲɔrɛni itoe baraka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">N xinla xa fala e xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">e nun n baba Iburahima nun Isiyaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">E xa wuya ayi bɔxɔni.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17"/>Yusufu yi a to a baba bata a yiifanna sa Efirami xun ma. Na feen yi raɲaxu a ma. A yi a baba yiin suxu, a a ba Efirami xun ma a yi a sa Manase xun ma. <verse eid="GEN 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18"/>Yusufu yi a fala a baba xa, a naxa, “Na kiin xa mi a ra, baba, bayo ito nan fonna ra. I yiifanna sa ito nan xun ma.” <verse eid="GEN 48:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19"/>A baba yi tondi, a a fala, a naxa, “N na a kolon, n ma diina, n na a kolon. A fan findima nɛn siya gbeen na, koni a xunyɛn nan fama wuyadeni dangu a ra. A xunyɛn bɔnsɔnna findima nɛn siya wuyaxin na.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20"/>A yi duba e xa na lɔxɔni, a a fala, a naxa, “Isirayila kaane Ala maxandin ligama ɛ xinle ra nɛn. E fama a faladeni nɛn, e naxa, ‘Ala xa i lu alo Efirami nun Manase.’ ” Na kiini, a yi Efirami rafisa Manase xa.<verse eid="GEN 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21"/>Isirayila yi a fala Yusufu xa, a naxa, “I bata a to, n fa faxama nɛn, koni Ala luma nɛn ɛ xɔn, a fama i raxɛtɛdeni nɛn i benbane bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22"/>N kɛɛ keden fima nɛn i ma dangu i tadane ra, n Siken yamanan nan fima i ma n naxan tongo Amorine yii n ma silanfanna nun n ma xanla ra.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxuba a dubana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1"/>Yaxuba yi a diine xili, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ malan, n xa feene fala naxanye fama ligadeni ɛ xa waxati famatɔne yi. <verse eid="GEN 49:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2"/>Ɛ maso, ɛ tuli mati n na Yaxubaa diine. Ɛ tuli mati ɛ baba Isirayila ra.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3"/>“Rubɛn, i tan, n ma dii singena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">i tan nan n fangan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">naxan singe n sɛnbɛn mayitaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">I xunnayeren dangu bodene ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">i sɛnbɛn gbo.<verse eid="GEN 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4"/>I yɛ yifuxi alo fufana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">i mi fisamantenyaan sɔtɔma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">bayo i bata i sa i baba a saden ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">i yi a xɔsi.”<verse eid="GEN 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5"/>“Simeyɔn nun Lewi ngaxakedenmaan nan e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">E silanfanna nan e yɛngɛso seen na.<verse eid="GEN 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6"/>N xaxinla nama lu e maxadini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">n miriyaan nama lu e malanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">bayo e bata muxune faxa e bɔɲɛ teeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">e bata turane fasane bolon e ɲaxuni.<verse eid="GEN 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7"/>N bata e xɔlɔn danga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">bayo e yɛngɛn gidima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">N bata e fitinaxin danga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">bayo e yɛɛne yixara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">N na e raxuyama ayi nɛn Yaxuba bɔnsɔnne yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">n mɔn yi e rayensen Isirayila yi.”<verse eid="GEN 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8"/>“Yuda, i xunyɛne i tan nan tantunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">I nɔɔn sɔtɔma nɛn i yaxune xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">I babaa dii xɛmɛne e xinbi sinma nɛn i xa.<verse eid="GEN 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9"/>Yuda, yata sɛnbɛmaan nan i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">N ma diina, i baloma suben nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">I xinbine yidɔxɔma nɛn, i sa alo yatana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">alo yata gilɛna, nde susuɛ i rakelɛ?<verse eid="GEN 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10"/>Manga dunganna mi bama Yuda yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Muxu yo mi manga taxamasenna bama a yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Han taxamaseri kanna fa waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">siyane yi xuru a xa.<verse eid="GEN 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11"/>A a sofanla xidima manpa binla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note> nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">a a sofali diin xidima manpa bili faɲin yiin nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">A a domaan xama wudi bogi igen nan na alo manpana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">a a doma gbeen fan xama bogi se ige gbeela nan na alo wunla.<verse eid="GEN 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12"/>A yɛɛne fɔrɔ wudi bogi ige gbeela xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">A ɲinna fixa nɔnɔn xa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13"/>“Sabulon fama dɔxɔdeni baan nan dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">A bɔxɔn findima kunki yigiyaden nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">A naninna Sidɔn dɛxɔnna nan na.”<verse eid="GEN 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14"/>“Isakari sɛnbɛn luxi nɛn alo sofanla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">naxan a sama a goron bɛnbɛli firinna tagi.<verse eid="GEN 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15"/>A saxi bɔxɔn naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">a na yire faɲiyaan to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">a tungunni godoma nɛn goronna bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">a xuru konyiya wanla bun.”<verse eid="GEN 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16"/>“Dan, a a yamaan makitima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">alo Isirayila bɔnsɔnna bonne.<verse eid="GEN 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17"/>Dan luma nɛn alo saɲina kiraan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">alo kosona san ma kiraan dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">A yi soon santinban xin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">soo ragiin yi bira a fari.<verse eid="GEN 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18"/>Alatala, n xaxili tixi i ya kisin na!”<verse eid="GEN 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19"/>“Gadi, yɛngɛsone a yɛngɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">koni a tan nan e rabodonma ayi e san xanbi ra.”<verse eid="GEN 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20"/>“Aseri findima donse xɔri kanna nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">naxan kamalixi mangan dɛge seen na.”<verse eid="GEN 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21"/>“Nafatali luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">alo xɛli gilɛn naxan a gima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">a fala faɲine tima.”<verse eid="GEN 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22"/>“Yusufu luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">alo wudi bogilana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">naxan tixi xuden dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">A yiine yibandunxi taan nabilinna yinna nan xun ma.<verse eid="GEN 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23"/>Xalimakuli wonle yi yɛngɛn gidi a ma xɔlɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">e xalimakunle woli a ma xɔnnantenyani.<verse eid="GEN 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24"/>Koni a fan yi a xanla suxu ken,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">a yii rafan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Yaxubaa Ala Sɛnbɛmaan barakani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Isirayila kantanmana, a kantan fanyena,<verse eid="GEN 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25"/>naxan findixi i fafe a Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">naxan i ratangama, Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">naxan i barakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">naxan koren dubane fima i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">naxan bɔxɔn dubane fima i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">naxan dii bari dubane ragidima i ma.<verse eid="GEN 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26"/>I babaa dubane baraka dangu baraka feene ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">naxanye sɔtɔma geya fonne xɛɛne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">e dangu habadan geyane se faɲine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Ala xa na birin lu Yusufu xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">naxan findima a fafaxakedenne yɛɛratiin na.”<verse eid="GEN 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27"/>“Bunyamin luma nɛn alo kankona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">Xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn fɔ a subena nde suxu, a a don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">ɲinbanna ra a a se suxine yitaxun.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28"/>Isirayila bɔnsɔn fu nun firinne nan ne ra. E babaa duban nan na ra a naxan fala e xa. A duba birin xa, birin nun a duba.<verse eid="GEN 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaxubaa sayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29"/>Na xanbi, a yi a ɲungu a diine ma, a naxa, “N fa sigama nɛn laxira yi. N na faxa, ɛ n maluxun n baba yireni, gaburun naxan Eferon Xiti kaana xɛɛn ma, <verse eid="GEN 49:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30"/>Makipelaa xɛɛn faranna ra, Mamire fɛma, Kanan bɔxɔni. Iburahima na xɛɛn saraxi Eferon Xiti kaan nan ma alogo na xa findi a muxu maluxunden na. <verse eid="GEN 49:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31"/>Iburahima maluxunxi mɛnna nin, e nun a ɲaxanla Saran. Isiyaga fan maluxunxi mɛnni e nun a ɲaxanla Rebeka. N tan fan Leya maluxunxi mɛnni. <verse eid="GEN 49:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32"/>Na xɛɛn nun na faran yinla naxan na yi, e saraxi Xitine nan ma.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33"/>Yaxuba to yelin yamarine fiyɛ a diine ma, a yi a sa saden ma. A yi faxa, a siga laxira yi.<verse eid="GEN 49:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50"/>
  <para style="s">Yaxubaa sayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1"/>Yusufu yi a yiin bira a baba kɔɛ, a a sunbu, a wuga. <verse eid="GEN 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2"/>Na xanbi Yusufu yi yamarin fi seribane ma a e xa senna raso a baba fatini alogo a nama kun. E yi na liga Isirayila ra <verse eid="GEN 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3"/>xii tonge naanin e namunna kiini. Misiran kaane yi a saya feen liga xii tonge solofere bun.<verse eid="GEN 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4"/>Saya feen to ba a ra, Yusufu yi a fala Misiran Mangana yamaan xa, a naxa, “Xa n nɔɛ maxandini ito sɔtɔdeni ɛ sabun na, n bata ɛ maxandi ɛ n ma falan nadangu Misiran Mangan ma. <verse eid="GEN 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5"/>N baba n nakɔlɔ nɛn, a yi a fala, a naxa, ‘N fa faxama nɛn. I n maluxunma gaburun nan na n naxan gexi Kanan bɔxɔni.’ N waxi siga feni n xa sa n baba maluxun. Na waxatini n fama.”<verse eid="GEN 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6"/>Misiran Mangan yi a yabi, a naxa, “Siga, i sa i baba maluxun alo a i rakɔlɔxi kii naxan yi.” <verse eid="GEN 50:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7"/>Yusufu yi siga a baba maluxundeni e nun Misiran Mangan bundɔxɔne nun Misiran kuntigine <verse eid="GEN 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8"/>nun Yusufu a denbayaan nun a fafaxakedenne nun a babaa denbayana. Dii ɲɔrɛne nun xuruseene gbansan yi lu Gosen bɔxɔni. <verse eid="GEN 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9"/>Yusufu nun wontorone nun e ragi muxune birin yi siga. Na yamaan yi gbo han!<verse eid="GEN 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10"/>E to Atadi lonna yiren li, Yurudɛn xuden kidi ma, e yi wuga gbeen ti e yi saya feene raba sɔxɔlɛni. Yusufu yi sunu a baba ɲan feen na han xii solofere. <verse eid="GEN 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11"/>Kanan kaane yi na saya feen to naxan ligaxi Atadi lonna ma. E yi a fala, e naxa, “Misiran kaane saya fe gbeen nan ligama.” Nanara, e yi na yiren xili sa “Misiran Saya Fena” Yurudɛn baan kidi ma.<verse eid="GEN 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12"/>Yaxuba feen naxan yamari a diine ma, e yi na liga. <verse eid="GEN 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13"/>A diine yi a xali Kanan bɔxɔni, e sa a maluxun Makipelaa xɛɛn faran yinla ra, Iburahima xɛɛn naxan sara Eferon Xiti kaan ma alogo na xa findi muxu maluxunden na Mamire dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="GEN 50:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14"/>E to yelin a baba maluxunɲɛ, Yusufu nun a tadane nun muxun naxanye birin siga a matideni a baba maluxundeni, ne yi xɛtɛ Misiran bɔxɔn ma.<verse eid="GEN 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15"/>Yusufu tadane to a to e baba bata faxa, e yi a fala, e naxa, “Xa Yusufu fa keli en xili ma, en fe ɲaxin naxan birin ligaxi a ra, a a gbeen ɲɔxɔma nɛn en na.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16"/>Na waxatini e yi siga a faladeni Yusufu xa, e naxa, “I baba yamarini ito nan fi nxu ma benun a xa faxa, <verse eid="GEN 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17"/>a naxa, ‘Ɛ ito fala Yusufu xa: N bata i maxandi, diɲa i tadane gbalo feen ma e nun e hakɛna, bayo e bata fe ɲaxin liga i ra. N bata i maxandi, iki nxu tan i fafe a Ala a walikɛne hakɛne mafelu.’ ” E to na falane ti Yusufu xa, a yi wuga. <verse eid="GEN 50:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18"/>A tadane yi bira a bun ma, e a fala, e naxa, “Nxu tan ni i ra i ya konyine.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19"/>Yusufu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Hali ɛ nama gaxu. N tan xa mi Ala ra. <verse eid="GEN 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20"/>Ɛ lanxi a ma nɛn ɛ xa fe ɲaxin liga n na, koni Ala yi a maxɛtɛ fe faɲin na alogo feene xa rakamali, nii wuyaxin yi ratanga. <verse eid="GEN 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21"/>Iki hali ɛ mi gaxu. N na ɛ makoon birin fanma nɛn e nun ɛ diine.” A fala kɛndɛne yi e bɔɲɛn sa.<verse eid="GEN 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu faxa fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22"/>Yusufu yi dɔxɔ Misiran yi, a tan nun a denbayana. A yi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ fu sɔtɔ siimayaan na. <verse eid="GEN 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23"/>Yusufu Efirami a diine to nɛn. A yi a yixɛtɛn naaninden to. Manase a dii Makiri a diine, ne birin yi sa a sanna fari e bari waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="GEN 50:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24"/>Yusufu yi a fala a tadane xa, a naxa, “N fan fa faxama nɛn, koni Ala ɛ malima nɛn yati! A fama nɛn ɛ tongodeni Misiran yi, a ɛ xali na bɔxɔni a dɛnaxan layirin tongo Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba xa.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25"/>Yusufu yi Isirayila a diine rakɔlɔ, a a fala, a naxa, “Ala ɛ malima nɛn yati! Na waxatini, ɛ nɛma kelɛ be, ɛ n xɔnne xali.”<verse eid="GEN 50:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26"/>Yusufu faxa a ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ fuun nan ma. E yi a senna raso a fatini alogo a nama kun, e yi a binbin sa gɛmɛ kankiraan kui Misiran yamanani.<verse eid="GEN 50:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50"/>
</usx>
